window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5001,"title":"Chapter 5001: Seduction","paragraphs":["When Commander Kong found out that Ye Jian was injured, he was even more enthusiastic about visiting Ye Jian than Major General Yang. When he saw Ye Jian, he said in his heart, ’This girl is beautiful.’ Then, he pushed Major General Yang to the side with a concerned expression. Under Ye Jian’s frightened gaze, he asked, \"Other than your leg, are you feeling uncomfortable anywhere else?","\"Do you feel stuffy in your chest, short of breath, or dizzy? Do you feel like vomiting? When you close your eyes, do you feel as if there’s something heavy pressing on your chest? Is it hard to breathe?","\"Don’t bear with it. If you feel uncomfortable, you must tell us everything. Don’t bear with it just because the few of us are here. Don’t be afraid of Major General Yang. You were injured in our military unit. It’s our negligence. If Major General Yang criticizes you, tell me. I’ll talk to him!\"","Major General Yang, who had been squeezed to the side, coughed. He was trying to tell Commander Kong that he hadn’t left. Shouldn’t he be more careful with his words?","Commander Kong glanced at Major General Yang and frowned. \"Why don’t you go out and walk around? It’s hard for her to say anything if she’s uncomfortable.\"","Ye Jian thought silently that it would be better for Commander Kong to leave.","Major General Yang was so angry that he laughed. \"It’s indeed your fault that my soldier was injured in your airborne military unit. Even if Little Ye is uncomfortable, it’s your air force’s problem.","\"Old Kong, why don’t you look in the mirror?\"","He should look at himself in the mirror and see how shameless he was... Major General Yang didn’t say the next part because Ye Jian was present. However, Commander Kong understood.","Ye Jian, who was being cared for by the two chiefs, was enduring unbearable pain. Unexpectedly, before the two major generals could leave, Commander Xia came to show concern for Ye Jian.","Commander Xia was here to show concern for the daughter-in-law of the Xia family.","In the past, Ye Jian was in awe of Commander Xia. Later on. She didn’t fear him, she just had great respect for him. Later on, Commander Xia became a close elder she respected.","Even though Commander Xia’s military rank was the highest, Ye Jian seemed to have seen her savior. Her eyes lit up.","She wanted her future father-in-law to help her out here.","When he came in and received his daughter-in-law’s pleading gaze, Commander Xia’s heart, which had nowhere to rest, was instantly filled with fighting spirit. He finally had a chance to express his fatherly love.","His expression darkened, and his voice turned cold. He chased them away. \"This soldier is injured. If the two of you want to quarrel, go outside. Don’t let the injured rest.\"","Without giving Major General Yang and Commander Kong a chance to explain, he raised his voice. \"Guards, have you arranged the car?\"","Yes, he didn’t show them any courtesy and chased them away. That wasn’t right. He didn’t even ask the guard to directly ask them out.","Since the commander was here, Major General Yang retired. He dragged Commander Kong, who wanted to stay and comfort Ye Jian, away.","After leaving the medical tent, Major General Yang snorted coldly. \"Old Kong, stop scheming. Don’t try to get close to Little Ye under the guise of comforting the injured. You can’t snatch her away!\"","\"That might not be the case. I’ll offer the best benefits and transfer arrangements. I’ll also provide her with the best conditions and treatment in the military. Don’t you think Little Ye will be tempted?\" Commander Kong wouldn’t give up so easily. He had to work hard!","Besides, he hadn’t worked hard yet.","Commander Xia, who had chased them away, said to Ye Jian lovingly, \"Commander Kong isn’t as serious as Major General Yang. Why are you so afraid? Did he say something harsh that made you feel hard at ease?\"","They weren’t harsh words. They were all good words."]},{"number":5002,"title":"Chapter 5002: Snatching","paragraphs":["Ye Jian told Commander Xia what Commander Kong said just now. In the end, she said with lingering fear, \"I feel that I’m part of Commander Kong’s plan.\"","Commander Xia laughed. \"He’s known to be a wolf in sheep’s clothing. He knows how to tempt people’s hearts. But he’s a good person. He knows how to fight for things. He said that because he wants to leave a good impression on you. Then, he’ll trap you step by step and coax you to join his military unit.","\"Last night, he specially came to look for me. He wanted me to let you join his military unit. When I didn’t agree, he targeted you.\"","Ye Jian was dumbfounded.","The chiefs of the three armies seemed to be very easy to talk to. They knew how to take care of their soldiers. From Commander Dong in the navy to Commander Kong in the air force, they were all very easy to talk to. Of course, they were all smiling tigers with deep thoughts.","That made sense. With their status, the chiefs were broader-minded and more tactful. As for her, she couldn’t handle it and could only quickly leave their field of vision.","Ye Jian was afraid that Commander Kong wouldn’t let her go. Anyway, her mission had been completed. She didn’t drag Captain Lei and the rest down. She could leave.","Of course, she could leave. Commander Xia personally sent someone to send Ye Jian back to the Vanguard Battalion. As for Commander Kong... he didn’t know anything.","Commander Kong was still discussing with Captain Lei about how to keep Ye Jian. One of the soldiers, who was also a sniper who knew how to fly, joked, \"Let’s just bring her up into the air? We’ll fly in the sky and they’ll chase us on the ground. They won’t be able to catch up even if they want to.\"","It was just a joke. However, Commander Kong was considering it seriously. Captain Lei was so shocked that he was afraid that their commander, who never acted according to common sense, would really do that. He hurriedly said, \"We can run, but we can’t hide. If Commander Xia gets angry and sends people to stop us, won’t there be internal strife?\"","Then, he glared at his comrade who was talking nonsense and asked him to shut up.","Commander Kong, who was seriously considering it, thought for a moment and sighed. \"I really want to try it, but Captain Lei is right. We can run, but we can’t hide. The idea sounds good, but it’s a little dangerous.\"","\"It won’t work with the commander, so... How about this...\" Commander Kong instructed Captain Lei with a serious expression. \"We have to start with Ye Jian. Didn’t you say that she’s interested in the air force? Tomorrow, bring her to fly. Show her a few moves and arouse her interest. Say something appropriate to make her more interested.","\"As long as she’s willing to join, I’ll definitely snatch her over!\"","In the face of talent shortage, Commander Kong was willing to do just about anything.","The plan was good. However, the protagonist had already left. Commander Kong brought Captain Lei and prepared to visit Ye Jian again. The person who was supposed to be lying in the medical tent wasn’t around. The military surgeon said that it had been more than two hours since she had left.","Commander Kong was shocked.","He was a step too late!","Commander Kong was so angry that he rushed to look for Major General Yang. However... Major General Yang had left too. Commander Xia was here, but would Commander Kong dare to find trouble with Commander Xia?","How would he dare?","Captain Lei saw Commander Kong walking back and forth, so he took the opportunity to reiterate the proposal that had been raised once but not accepted. Commander Kong, who did not manage to catch Ye Jian and thought he had been tricked by Major General Yang, brought up the proposal to recruit female paratroopers as the first thing he did after returning.","Since the army had already taken action, the air force, unwilling to fall behind, quickly put the proposal on an official occasion and held rounds of related discussions.","Ye Jian didn’t know about these things. She didn’t even tell Mr. Fu that she was injured."]},{"number":5003,"title":"Chapter 5003: Terrifying","paragraphs":["Mr. Fu didn’t come back even after Ye Jian returned to the Vanguard Battalion. Mr. Fu, who had devoted himself to work, seemed to have forgotten that his daughter wasn’t far away from him. He plunged into a series of data analysis at the end of the successful experiment. When Mr. Fu thought of Ye Jian, the wound on Ye Jian’s calf had completely recovered. It also left a fingernail-sized scar.","Xia Jinyuan bent down and poked the wound lightly with his finger. Smiling, he said, \"Another medal. In the future... Yes, there will be more. You have to be careful. It’s fine to leave a few small scars. If there are too many big injuries, it’ll affect your health and performance.\"","Xia Jinyuan knew why Ye Jian was injured the day she came back from the experimental center. As it was getting closer and closer to the time when the two of them would be leaving the Vanguard Battalion, Ye Jian continued training despite her injuries. To prevent her wound from bleeding again and again, Ye Jian applied a thick layer of sterile gauze on her wound. Even so, blood seeped out every night when she came back to change the gauze.","Xia Jinyuan had always been in charge of changing the gauze. Every time he took off the gauze, his handsome face would tense up. The pressure around him was so low that Ye Jian didn’t dare to speak.","Even though Xia Jinyuan’s heart ached, there was nothing he could do.","This path was filled with thorns. Sometimes, if you missed a step, you would bleed and break your bones. If it was serious, you would be disabled for life. If it was more crucial, you would lose your life.","They all knew this. Hence, there was no need to say anything else. No matter how much their hearts ached, they had to tell each other that they were going to walk on this path together and there was no turning back.","The recovery of the wound naturally kept delaying. It was supposed to take half a month but ended up taking more than a month. Fortunately, it was cold, so the wound could heal better. It only needed to be treated and disinfected at night. There were no signs of suppuration.","It was all thanks to Xia Jinyuan’s meticulous care.","Ye Jian didn’t feel that she was injured. She didn’t even think that it was an injury. In her eyes, a real injury was like the time when she was undercover in Myanmar and almost died on the way back to the country. That kind of injury was the real injury.","Seeing that Xia Jinyuan was still poking the wound that had already recovered, Ye Jian was a little worried. \"Are you addicted to changing my gauze and can’t bear to see me recover?\"","\"Huh? What did you just say?\"","Xia Jinyuan had bent down to check the scab. He straightened his back and raised his slender eyebrows slightly. His voice rose lazily. His dangerous aura slowly enveloped Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t know what to say. She immediately knew that she had said the wrong thing. Of course, her man didn’t want her to get hurt. However, in order to let her learn her lesson, he was ruthless enough to beat her up until she was sent to the hospital previously.","Realizing that something was wrong, Ye Jian immediately changed her mind. \"Getting injured isn’t a good thing. If I suffer, you’ll suffer too.\"","It could be said that she had a strong desire to live.","\"Be good. I’ll buy you candy tomorrow.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia was very satisfied with his girlfriend’s intelligence. It was good that she knew that getting hurt wasn’t a good thing. No matter how small the injury was, it was still an injury.","The wound on her leg had not healed for a long time. There would be a problem no matter how meticulous she was.","Hence, no matter how many injuries there were, it was not good.","The dangerous aura disappeared quietly. Xia Jinyuan bent down again to lower Ye Jian’s rolled-up trouser legs. He also gently tugged them to smooth out the wrinkles.","\"There are still 23 days. What are your plans after 23 days? Have you seriously considered the major general’s suggestion?\"","Now that she had recovered, Xia Jinyuan brought up Major General Yang’s suggestion again. Well, it could be said to be a suggestion.","Commander Kong had high hopes for Ye Jian. Coincidentally, the military unit was recruiting female soldiers from the air force. They weren’t recruiting new soldiers. They were all recruited from the air force. Commander Kong was worried that the female soldiers wouldn’t be able to withstand the high-intensity training and wouldn’t be able to endure the hardships. If someone had the intention to retreat, this would cause a butterfly effect and affect the determination of the other female soldiers. Hence, Commander Kong called Major General Yang."]},{"number":5004,"title":"Chapter 5004: The Best Show Of Love Is Letting Go","paragraphs":["This time, Commander Kong promised that he wouldn’t detain Ye Jian.","However, Commander Kong’s previous actions made the army worried. Even Commander Xia was worried. Hence, although he mentioned it to Ye Jian, he didn’t ask Ye Jian to consider it seriously.","Ye Jian knew that Commander Kong wanted to let her join his military unit. Then, she realized that Commander Xia and Major General Yang didn’t ask her to think about it properly.","She didn’t expect Captain Xia to ask her if she had considered it seriously.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and frowned. \"You want me to consider it seriously?\" If not, he wouldn’t have asked her.","\"Yes.\" Xia Jinyuan nodded. \"It’s a good opportunity. If it were me, I would agree. I wouldn’t let such a good opportunity slip away.\"","\"But the commander-in-chief said that after I return to the unit, I can learn in the unit,\" said Ye Jian. \"I know that my comrades in the unit do airborne training as well. Since my comrades are all learning in the unit, why must I go to the airborne military unit for training?","\"Captain Xia, aren’t you afraid that they’ll really keep me and not let me go?\"","\"I’m very worried, but I’m not afraid. Your goal is not to become an airborne soldier. In that case, what do I have to be afraid of?\"","\"Then what are you worried about?\" Ye Jian looked straight at him. She looked very serious, but there was a faint smile in her clear eyes.","Xia Jinyuan curved his thin lips. His slender body bent slightly along with his waist. He was like a taut string that could shoot out a sharp arrow at any moment. His eyes were smiling, but there was a familiar mischievous glint in his smile that made Ye Jian’s heart jump. She was so nervous.","His deep and unfathomable dark eyes stared at her gently. His deep and sexy voice came slowly. \"I’m worried that I’ll get lovesick after you go over.\"","He was very sweet and knew just the right words to say. He also touched Ye Jian’s heart. He coaxed Ye Jian until her eyes lit up like the sun. Xia Jinyuan’s heart itched.","His little fox was getting better and better at seducing him.","\"That’s more like it.\" Satisfied, Ye Jian nodded and said seriously, \"I thought you wanted to chase me far away, so you were in a hurry to let me join another military unit.\"","Ye Jian knew what he was thinking. Xia Jinyuan also knew why she was teasing him on purpose. He would be happy to coax her and say sweet nothings to his lover.","\"Go, Azure Bird. Your sky should be higher and wider. Your world should be wider. The air force wants you to go over, and Commander Kong really adores you and wants to groom you well. As long as you don’t want to stay, he’ll definitely let you go. Hence, you don’t have to worry about joining the air force after you go.\"","He raised his hand and gently rubbed the top of her head. Then, he reached out and hugged her gently. With a sigh, he said, \"It’s very painful to separate, but I want to let you explore the world. I don’t want to trap you by my side just because I’ll miss you and make you lose a good opportunity. I won’t be satisfied, and I won’t forgive myself.","\"You didn’t consider it seriously before, but it wasn’t that you didn’t want to but that you were worried you’d really join the air force. Now, I can tell you with certainty that it won’t happen. Definitely not.","\"Do you know why I gave you the codename ’Azure Bird’? Azure Bird symbolizes happiness and joy. It symbolizes the pursuit of dreams and hope. It’s also known as the Messenger of Happiness.","\"You have your own dreams and hopes, and you’ve never given up on chasing them. I hope that you’ll be happy during the chase. Azure Bird... continue flying. You can soar freely.\""]},{"number":5005,"title":"Chapter 5005: Captain Xia","paragraphs":["Ye Jian never knew that her codename had so many deeper meanings. When she found out today, she was so shocked that she didn’t reply for a long time. \"I thought... I always thought that you gave me a new codename because my cousin gave me an ugly codename. As it turned out... As it turned out, there was such a deep meaning. I just knew...\"","At first, Li Jinnian gave Ye Jian the nickname ’Golden Phoenix’. It was unpleasant and tacky. Xia Jinyuan really didn’t like it.","\"I truly didn’t like the codename Demon King gave you. I had already thought of letting you join the Xueyu unit. How could I let Demon King snatch you so easily?\"","Speaking of the codename Li Jinnian gave Ye Jian in the past, Xia Jinyuan still despised it. Li Jinnian was clearly someone like an ice statue, so how did he come up with such a tacky codename?","Well, it made sense. All the codenames of the water ghosts of the Storm Commando Brigade were interesting. It was like a seafood feast.","Ye Jian, who was nestled in Xia Jinyuan’s arms, also thought of her previous codename. It was indeed a little unsatisfactory, but it was given to her by her cousin. She couldn’t dislike it too much.","Xia Jinyuan hugged her and placed his chin on the top of her head. He rubbed it gently. \"Go, Azure Bird. You always thought that you were the one chasing after me. Have you never thought that I’d be the one chasing after you one day?","\"Do you hope that this day will come? I really hope that it will. I’m looking forward to it now.\"","He wasn’t worried that the person in his arms would surpass him. He only hoped that she would fly higher and higher and see the most beautiful scenery in the world.","Xia Jinyuan was constantly fighting for opportunities for Ye Jian. From the time she was in junior high to her four years in the military school, he had fought for many opportunities for Ye Jian to enter the military unit for training. Xia Jinyuan never mentioned any difficulties to Ye Jian. Every time, he would only smile and tell Ye Jian what good training she needed to participate in. He never mentioned his hard work.","Now, Ye Jian’s outstanding performance had earned much attention. When the chiefs saw her, they loved her talent. They all felt that Ye Jian was a malleable talent. They wanted to dig deeper into her potential and let her future path be wider. They wanted to benefit themselves and set a role model for all the soldiers in their military units.","Now Ye Jian no longer needed Xia Jinyuan to fight for her behind her back, no longer needed to slam the table and confront her superiors, and no longer needed to make phone calls. Back then, Xia Jinyuan had to intervene a lot to help Ye Jian learn.","He never mentioned it to Ye Jian. He never thought of using the things he had done for her sake to please her either.","Xia Jinyuan was the crown prince of the city. He had put in so much effort for Ye Jian that even Commander Xia, his own father, couldn’t imagine it.","Now, Ye Jian had finally forged her own path. Arrangements that would never fall on ordinary soldiers came one after another. Why would Xia Jinyuan stop her? How could he let Ye Jian give up?","This was an opportunity that he wouldn’t be able to get even if he mentioned the Xia family!","She had to go. There was nothing to consider!","Deep love was rare, but what was even rarer than that was the silent devotion that one gave without their lover knowing.","Xia Jinyuan was a role model among men!","With Xia Jinyuan’s support, she, who also hoped that she could learn more skills and protect her comrades, immediately decided to go to the air force for training.","This was a rare opportunity. If she missed it, she might not be able to have another opportunity like it for the rest of her life. Her lover supported her so much, so why should she give up this opportunity?"]},{"number":5006,"title":"Chapter 5006: High Five","paragraphs":["And his suggestion... Ye Jian raised her head from his warm arms and looked at him gently. \"If you’re the one chasing after me one day, will you be proud of me?\"","Captain Xia chasing after her one day? She had to admit that the suggestion really tempted her!","\"Of course!\" Xia Jinyuan replied immediately without any hesitation. He kissed her forehead heavily. \"My life’s glory and pride! I won’t feel inferior because of this. You can rest assured.\"","Seeing through her worries, Xia Jinyuan reassured her on the spot so that she wouldn’t have anything to worry about.","Ye Jian smiled. Because of his arrival, all the darkness in her life had left her. Her world was always bright now.","He was her sunshine and warmth for the rest of her life!","The warm sunlight shone gently on Ye Jian’s smiling face. Her beautiful face that was bathed in the sunlight was like a pearl with all the dust washed away. It was resplendent and dazzling. \"Now, my goal is not to chase after your footsteps. I want to work hard to become you one day!\"","\"It’s a deal!\"","\"It’s a deal!\" Ye Jian left his arms and raised her right hand. \"High five.\"","\"Okay.\" The smile on his handsome face was so dazzling that even a top artist wouldn’t be able to paint it. Ye Jian was mesmerized by it.","\"A man’s charm is really eye-catching. I’ll go through fire and water just to make you smile!\" Ye Jian, who had grown bold, blatantly teased Xia Jinyuan. She didn’t feel any pressure when teasing her own man.","Xia Jinyuan laughed softly for a long time. Well, it was not bad that his lover was attracted to his beauty.","When Ye Jian told Major General Yang, Major General Yang almost threw the phone in his hand away. \"Ye Jian, do you really want to go over? Are you willing to wait two years? What about Xia Jinyuan? Did you discuss it with him?\"","\"Captain Xia asked me to go over.\"","\"He wants you to go over?\" Major General Yang was surprised. This wasn’t his style!","When he knew that Little Ye needed to report to the Vanguard Battalion and that she could only go to the Xueyu unit half a year later, Xia Jinyuan kicked up a big fuss. Major General Yang even started getting headaches whenever he received calls from Xia Jinyuan. Now that Ye Jian would have to be away for two years, he was actually willing to let her go?","He even hoped that she would go?","Ye Jian heard Major General Yang’s surprise and smiled. She nodded and replied, \"Yes, Captain Xia really wants me to go over. I hope that I can go over too. After all, not everyone has such a good opportunity. Don’t you think so?\"","In two years, she would definitely work hard to return to the team as soon as possible.","If possible, she hoped to work hard to turn two years into one year.","On the other side, Major General Yang nodded slightly. Not everyone could get this kind of opportunity. He was afraid that she would change her mind halfway.","After thinking for a moment, Major General Yang said in a low voice, \"Commander Kong knows that you can’t go over immediately because you’re carrying out a mission now. Their selection hasn’t ended yet. The fastest time is a month later. How about this? Think about it carefully and consider it carefully. After confirming that you’ll definitely go over, I’ll report to the commander-in-chief. What do you think?\"","Commander Kong wasn’t in a hurry to wait for a reply, so Ye Jian didn’t ask Major General Yang to report it immediately.","The fastest time was a month later... That was good too. A month later, her mission would end and the two parties would be able to meet.","After hanging up, Major General Yang immediately called Xia Jinyuan. He couldn’t believe that this fellow, who couldn’t bear to be separated for half a year, would suddenly be willing to be separated for two years."]},{"number":5007,"title":"Chapter 5007: Assessment","paragraphs":["Facing Major General Yang’s doubts, Xia Jinyuan didn’t explain further. He only said, \"The more skills one has, the better.\" Major General Yang immediately understood why he could accept two years of separation.","Right on the heels of that, Xia Jinyuan continued, \"Do you think Azure Bird will need two years to leave the air force?\"","Hearing that, Major General was full of respect for him. With Azure Bird’s ability to learn things, she really didn’t need two years.","With Xia Jinyuan’s explanation, Major General Yang completely believed him.","After reporting to Commander Xia, Major General Yang wanted to know if the father and son had a tacit understanding and how much they understood each other. He deliberately asked Commander Xia if he felt that Xia Jinyuan would change his mind midway.","\"They couldn’t bear to part for half a year, and he pestered me until I felt dizzy. Now, they’re willing to separate for two years. Do you think they’ll treat this matter as child’s play and change their mind after that?\"","Commander Xia pondered for a moment and smiled. \"No, Little Six won’t change his decision easily. Little Ye is the same. The two of them have their own opinions. They won’t go back on their word.","\"They couldn’t bear to part for half a year, but he’s willing to give her up for two years. I think Little Ye didn’t agree at first, but Little Six thought that it was feasible, so Little Ye ultimately nodded and agreed.\"","Major General Yang really believed that although the father and son had a unique way of interacting with each other, their relationship was actually very good.","He specially called to confirm it, but Commander Xia didn’t need to. He could guess who was the one who suggested that Ye Jian could train with the air force.","\"You’re right. Little Six was the one who suggested it first before Little Ye agreed.\"","Commander Xia glanced at his subordinate who had been following him for more than ten years and said with a faint smile, \"What’s the matter? Did you want to test me to see if I understood Little Six?\"","\"Hahaha, no, no. I just wanted to know if your relationship with Little Six was good. It’s very good. There’s no problem at all. In the future, when you quarrel with Little Six, even if it looks like you’ll pull out your guns, I’ll be able to watch calmly.\"","\"You like to worry too much.\" Commander Xia didn’t blame Major General Yang. They had known each other for many years, and they were friends in private. There was no need to worry about these harmless things.","He took out a document and handed it over. \"Look at this. The headquarters has decided to assess the female soldier led by Little Ye on the 21st of March. They will also send a special forces unit from the northern military district to fight against them. All the combat subjects have been drawn up. Come and see if there are any problems.\"","Since it was related to Ye Jian, Major General Yang took the document seriously and looked through it. There were a total of 18 combat subjects. It was mainly jungle and desert combat.","There were 12 small subjects in the 18 subjects. They basically included all the subjects for the special forces assessment. It could be seen how much importance the headquarters placed on the female special forces unit.","\"Ye Jian did training for these subjects. I don’t think there’s a problem.\" Major General Yang had confidence in Ye Jian. A total of 30 tests wouldn’t be a problem.","If Ye Jian was fine, the soldiers she led would definitely be fine too.","He trusted Ye Jian so much.","Commander Xia felt that there was nothing wrong with it. \"What I mean is, do you want to make it more difficult? It’ll be better for Little Ye if it’s a little difficult and challenging.\"","\"I’m just afraid that the 20 female soldiers aren’t strong enough and won’t be able to challenge more difficult subjects.\" Major General Yang was inclined to be conservative. It was beneficial for Ye Jian to increase the difficulty and challenge. However, if the female soldiers couldn’t complete the assessment, it was very likely that this female special forces unit wouldn’t be able to be established successfully."]},{"number":5008,"title":"Chapter 5008: Confident","paragraphs":["Commander Xia had the same concern. However... he tapped on the document with his finger and said slowly, \"Look through all the female soldiers’ training assessments carefully. Then, give Little Ye a call and ask her if she has confidence in the 20 soldiers if the headquarters increases the difficulty of the assessment.","\"The difficulty level is the assessment that the special forces must complete every year.\"","\"Yes!\" Major General Yang replied. After another week, Major General Yang contacted Ye Jian.","Knowing that the headquarters wanted to increase the difficulty, Ye Jian didn’t agree immediately. She was also worried that the female soldiers wouldn’t be able to succeed.","She asked, \"Does the headquarters think that the female soldiers should be able to do better and want to increase the difficulty at the last minute?\"","\"That’s right. Half a year is not a short period of time. They were all outstanding people in their original military unit. I think it won’t be a problem to increase the difficulty.\"","Major General Yang’s reply made Ye Jian calm down. \"You mean that if I don’t agree, we’ll still follow the original plan, right?\"","If not, Major General Yang wouldn’t have specially called to ask. Instead, he would set the difficulty of the assessment and let the female soldiers face it.","The quick-witted Ye Jian made Major General Yang laugh. \"That’s right. If you don’t think it’s possible, we’ll proceed according to the original plan. However, the commander and I hope that the difficulty can be increased. As long as the challenge is successful, it’ll be a good thing for you and the 20 female soldiers.\"","Ye Jian understood what he meant, but she had some concerns too. She pursed her lips slightly and expressed her concerns, \"This concerns the future of the female soldiers. Major General, I need to ask for their opinion. If they can accept it, I’ll have no objections.\"","\"Okay, you can ask the female soldiers first. Give me an answer tonight.\"","It was 5:40 pm now. The training ended ten minutes ago, and she had to give an answer tonight... She would have to ask the female soldiers before the night training.","Just as she was about to end the call, Major General Yang suddenly asked Ye Jian, \"You’re their instructor and the person who knows their capabilities the best. What do you think they’ll choose? I need to hear the truth.\"","\"They’ll agree,\" Ye Jian replied with a smile. \"They all have a common goal. For the past half a year, they have been working hard for their common goal. They can endure more hardships than male soldiers.","\"Although half a year is not a long time and I’m not a very qualified instructor, they have put in so much effort just to achieve their common goal. They’re strict with themselves and complete the high-difficulty training that I set every day with high standards. You’ve seen some of the training. It’s even a little insulting. Those with weak mental fortitude would have left halfway.","\"But they didn’t. They accepted everything and completed every training outstandingly. I admire them very much. They have strong perseverance to reach where they are today. If the chiefs of the headquarters want to know if they can do it, I can tell you that they can!\"","Who said that women were inferior to men?","In that case, she would let them see how powerful female soldiers were!","Although Ye Jian couldn’t accept the more difficult challenges on behalf of the female soldiers, she believed that with the capabilities of the female soldiers, they could challenge the various subjects of the special forces assessment!","Her reply made Major General Yang nod in satisfaction. \"Little Ye, you’re a qualified instructor. Your existence lets them know that as long as they work hard, they’ll definitely be able to achieve their common goal. With such a powerful instructor like you in front of them, there’s no reason for them not to work hard.\""]},{"number":5009,"title":"Chapter 5009: These Are My Soldiers","paragraphs":["The power of role models was a driving force. During the four years of Ye Jian’s military school, the students in her class used Ye Jian as their role model and maintained strict discipline. Now, all the students were walking toward rather important positions, and the soldiers in their respective military units quickly accepted and obeyed them.","The military was determined to form a female special forces unit. There was no instructor more suitable than Ye Jian.","Unknowingly, Ye Jian left a deep impression on the chiefs who knew of her existence. Whenever a female soldier was mentioned, they would definitely think of Ye Jian.","Hard work would definitely pay off, and Ye Jian was a true portrayal of this.","Major General Yang reported everything Ye Jian said to Commander Xia. Commander Xia slapped the table and made a decision. \"Increase the difficulty directly. There’s no room for discussion!\"","If the instructor said her soldiers could do it, then they definitely could!","The class gathered at 7:00 pm. Ye Jian told the 20 female soldiers what the headquarters wanted. \"This concerns whether your dream can be realized. I didn’t agree immediately. What do you think of it?","\"The headquarters hopes that you can agree to it. I hope that you can consider it carefully. The training tonight will be postponed for ten minutes. Tell me the conclusion of your discussion in ten minutes. The headquarters needs me to report your opinions tonight.\"","Ye Jian didn’t ask Xia Jinyuan. Since the headquarters handed the final decision to the female soldiers, she would let the female soldiers make their own decisions.","As an instructor, she would support the female soldiers no matter what they agreed on.","\"Instructor, I want to know what you’re thinking. Do you want us to challenge a higher level of difficulty? Or do we go according to our original plan?\"","As an instructor, although Ye Jian was young, she was the backbone of the 20 female soldiers. The female soldiers felt that her opinion was very important.","\"I always like to take on difficult challenges. My opinion is that you can give it a try.\"","This was Ye Jian’s usual style. However, it wasn’t the style of a female soldier.","However, her opinion had a huge impact on the female soldiers. The extremely cautious female soldiers didn’t accept Ye Jian’s opinion immediately. This concerned all their dreams. It was better to discuss it properly.","Ten minutes of discussion was not much, but at least they could consider it comprehensively.","Ye Jian didn’t urge them. She even stayed away from them and gave them some space to discuss. She didn’t want her presence to affect their decisions.","In less than ten minutes, Yang Zhen, as the squad leader, told Ye Jian the results of the discussion.","They accepted the challenge!","\"We want to have a perfect ending after having trained day and night. In order to let the chiefs see our results, in order to let the chiefs know how hard you’ve worked for us, Instructor Ye, we’ll agree to increasing the level of difficulty!\"","Their instructor told them that the harder the road was, the more they would know their limits. The more they fell, the more they would know how far they were from their target.","Now, they just wanted to know how far they were from their target!","Ye Jian smiled. In the cold night, her dark eyes, which were staring at all the female soldiers, lit up. \"This is how the soldiers I trained should be!","\"The headquarters asked me to tell you in advance that the 21st to 24th of March will be your assessment date. The soldiers facing you are from the special forces in the northern military district. They’re all male soldiers. You’ll complete the battle with them.","\"I hope that you can defeat them and let everyone know how powerful a female soldier is! Do you have the confidence?\"","\"Yes! Yes! Yes!\" They replied to Ye Jian in their loudest voices.","March 21st. They would show everyone how strong female soldiers were!"]},{"number":5010,"title":"Chapter 5010: Information","paragraphs":["That night, Major General Yang received a reply. Ye Jian told Major General Yang that the female soldiers accepted increasing the difficulty level. They would use their abilities to tell the chiefs that they could and would do better.","Major General Yang asked Ye Jian if there was any controversy when she knew that the headquarters wanted to increase the difficulty. Ye Jian smiled and told Major General Yang that her soldiers were all valiant. Their courage was not inferior to that of men.","Major General Yang was satisfied.","Whether it was male soldiers or female soldiers, they needed to be courageous. If they didn’t even have the courage of a soldier, why would they be soldiers? They should go home early and not affect the other soldiers.","In the following meeting, Major General Yang relayed the original words of the female soldiers. The chiefs of the headquarters laughed. A colonel smiled and said, \"We’re not afraid of them losing. We’re just afraid that they’ll be cowardly. If they admit defeat, no one will be able to help them up. It’s a good thing that they’re brave and dare to take the challenge!\"","Another senior colonel smiled and said, \"These female soldiers all have a common goal. Now that the military has given them a chance to achieve their common goal, they naturally have to grab it. With their confidence now, I really feel that they can establish a female special forces unit.\"","\"The selected instructor is not bad. After half a year of training, we can see the improvement of the female soldiers. A good soldier has to be led by a good general. Without a good general, no matter how good a soldier is, they’ll be buried. They won’t even be able to fully unleash their potential. The instructor is not bad. She needs to be rewarded.\"","The senior colonel’s words made the chiefs present nod. The instructor needed to be rewarded.","\"There’s no hurry to reward her. Let’s look at the results of the female soldiers first. If all of them are outstanding, we must reward the instructor well.\" A senior colonel sitting in the middle smiled and looked at Commander Xia. \"The instructor is not bad. Well, we’ll wait for March 21st. Commander, do you want to send a message to the northern military district in advance?\"","Commander Xia, who was sitting at the head of the table, smiled and said, \"You came from the northern military district. Are you afraid that your former subordinates will underestimate their enemy and return to their hometown with disappointment?\"","The atmosphere of this meeting was very relaxed. Commander Xia was usually a serious person. When he was angry, the soldiers below would hold their breaths and not dare to say anything. Now, he was relaxed and said whatever he wanted. Everyone was in a good mood.","The main reason was that everything in the military had been progressing very well recently. Naturally, he was in a good mood.","The smile on the senior colonel’s face got deeper. \"I just need you to understand it. You don’t have to expose me like that.\"","The colonel sitting opposite the senior colonel from the northern military district teased, \"Are you thinking of leaking information? You’ve been moving around under our eyes for the past few days. I’ll call your wife later and tell her that you have to go on a business trip for a few days.\"","\"If he really calls the northern military district, wouldn’t he be telling all of us that he doesn’t have enough confidence in the northern military district? Staff Officer Liu from the northern military district will probably chase after him with a huge knife.\"","The colonel’s teasing made the smile in Commander Xia’s eyes deepen. When the meeting ended, the chiefs were all smiling. It was obvious that they were in a good mood.","The guards couldn’t help but laugh when they saw this.","It had been five years since the proposal to establish a female special forces unit. In the 1980s, there was a female special forces unit. Later, it was disbanded for various reasons."]},{"number":5011,"title":"Chapter 5011: Blood Wolf","paragraphs":["In 1995, there were female soldiers in the navy. They became famous in the navy. They were able to do anything. They were so powerful that they only needed two minutes to complete a mission. They were also quick to get into their combat formation. Their speed was not inferior to the male marines at all.","If the navy had it, the army must have it too.","It wasn’t just the army. The air force was also quickly making a move. It could be seen how much importance they placed on female soldiers now.","They no longer placed female soldiers in solely logistics, communication, and paperwork positions. Instead, they placed female soldiers who were more tenacious than male soldiers in frontline combat positions. This allowed the female soldiers to have a chance to show their skills and compete with the male soldiers.","The female soldiers cherished such an opportunity.","That was because they never thought that they were worse than male soldiers.","As for the northern military district, the senior colonel from there didn’t call to inform them of the matter. Commander Xia had said that there was no need to inform them, so how could he take the initiative?","If the old leader of the military district really found out about it, he would definitely carry his saber and kill his way into the capital to teach the senior colonel a lesson.","Also, he believed that the male soldiers from the Blood Wolf Special Forces wouldn’t lose.","The Blood Wolf Special Forces was a special combat brigade of a certain army. They were also veteran special forces of the country. Their combat strength was strong, and their style was tough. They were stationed in the north. They were good at dealing with the highlands and desert. They had made countless achievements.","Hence, the veteran special forces unit received such a heavy responsibility.","Fighting with the female soldiers...","A squad leader of the Blood Wolf Special Forces was stunned for a long time. His eyes widened. \"Are you kidding me?!\"","\"Who’s joking with you? Look at it yourself.\" The captain stuffed the document in his hand into the squad leader’s hand. \"Look at the words in red above and the ones in black at the bottom. There’s a military seal below. Who’s joking with you?\"","The Blood Wolf Special Forces was different from the Xueyu unit. The Blood Wolf Special Forces was made up of brigades. Hence, they had brigade commanders and small squad leaders.","The captain was in charge of the squad leaders, and there were three squads. This time, the confrontation with the female soldier was between the three classes of one of the squads.","The squad leader was about 1.75 meters tall. He had tanned skin and cold eyes. He would lead the team.","The special forces soldiers of the Blood Wolf unit had participated in many confrontations, big and small. They might not be able to count them all after a long time, but they had never fought with female soldiers.","It was unprecedented.","It was no wonder that the squad leader didn’t believe him and thought that he was joking.","He raised his head and looked at the words in red and black. He knew every word and understood the meaning of every sentence. Then, he looked at the seal below. It was right. It was really a document issued by the military.","It wasn’t a joke!","\"Where did these female soldiers come from?\" After so long, the squad leader couldn’t say that there was a problem with the military’s arrangements, so he could only say this.","The captain was curious too. \"I don’t know. You have to tell me in detail when you come back. I want to know where they came from too. 20 female soldiers, all female soldiers. Even the instructor is a female soldier. It’s rare!\"","\"Since it’s so rare, then send your team over. We’ll give up on this.\" The squad leader felt that it was troublesome.","The captain didn’t take the document. He smiled and patted his comrade’s shoulder. \"We discussed it last night. I’ll leave such an important mission to you.\"","It was his comrade’s fault for leading his squad out these few days."]},{"number":5012,"title":"Chapter 5012: Don’t Underestimate Your Enemy","paragraphs":["It had already been determined who would shoulder this heavy responsibility. In the end, the squad led the male soldiers of the three classes to find the other squad leaders and take revenge in the name of practice.","Bullying them when they weren’t around? No way!","How could they be tasked to fight with female soldiers? Would their delicate skin be beaten by them? They might be able to knock them out with a punch!","What if something happened?","The squad leader knew that there were still 11 days before he had to enter the desert. He wouldn’t be able to smile until after all of this was over!","After the act of revenge, the other squad leaders came over and coaxed him until he sent them away.","\"Don’t worry. Do you think that female soldiers are all weak? No! The female soldiers in the marines are brave and good at fighting. Since the military asked the soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces to fight with them, do you think that the military didn’t consider things and are really letting a group of rough men fight a group of delicate women?","\"That’s right. Wake up, brother. Do you think this group of female soldiers will be weak? No! Your fists won’t be able to kill anyone!\"","\"Old Hu, you’re afraid that you’ll kill the female soldiers with one punch. Have you never thought that the female soldiers might kill you with one punch? The consequences of underestimating your enemy will be tragic. You should think about how to avoid being beaten by the female soldiers.\"","Even the communication soldiers in the Blood Wolf Special Forces were all male soldiers. The same went for those in logistics. They were all male soldiers. No, it should be said that there were no ordinary soldiers in the Blood Wolf Special Forces.","After entering the special forces, even civilian soldiers could take on missions that required them to kill enemies. All of them had a few tricks up their sleeves and could step up to the challenge at critical moments.","This was a military unit without any female soldiers. The male soldiers had the same opinion of the female soldiers. How could female soldiers fight? They were afraid that the female soldiers would get themselves killed.","Although these squad leaders were persuading him, they actually had the same thoughts as Squad Leader Hu.","If they really saw the female soldiers as equals, the opportunity wouldn’t have landed in Squad Leader Hu’s lap so easily. No, they would have fought for the chance long ago.","In the end, the military unit was the world of male soldiers. Everyone felt that female soldiers were inferior to male soldiers. They had to know their limits when they hit and scolded female soldiers. They weren’t like male soldiers who were full of strong might.","Squad Leader Hu’s expression didn’t improve much in the face of his comrades’ advice. However, he still listened to the things they said.","For instance, what if it was a female soldier team that was good at fighting?","He couldn’t underestimate the enemy. When they went over, they couldn’t reveal their contemptuous attitude. These women even dared to fight with the male soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces. It could be seen that they had a certain level of ability.","If he didn’t take the female soldiers seriously, he might give away their advantage.","Although he wasn’t happy about it, he still took it seriously.","However, when he looked at his comrades who had ’schemed’ against him, Squad Leader Hu felt that there was sand in his eyes. It hurt. He waved his hand and chased these people out. \"Go, go, go. I don’t need your persuasion!","\"You want to see me make a fool of myself, right? Well, I won’t let you witness that! I’m going out to broaden my horizons. Stay here! When I come back, I’ll tell you how powerful female soldiers are!\"","When the other squad leaders heard this, they quickly looked at each other. They knew that their comrade, Old Hu, was really taking this confrontation seriously.","Well, he had to take it seriously. What if this group of female soldiers was as strong as the female soldiers in the marines?","They wished Old Hu a triumphant return to the team!"]},{"number":5013,"title":"Chapter 5013: Parting Is The Hardest","paragraphs":["Squad Leader Hu of the Blood Wolf Special Forces turned around and gathered the soldiers from his three classes. He analyzed this confrontation seriously and told all the soldiers in the classes not to underestimate their enemy or they would be beaten up by the female soldiers.","Squad Leader Hu’s speech made the soldiers in the three classes pay attention to him. The squad leader reminded the soldiers in private again that they couldn’t underestimate their enemy just because the targets this time were female soldiers. There would not have a good ending if they underestimated their enemy!","The special forces soldiers who participated in this battle valued this confrontation. They assumed the female soldiers were very good at fighting and were even better than male soldiers.","On the 18th, Squad Leader Hu led the soldiers of the three classes out of the Blood Wolf Special Forces’ base and into the depths of the desert.","The female soldiers who would be fighting against the Blood Wolf Special Forces not only worked hard to achieve their goal, but they also had the responsibility to change the male soldiers’ opinion of them.","This was the main point. Ye Jian even told them directly that she wanted to change the opinions of those who thought that female soldiers were inferior to male soldiers and that female soldiers couldn’t do anything big. This way, they wouldn’t dare to look down on female soldiers anymore.","Gao Xiao patted her chest and raised her chin. She said confidently, \"If they dare to look down on us, we will beat them until they remember us for the rest of their lives! In the future, their legs will turn weak when they see us.\"","Self-confidence was a good thing, but too much confidence...¦ could be detrimental.","The squad leader, Yang Zhen, had a headache. \"Do you treat the male soldiers from the Blood Wolf Special Forces as new recruits? They’re a veteran special forces unit. They’re good at fighting in the cold and in deserts. Their endurance and perseverance are all top-notch. You think you can beat them until they remember you for the rest of their lives?\"","\"I think that you’ll be beaten until you remember them for the rest of your life!\" a female soldier interrupted the squad leader and added.","They were resting now, so they didn’t pay much attention to what they were saying. It didn’t matter if they chimed in occasionally.","Qiu Tong smiled and glanced at Gao Xiao. She said slowly, \"If she remembers them for life, they’ll be in trouble. She might even chase them to the Blood Wolf Special Forces.\"","Ye Jian couldn’t help but smile at that.","\"We can chase after them as long as they dare to show their faces!\"","\"Have we become robbers?\"","\"Good idea! Gao Xiao, why don’t you choose someone tall and handsome so that he can beat you up first before you chase after him?\"","They laughed and fell into the arms of their comrades. Their laughter was clear and bright like a bell in the wind.","The day after tomorrow was their assessment date. Tomorrow, Ye Jian would personally send them into the depths of the desert for three days of challenges. After three days, the results of the assessment would be reported to the military immediately. Right on the heels of that, the document would be issued to see if they had reached the level where they could form a female special forces unit.","As they smiled, someone said, \"After the results are out, will you know before us, Instructor Ye?\" Her voice wasn’t loud, but all the female soldiers were sitting together. Her voice floated into their ears.","The laughter gradually subsided. The relaxed atmosphere gradually tightened until everyone was silent. It was as if an invisible shackle had locked their laughter.","Ye Jian seemed to have sensed something. She smiled and replied, \"You’ll know the results before me.\"","That was because at that time, she would have already left the Vanguard Battalion and the female soldiers whom she had interacted with for half a year.","The smart female soldiers immediately understood.","\"You’ll leave before the results are out, right?\" The squad leader, Yang Zhen, asked carefully. Even her voice was soft and weak.","It became even quieter. All the voices stopped abruptly. It was as if a movie had been interrupted and could not move forward anymore.","Ye Jian nodded slightly."]},{"number":5014,"title":"Chapter 5014: Reluctant","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was afraid that she would make them even sadder if she said it out loud, so she just nodded.","\"Then... will you still be here during our assessment?\" a deputy squad leader asked softly. She even grabbed the hand of a female soldier beside her. She was a little flustered.","The atmosphere was so heavy that it was as if a rock was pressing on everyone’s heads. There was no smile on their faces anymore. They looked at their instructor nervously. The question that they had been avoiding on purpose was going to be answered. Before she even left, they were already filled with reluctance.","Actually, as the assessment date got closer and closer, the female soldiers knew that the time they could spend with the instructor was getting shorter and shorter. They were already being separated...","They knew it in their hearts, but no one said it out loud. It was as if as long as they didn’t say it, they wouldn’t be separated. As long as they didn’t say it, Ye Jian would continue to lead the team.","Now that she had spoken, their eyes turned red, and tears were already shimmering in them.","\"Why are you all unhappy? I’ve been leading you for half a year, and everyone already knew about it from the start. Now that half a year has passed, it’s time for me to return to my military unit. All of you, cheer up. Don’t look like you’re about to cry. I’m very afraid of people crying, especially...\"","What one was most afraid of would come true. Before she could finish speaking, Gao Xiao burst into tears.","\"Really... I’m afraid of...\" Ye Jian struggled weakly, trying to stop them. In the end, more and more people cried.","Ye Jian, who didn’t panic at all about the female soldiers’ assessment, panicked when she heard their cries.","Ye Jian, who was afraid, asked the squad leader and two deputy squad leaders for help. Oh no, the three of them were wiping their tears too!","She was afraid of people crying. What should she do? She wanted to cry too!","\"Don’t cry! Why are you crying? You knew from the start that this day would come.","\"Yangzhen, you’re the squad leader. You should be taking control of the situation. Why are you crying too?\"","\"Gao Xiao, you’re crying too loudly. Aren’t you afraid of attracting wolves?\"","Gao Xiao choked on her tears and replied, \"Instructor, there are no wolves here. I won’t be able to attract them.\"","Ye Jian wanted to cry too, but she also wanted to laugh. However, she wanted to escape even more.","Even so, she couldn’t escape. She had to persuade them.","The cries of the female soldiers caused a commotion, and the male soldiers on patrol heard it. Soon, Xia Jinyuan also knew that the female soldiers sitting on the training ground were crying around their instructor.","Hearing the male soldiers on patrol say that Instructor Ye was so anxious that she said childish words like ’I’ll leave immediately if you continue crying’, the company commander laughed loudly. \"These female soldiers are amazing. Instructor Ye wants to run away because of their crying.\"","Xia Jinyuan held his forehead. Just now, he said that the female soldiers seemed to have become different people. Right before he and Xia Jinyuan were scheduled to leave, he was slapped in the face.","Why were they crying?","They already knew about it in advance, so they should have been mentally prepared. Wasn’t everything normal these few days? Why were they suddenly crying?","\"It’s good to cry. It’s normal to cry. I knew that these female soldiers wouldn’t be able to hold it in and would cry. How is it, Brother Xia? I’m not wrong, right?\" The company commander wanted to go over and take a look too. They had been holding themselves back for so long. Now that the floodgates were opened, they might not be able to stop their tears for a while.","Xia Jinyuan, who thought that the female soldiers wouldn’t cry, said, \"They’re crying now. On the day we really leave, they won’t cry as much anymore. Company Commander, I’ll leave the heavy responsibility of persuading the female soldiers not to cry to you.\"","After thinking for a long time, the company commander held his breath and said, \"I want to go over and say that if they want to cry, they should cry it all out tonight.\"","Should he persuade them? No, he should go farther away from them."]},{"number":5015,"title":"Chapter 5015: Coax","paragraphs":["The company commander didn’t dare to show his face, but Xia Jinyuan did. Of course, he wasn’t going there to comfort the female soldiers. He was only going to comfort Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t manage to persuade them for a long time, so she stopped trying. She accompanied the female soldiers until they got tired of crying and stopped crying. Then, she looked at the time. Ye Jian raised her hand to wipe her forehead. They had been crying for almost an hour!","As the instructor, she didn’t cry. If she cried in front of the female soldiers, they would probably cry for another hour.","The female soldiers, who were crying like rabbits, formed their teams and left with the squad leader, Yang Zhen. Ye Jian even heard a few burps from the team.","They finally turned around and left. Ye Jian, who had been holding back her tears, couldn’t help but laugh when she heard the burps.","There would always be farewells. It was just a matter of time. Alas...","Ye Jian sighed softly and turned around. She looked at the tall figure walking toward her. In the night sky, the figure was tall and mighty. He had the aura of a mountain. When she saw the figure walking over, Ye Jian’s eyes turned red. She revealed a smile that was uglier than crying.","She didn’t dare to cry in front of the female soldiers, but in front of him, she could let herself be.","Xia Jinyuan quickened his pace and pulled her into his arms. He sighed softly. \"Silly girl...\"","His silly girl had endured so much.","Ye Jian, who had fallen into his arms, took a deep and long breath. Her voice was a little muffled. \"I don’t want to either. It’s just that when they suddenly started crying, I couldn’t help it.\"","\"What about now?\" he asked with a low laugh. His voice was gentle.","Ye Jian rubbed her tears on his chest but didn’t speak. She just grabbed his clothes tightly with her hands. Her breathing was chaotic.","Now, after seeing him, she couldn’t bear it anymore.","In that case, she should just have a good cry.","He could understand why comrades were reluctant to part.","\"Cry for a while, then\" he said gently. His strong hand gently patted her back again and again so that she could cry all she wanted in his arms.","She couldn’t suppress her emotions. It was good to cry when she wanted to.","Although it was said that there was no need to shed tears even if blood was shed, it also depended on the occasion and situation.","With Xia Jinyuan accompanying her, she could let her emotions run wild. She could cry in his arms for as long as she wanted until she didn’t want to cry anymore.","Ye Jian grabbed the clothes on his waist tightly with both hands so that she wouldn’t cry out loud. The tears that flowed out moistened Xia Jinyuan’s clothes, leaving a wet patch.","As an instructor, Ye Jian was better at controlling her emotions than the female soldiers. She didn’t cry loudly like the female soldiers. Although she was crying, she didn’t cry for long.","Xia Jinyuan hugged her with heartache. He sighed in his heart. Fortunately, the comrades from the Xueyu unit could serve until they were 40 years old. She would not face separation for a long time.","Ye Jian’s emotions were almost stable. She buried her head in his chest and rubbed it a few times. She wiped the tears on her face on his clothes. Then, she looked up from Xia Jinyuan’s arms. \"I’m done.\" She even took a breath.","Xia Jinyuan lowered his head and smiled as he looked at Ye Jian, whose eyes were red from crying and whose nose was red. He teased her, \"Did you not cry earlier because you couldn’t find someone to wipe your tears on?\"","\"My chest feels wet even when I’m wearing three layers of clothes. Do you think I’m a tool to wipe your tears?\"","\"No.\" Ye Jian sniffed and denied it. \"I didn’t want to cry at first. You asked me to cry for a while, so I couldn’t help but cry.\""]},{"number":5016,"title":"Chapter 5016: Reluctant Exhortation","paragraphs":["It was his fault.","\"Alright, alright. It’s all my fault. Now that you’re done crying, are you feeling better?\" As an ordinary man, he coaxed his girlfriend gently. He hugged Ye Jian like a towering tree, sheltering Ye Jian from the wind and rain.","He would always hold Ye Jian in his arms.","She had cried in front of her boyfriend more than once or twice. In the past, Ye Jian felt a little embarrassed. Now... she was still a little embarrassed. However, she could still talk normally.","\"On the day we leave, let’s leave secretly in the middle of the night. Let’s not let them know,\" Ye Jian suggested. She didn’t want to face separation. If she left quietly, she could still control her emotions and not see the sorrow of the female soldiers.","Xia Jinyuan smiled. \"Okay, as you wish.\"","At first, he was thinking of leaving in the middle of the night as well and wanted to ask for her advice. Since she had mentioned it herself, he decided to leave in the middle of the night.","The female soldiers were reluctant to part, and the male soldiers were the same.","The male soldiers had already voiced out half a month ago. At that time, the corners of the seven-foot-tall men’s eyes were red. It was only because Xia Jinyuan had a premonition and quickly ordered them to run 3,000 meters that they didn’t cry.","The tears of rough men weren’t like the female soldiers. The female soldiers could cry at the top of their lungs, but the rough men wouldn’t let themselves cry out loud. They would only smile until their faces were unrecognizable. Even if their faces were covered in tears, they wouldn’t let themselves cry out.","On the 20th, two military trucks left the Vanguard Battalion and headed to the depths of the desert. It was also a depopulated zone. It was so desolate that even during the day, you would feel as if you were the only one in the world.","\"During these three days, you must protect your water source. The male soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces are good at desert combat and know the importance of water sources. Once you fight them head-on, your water source will be their first target of destruction.\"","They set off at six in the morning and arrived at the gathering point at nine in the evening. They sat in the tent that had been set up. As the instructor, Ye Jian provided her combat experience to the female soldiers for the last time.","Ye Jian wasn’t unfamiliar with the desert. The combat experience she provided was all her actual combat experience. It was very useful to female soldiers.","The female soldiers listened attentively and memorized every word Ye Jian said.","\"You must choose a good place to rest at night. Choosing a topography where you can attack and defend is the first priority. Go for a crescent moon topography, a high-up and low-down terrain, or a terrain with cover at the back. Arrange for three people to stand guard. It can be divided into three shifts, with a total of nine people—two open sentries, and one hidden sentry. When resting, you also need to arrange open sentries and hidden sentries. When fighting, you must also divide the combat forces into two waves. The desert has complex terrain and diverse combat methods. The hidden sentries will always be your reserve force and backup. Do you understand?\"","\"We understand!\"","\"We understand!\"","\"We understand!\"","\"Now, let’s talk about your division of labor. Gao Xiao, Qiu Tong, Fu Linghua, Wang Yue’er, the four of you will be the main attacking force...\"","It was late at night. Ye Jian, who was about to leave, was still making serious arrangements. She knew how much effort the female soldiers in front of her had put in to become special forces soldiers and to establish the first female special forces unit in the country. Hence, she had to use her own ability to push them forward so that they could realize their dreams.","Now, their dream was right in front of them. Their goal was right in front of them. She was just waiting for them to achieve it!"]},{"number":5017,"title":"Chapter 5017: Confrontation","paragraphs":["\"The male soldiers of the Blood Wolf unit are very good at sneak attacks. Instead of waiting for death, it’s better to take the initiative to attack. If you find the male soldiers’ traces during the night march and confirm their direction of movement, you can attack directly if you know their movements. Of course, you have to rule out the possibility that they’re deliberately luring you into the trap. At this time, you must first determine whether it is a trap. You can’t act rashly. Gao Xiao, you’re the most impatient. Qiu Tong, you’re calm, so watch her closely.\"","\"Yes, Instructor!\" Qiu Tong replied seriously.","Gao Xiao replied seriously, \"Rest assured, Instructor. I won’t drag the class down.\"","\"I believe that you can do better.\" Ye Jian smiled at her. Her eyes were filled with encouragement. Then, she looked at all the female soldiers and smiled. \"I believe that you’ll do better. Your dream has bloomed. Your goal is in front of you. You’ll definitely hold on to this rare and only chance!\"","Her voice wasn’t loud. It was clear and light like a stream flowing in a mountain. It was so calm and majestic like a waterfall from a cliff.","Looking into her eyes, the female soldiers felt trust. Listening to her voice, the female soldiers felt power. Listening to every word she said, the female soldiers felt passion.","They were trusted, had the strength, and were filled with passion for the future. They believed that they could do it!","20 hands stretched out. One was placed on the back of the other’s hand. In the end, Ye Jian placed her hand on the top, on the back of the squad leader, Yang Zhen’s, hand. \"I wish you success. I wish you no more regrets! I wish you success!\"","They pressed down hard with their hands and let go at the same time. They would fight for their dreams and goals!","The male soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces finally arrived at the gathering point. They saw the tent erected at the gathering point. It was midnight.","They couldn’t drive into the gathering point. After the male soldiers got out of the car, Squad Leader Hu strode toward the Jeep on the road in front. Before he could get close, the door of the Jeep opened and someone stepped out with a pair of straight and slender legs.","Xia Jinyuan got out of the Jeep and heard footsteps approaching. He looked up and saw Squad Leader Hu walking toward him. Company Commander Zhu, who was sitting in the passenger seat, got out of the Jeep and strode toward Squad Leader Hu.","In the afternoon, Squad Leader Hu arrived at the Vanguard Battalion with the male soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces. After a short rest and replenishment, they set off again. They only arrived now.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t receive Squad Leader Hu and the other soldiers. He came to fetch Ye Jian.","They had agreed that they would leave secretly in the middle of the night. Naturally, he had to come and fetch Ye Jian.","Looking at the two figures that were already chatting, Xia Jinyuan looked in the direction of the gathering point. He guessed that... the little fox, who knew that they would be leaving after this, must be on guard.","The confrontation would start in a few hours. She would definitely let the female soldiers conserve their energy. She would rather work harder herself.","At 4:50 am, the two sides would gather first and have a short conversation. At 5:00 am, they would enter the depths of the desert and start a face-to-face confrontation tomorrow. After the competition ended, they would immediately start the confrontation to capture the other side.","Company Commander Zhu, who was in charge of receiving them, led Squad Leader Hu and the rest of the soldiers to the gathering point where they needed to climb over a small mountain. After climbing up, Squad Leader Hu glanced at the tent erected under the small mountain. His gaze landed on the female soldiers guarding outside. Then... Squad Leader Hu realized that the female soldier guarding the area was looking at him too.","That was because the laser point in the other party’s hand was sweeping toward him!","Before the confrontation even started, Squad Leader Hu was already shocked.","He was discovered so quickly!"]},{"number":5018,"title":"Chapter 5018: Big Background","paragraphs":["Before they even met, Squad Leader Hu no longer treated the female soldiers who were about to fight with them as ordinary female soldiers. From such a distance, even the scouts from the Blood Wolf Special Forces might not be able to discover them so quickly. The female soldier who was looking at him discovered him almost at the same time he discovered her.","Such high vigilance made him pay attention to this group of female soldiers.","He asked Company Commander Zhu beside him, \"This batch of female soldiers come from a powerful background, right?\"","\"Yes, they do have a little background, but it’s not very big. After they pass this test, they’ll have a bigger background,\" Company Commander Zhu replied with a smile. The red laser point of the rifle swept toward them. It could be seen that the female soldier who was keeping watch had already discovered them.","Not bad, it was a good start.","It was said that there were no poor soldiers under an able general. With Instructor Ye’s strength, it was impossible for her to groom a group of weak soldiers.","Look, the show had already started before it even officially started.","Captain Hu was confused. So, were their backgrounds big or small?","\"Can you tell me their backgrounds directly? I’ve already brought the soldiers here. You don’t have to worry about us running away at the last minute.\"","It was better to know the other party’s background. Although he already thought that the female soldiers wouldn’t be easy to deal with before he came, he still wanted to confirm the truth.","That way, he would know for sure.","\"Haha, do you feel that the female soldiers are not easy to deal with? Brother, these female soldiers are not easy to deal with. If not, there’s no need for the Blood Wolf Special Forces to do anything.","\"Brother, let me remind you. Don’t underestimate them. They’re all powerful. Not all the soldiers under me can be compared to you, but there are a few brave ones. However, they didn’t gain much advantage against them.\"","After seeing the changes in the female soldiers, Company Commander Zhu felt that the female soldiers were really powerful. He felt that he couldn’t underestimate them just because they were female soldiers.","If they underestimated the female soldiers, they would be slapped in the face by the female soldiers at any moment.","When Squad Leader Hu heard this, he immediately verified his speculation regarding the female soldiers.","But to know just how difficult they were to deal with, he would only know after trying.","Squad Leader Hu started to look forward to it. He and his team had fought many times, but they had never fought with female soldiers. And this was a team that was fully composed of female soldiers.","Interesting, interesting!","Squad Leader Hu, who was looking forward to it, looked down on his comrades who voted for him to take on this mission when he wasn’t around.","Ha, a bunch of ignorant fellows. When he returned, he would make them envious!","The company commander didn’t recognize the female soldier who discovered them immediately, but Xia Jinyuan recognized her. From such a distance, there was only a blurry shadow on the sentry post. Even so, Xia Jinyuan still recognized who it was at first glance.","Just as he had guessed, his silly girl was indeed at the sentry post.","She didn’t tell the female soldiers how reluctant she was, but she kept using her actions to tell them how reluctant she was as an instructor.","She hoped that the female soldiers would understand her.","After coming down from the small mountain, Squad Leader Hu whispered to the leaders of the three classes, \"I just probed Company Commander Zhu. They’re not a group of ordinary female soldiers. All of them have some background. Later, remind the soldiers in the classes not to underestimate them. They must take them seriously.\"","\"We understand!\"","\"We understand!\"","\"We understand!\""]},{"number":5019,"title":"Chapter 5019: Farewell","paragraphs":["The leaders of the three classes nodded. They had also noticed the laser point that swept toward them just now. Although the red dot didn’t shine on them, the red dot... was still shining in their direction.","At the foot of the mountain, Ye Jian looked at the small black dots in front of her that were gradually getting bigger. The deputy squad leaders who were keeping watch with her entered the tent and woke up the female soldiers who were already awake.","When the male soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces approached, 20 female soldiers stood neatly in the small empty space in front of the tent. All of them were holding guns and looking at them seriously, making them feel pressured.","They were not ordinary female soldiers. These female soldiers were definitely not ordinary.","The male soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces were all tense. Even their footsteps became stronger. The female soldiers’ aura was so powerful. How could they fall behind?","Ye Jian’s gaze never landed on Xia Jinyuan. Her gaze was always on Squad Leader Hu. When he walked closer, her gaze slowly landed on Xia Jinyuan. The two of them looked at each other and nodded slightly as a greeting.","She knew why he came.","\"Instructor Ye, this is Squad Leader Hu. These three are the leaders of the three classes in Squad Leader Hu’s team.\" Company Commander Zhu introduced everyone to each other. \"This is Instructor Ye from our female soldier class. Behind her are the female soldiers who will be fighting with the soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces tomorrow.\"","\"Hello.\"","\"Hello.\"","Ye Jian and Squad Leader Hu reached out their hands at the same time and retracted their hands at the same time. The male soldiers lined up and walked over to shake hands with all the female soldiers.","Before the confrontation started, everyone was polite. There was no need to confront each other directly.","At the moment, everyone was from the same military unit. They would only become ’enemies’ tomorrow.","The male soldiers shook hands with the female soldiers one by one. When they gathered, the male soldiers looked at each other silently. Some male soldiers even touched their thumbs and forefingers secretly.","It meant that when they shook hands, they could feel the thick calluses between the female soldiers’ fingers and palms. Those were gun calluses that only appeared when they held guns often.","Although they didn’t touch or see the base of their thumbs, there were thick calluses on their palms and fingertips, so the calluses on the base of their thumbs were probably not thin either.","It was common for female soldiers to hold guns, but it was rare for female soldiers to have thick gun calluses.","The soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces communicated secretly. The female soldiers were the same. Gao Xiao said softly, \"I think I feel killing intent.\"","\"Don’t talk,\" Qiu Tong reminded her. Gao Xiao wasn’t the only one who felt this way. She felt the same way too. The other female soldiers felt the same way too.","Their expressions gradually tightened. They knew that a tough battle was waiting for them.","After a simple introduction, the male soldiers took the time to set up their tents. The female soldiers wanted to help, but the male soldiers smiled and rejected them. Ye Jian asked the female soldiers to return to their tent to rest. She left two female soldiers to stand guard and walked out of the tent.","The sentinel was the squad leader, Yang Zhen. When she saw Ye Jian coming out of the tent, her heart tightened and she couldn’t help but shout, \"Instructor Ye.\" She seemed to have sensed something.","Ye Jian stopped and stood face to face with her. \"The confrontation will start tomorrow. As an instructor, I can’t help you much. It’s up to you.\"","As she spoke, she helped Yang Zhen to tidy up. \"You’re the squad leader and a veteran. You have to take good care of every comrade in your class. If there’s anything, you have to deal with it in time. You can’t drag it out and lose your prestige.","She finished tidying Yang Zhen’s clothes and patted her shoulder gently. Then, she investigated Yang Zhen’s posture when she held the gun. \"As the squad leader, you’re the backbone of the class. You can’t panic when something happens. If you panic, it means that your heart is in a mess. Do you understand?","\"You’ve already reached this point. Just do your best tomorrow. There’s no need to feel any psychological pressure anymore. Turn the pressure into motivation and do something to let the military know your strength. I’ll wait for your news.","\"I’ll have a chat with Company Commander Zhu in front. I’ll come back later.\"","Yang Zhen was already in tears. However, she was a sentinel now. She couldn’t cry.","She really wanted to ask how late Ye Jian would be coming back, but she didn’t have the courage to..."]},{"number":5020,"title":"Chapter 5020: The Female Soldier’s Sonorous Voices","paragraphs":["There were some things that she knew in her heart. If she said it out loud, it would only add to her sorrow. Ye Jian knew that the squad leader, Yang Zhen, knew that they were about to be separated. If not, she wouldn’t have opened her mouth the moment she walked out of the tent.","She knew. That was why she couldn’t bear to part with her.","After this, they would part ways. The female soldiers would have to take care of one another.","Ye Jian, who was tidying up Yang Zhen’s clothes, raised her hand one last time and patted Yang Zhen’s shoulder lightly. She didn’t use much strength, but it gave Yang Zhen the motivation to move forward.","\"Instructor Ye...\" Yang Zhen’s lips trembled. Ye JIan retracted her hand and placed her index finger on her lips. She smiled and made a shushing gesture.","Yang Zhen’s eyelashes trembled as she closed her eyes tightly. She swallowed the thousands of words that were about to come out of her mouth. Half a year... Half a year was so short. It was so short that they seemed to have parted before they even understood each other.","Ye Jian walked to the side of another female soldier who was standing guard. The female soldier was crying until her clothes were wet. She held the steel gun in her hand tightly. All the sorrow was on her hands that were holding the steel gun tightly. The veins on the back of her hands were bulging.","\"I still remember the day you said you were on the train to come report to the Vanguard Battalion. All the passengers on the train were very enthusiastic because you were a female soldier. There were even children who gave you snacks. Cheng Ke, in the future, you’ll definitely get more snacks and receive more kindness. The citizens know that as a soldier, you’re the guardian angel of the citizens. You’re their support when they’re in danger.","\"Hold the steel gun in your hand tightly and stand at every position. Even amidst the wind and rain, stand firm as a female soldier.\"","The past half a year flashed past their eyes. Their past interactions would fade into memories that would stay in their minds forever.","From then on, the past would not be reset. From then on, they might not have the chance to meet again.","The female soldier, Cheng Ke, tightened her grip on the gun in her hand and nodded vigorously in response to the young and strict instructor who was tidying her up.","She would, she definitely would!","\"Stand guard well. When you get off duty, have a good rest. There’s a tough battle waiting for you tomorrow.\" Ye Jian, who had finished tidying up the female soldier, took a step back. The smile in her eyes was like water that surrounded the female soldier. Cheng Ke felt the tranquility in her eyes.","Ye Jian turned around and left the tent step by step without looking back. After walking for about three to five meters, she suddenly stopped in her tracks. As her body swayed naturally, her hands curled into fists.","There wasn’t just one or two gazes behind her. Countless gazes were looking at her.","\"Salute!\"","The wind in the desert was so dry that there was a hint of coldness. A uniform and powerful sound was heard. The 20 female soldiers gathered as usual. This time, they weren’t waiting for their instructor to arrive. They were watching their instructor leave.","Ye Jian stopped in her tracks. She raised her head and took a deep breath. Then, she smiled brightly. She left empty-handed without looking back. However... she raised her right hand and waved in the air.","’Goodbye, female soldiers who are fighting for their dreams.’","Xia Jinyuan, who was waiting for Ye Jian, saw this, and his eyes darkened. He sighed softly.","He reached out his hand and gently wrapped it around her trembling hand. \"You’ll have to say more farewells in the future. If you invest so much in all your relationships, it’ll be harmful to your body if your emotions fluctuate too much.\"","He spoke in a low voice. His tone was filled with heartache.","Ye Jian grabbed Xia Jinyuan’s sleeve tightly with her other hand. Her back was straight at first, but now, she leaned against Xia Jinyuan. \"This is my first real training...\""]},{"number":5021,"title":"Chapter 5021: Color Of Life","paragraphs":["It was her first real training, and she trained these 20 female soldiers as if they were her own soldiers. She felt sorry for them as if they were her own soldiers. They had accompanied each other for more than 100 days. They experienced laughter and pain together...","From then on, those days would be in the past. They could never go back.","She felt sad just thinking about it.","She said in a low voice, \"I thought I was firm enough. I didn’t expect that I wouldn’t even have the courage to look back.\"","He tightened his grip on her hand. Xia Jinyuan was still the same as before. Every time Ye Jian was sad, he would be Ye Jian’s support. \"Every first time will be unforgettable. It’s also a journey that we have to go through in our lives.","\"It might be very sad or happy. Whether it’s happiness or joy, the memories together will never disappear. In the future, when you look back, you’ll know that even sad memories are a happy thing.","\"That’s because there was once a group of comrades who left the strongest impression in our limited lives. It’s unforgettable.","\"Life is very dry, and the existence of our emotions and desires are what dye our lives with colors. There are dull colors and also bright ones, just like how there are the four seasons.","\"We enjoy the colors of life and the cycle of the four seasons until our lives reach the other side. When we look back at that time, we’ll have no regrets in our lives.\"","Without a doubt, Xia Jinyuan was very good at enlightening Ye Jian. With his guidance, Ye Jian’s chaotic emotions gradually calmed down. She even retracted her left hand that was grabbing his sleeve.","Captain Xia was right. Human life was dull, and the existence of emotions and desires was to light up our lives. Whether it was gray or bright, it was because of other people’s existence that there were no regrets.","\"Let’s go. This journey has ended. Now, it’s time for your next journey.\" Xia Jinyuan let go of his hand. He could only give support. In the end, she had to rely on herself.","His Azure Bird would rely on herself to fly higher and higher until she became the brightest star.","The things she experienced in the past had already become memories. Memories could only stay in her mind and not become a stumbling block on her path forward.","\"Alright!\"","Ye Jian nodded and walked forward firmly.","’Goodbye, female soldiers.’","She would always remember them, but she was sorry that she couldn’t stop because of them. There was still a long way to go. There were still many people and things waiting for her to experience. The four seasons would cycle until her life ended.","The slender figure walking into the darkness didn’t look back. Even though the gazes that sent her off were still there, she didn’t look back.","Her departure made the female soldiers cry like rain. She left just like that... Their instructor left just like that.","The slender figure gradually turned into a black dot. Gradually, they couldn’t see her anymore.","Yang Zhen turned around and faced the female soldiers. \"Comrades, our tough battle will start soon. Instructor Ye believes that we can do it. We’ll definitely be able to realize our dreams. Even if Instructor Ye leaves, she’ll definitely know all about us!","\"Now, wipe the tears on our faces and adjust our emotions. Prepare for the upcoming tough battle. We can’t disappoint Instructor Ye! Do you understand?\"","\"We understand!\""]},{"number":5022,"title":"Chapter 5022: Hard To Look Back On","paragraphs":["They answered the squad leader in unison. After a while, the female soldiers wiped their tears. They wouldn’t disappoint their instructor. They could definitely do it!","\"Captain, the female soldiers are in high spirits. We have to be careful.\" A male soldier from the Blood Wolf Special Forces, who had been paying attention to the squad leader of the female soldiers, said in a low voice. \"The sudden departure of their instructor has stimulated the female soldiers’ fighting spirit.\"","\"It’s a little strange. The confrontation is imminent. As their instructor, why did she leave at the last minute? Is it part of her plan? Isn’t she afraid that her soldiers’ morale will collapse?\"","The male soldiers from the Blood Wolf Special Forces, who didn’t know much about the female soldier class, were at a loss. There were still a few hours before the confrontation started, but the instructor, who was responsible for stabilizing their morale, actually left. What kind of tactic was this?","Squad Leader Hu didn’t know either.","\"The instructor left, but the company commander is still here. Why would the morale of the soldiers collapse?\" Although he didn’t know, Squad Leader Hu said, \"The instructor is only in charge of training. The real backbone is still the company commander. With the company commander around, the female soldiers will naturally look for the company commander if anything happens.\"","However, Company Commander Zhu said that he wouldn’t intervene in anything. He was just a mascot this time.","Well, he could be a mascot to stabilize the soldiers’ morale.","Facing Ye Jian’s entrustment, the mascot smiled and sighed. \"Instructor Ye, let me tell you the truth. Actually, I want the female special forces to be successfully formed more than you. Although our land has always been dominated by male soldiers, it’s better for the female soldiers to do some things.","\"Nowadays, the lives of the commoners are getting better and better. Tourists will come to take photos of us from time to time in depopulated zones like the desert. We male soldiers are all straightforward and rough people. You know that the military unit is tough. If you’re wrong, you’re wrong. We won’t tolerate your nonsense. Hence, sometimes, when tourists meet us, they’re quite unfortunate.","\"With the female soldiers around, their methods will be much gentler. You know what happened last year. Something almost happened because there were no female soldiers.","\"Don’t worry. Since I’m here, I’ll definitely keep an eye on the female soldiers and encourage them. If there are any problems, I’ll definitely resolve them in time and not delay the female soldiers.","\"Alas, actually, I want you to stay too. I just don’t understand why the military wants you to leave at this time. Won’t the female soldiers lose their backbone? There’s no hurry to wean them off, right?\"","Xia Jinyuan coughed lightly. He thought that the company commander’s last sentence was a little crude. He was worried that Ye Jian would feel awkward.","Ye Jian did feel a little awkward when she heard that. She smiled and said, \"I can understand why the military asked me to leave at this time. They want to see the female soldiers’ reaction.","\"It doesn’t matter if an instructor like me is present or not. If their strength is limited to me being present, it’ll be troublesome.","\"It’ll be perfect if I can stimulate their potential with my departure.\"","\"If that’s the case, as the company commander, I can rest assured!\" As he spoke, he looked at his watch. It was getting late. \"It’s getting late. Captain Xia and you still have to take turns driving. I’ll send you off here. If there’s a chance... we’ll meet again.","\"I don’t know if there’s a chance,\" the company commander added sadly.","Ye Jian nodded. \"Of course, there’s a chance. If there’s a chance, I still have to come back and visit the female soldiers. I hope that you’ll let me in when the time comes. I hope I won’t be rejected just because I caused trouble for the camp for the past half a year.\""]},{"number":5023,"title":"Chapter 5023: With Him By Her Side","paragraphs":["Although it was a joke, it was also to leave herself with an opportunity for the future. What if she could come back to visit the female soldiers in the future?","When the company commander heard this, he had a serious expression on his face and said very seriously, \"I’ll welcome you from five kilometers away. I just hope that you can come to the Vanguard Battalion more often to provide guidance.\"","The company commander meant what he said. He really hoped that Ye Jian would come to the Vanguard Battalion more often.","After sending Ye Jian to the car, the company commander placed one hand on the car door and leaned over. He said, \"When you’re free, please definitely go back to the Vanguard Battalion to see your old comrades in your old military unit. Although we only interacted for half a year, you’ll always be a member of the Vanguard Battalion. The Vanguard Battalion will always welcome you.\"","\"As long as there’s a chance, I’ll definitely come back!\" Ye Jian replied seriously, making a promise for the future.","The Vanguard Battalion was her first military unit after she graduated. Just like what Company Commander Zhu said, the Vanguard Battalion was her old military unit. Her old comrades were here. She would definitely come back!","The car started moving. Xia Jinyuan waved goodbye to Company Commander Zhu and drove back with Ye Jian.","Company Commander Zhu stood in the barren desert and watched the car leave. He saluted and bade farewell to his comrades who had been together for half a year.","Ye Jian kept staring at the rearview mirror. Even though the starlight was faint, Ye Jian could still see Company Commander Zhu raising his hand to salute. She closed her eyes lightly and didn’t dare to look anymore.","\"Captain Xia, are we still going back to the camp?\" After a long time, Ye Jian calmed down and asked the man who was driving steadily. \"Our luggage is still in the camp, right?\"","The wheels of the car bumped over the desert. Xia Jinyuan, who was holding the steering wheel tightly, quickly glanced at the person sitting beside him. He couldn’t help but sigh. \"Our luggage is in the trunk. We’re leaving the old military unit...\"","After all, Xia Jinyuan had more experience than Ye Jian. In addition, there was a group of comrades who were waiting for him to return to the team. Hence, his reluctance was much lighter than Ye Jian’s.","Although he was reluctant to part with his soldiers, he was not so reluctant that he wanted to cry.","Ye Jian was stunned for a moment. After a long time, she said in a daze, \"My luggage was packed? I... I don’t even know when that happened. Why... wasn’t I told? I thought... I thought we’d go back to the camp to pack our luggage.\"","She spoke in a daze as if she couldn’t accept it.","After she finished speaking, Ye Jian leaned against the back of the chair and tilted her head. She looked outside in a daze. The mountains outside were undulating. The desert stretched endlessly outside. The Vanguard Battalion was outside. However, she was already leaving.","\"Sleep for a while. To be safe, we need to take turns driving.\" Xia Jinyuan’s heart ached for her. He decided to find something for Ye Jian. She was very responsible. If she had something to do, it would distract her.","Ye Jian, whose emotions were fluctuating, turned her head and immediately raised her hand to look at her watch. It was still ten minutes before 1:00 AM.","\"How many hours do we need to drive? Are we going to the airport directly? What about transport? Will someone pick us up at the airport?\"","\"14 hours. The car will be placed at the military depot. Then, we’ll set off from the military depot to the airport.\"","\"Okay, I’ll take over at three o’clock.\" Three o’clock was the time one wanted to sleep the most. If she slept now, Captain Xia could have a good rest at three o’clock.","Normally, Xia Jinyuan would definitely extend the time. This time, he nodded and said, \"Okay, I’ll wake you up at 3:00 am. I’ve been driving since I came from the camp.\"","\"Then I’ll drive now. You rest.\" Ye Jian immediately changed her mind."]},{"number":5024,"title":"Chapter 5024: Everything In The World","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan only asked Ye Jian to drive because he wanted to distract her. He didn’t really want her to drive. Hearing that, he objected, \"No, your emotions are still fluctuating. The desert terrain is complicated. You need to calm down. Hurry up and sleep. I’m still in good spirits. I won’t have a problem driving for another two hours.\"","Ye Jian had always felt sorry for her man. Hearing that, she nodded obediently and immediately closed her eyes to sleep. She fell asleep very quickly.","Hearing the sound of her even breathing beside him, Xia Jinyuan slowed down his driving speed. Then, he used his right hand to gently touch her head that was leaning toward him. \"You invest in your emotions too easily. I don’t know if it’s good or bad...\"","People who were too sentimental would always be the ones who got hurt more.","Ye Jian, who was asleep, didn’t hear Xia Jinyuan’s sigh. She had to hurry up and sleep. She would be able to take over at 3:00 am.","At 3:00 am, Xia Jinyuan, whose eyes were bloodshot but who was in good spirits, woke Ye Jian up on time.","Ye Jian woke up from her deep sleep and jumped down from the car. She let the cold wind blow on her head to wake her up before getting back into the car.","Xia Jinyuan felt at ease and handed the car to Ye Jian to drive. He got into the passenger seat and chatted with Ye Jian for a while before immediately closing his eyes to sleep.","Ye Jian didn’t wake up the man who was sleeping soundly. She followed the route set and drove steadily from the roadless desert to the sentry post. When she stopped the car and took out her identification document, she got out of the car to cooperate with the sentinel. She didn’t want to wake Xia Jinyuan up.","After the sentinel finished his inspection, he told Ye Jian where to go on the road that had been recently built. Then, he took water and food from the simple outpost and placed them in the car. Then, he raised the pole and let them in.","This was the first sentry post that Ye Jian passed by. After passing through two more sentry posts, she finally drove out of the depopulated zone and the restricted areas under military control.","At this moment, the sky was completely bright. It was already eight in the morning.","The sun rose late in the desert. It was already 6:30 am when she saw the sun. Now that the sun was rising, the sun was shining brightly. It was a good day.","After driving for five hours, Ye Jian was a little tired. In front of her was the asphalt road that had been built. Ye Jian parked the car and rolled down the window. She turned off the engine and got out to rest.","A bottle of water, a few pieces of dried yak meat, and a few biscuits were Ye Jian’s breakfast. This was provided by the sentinels at the outpost.","She had stopped the car at the foot of a hill. Holding her breakfast, Ye Jian quickly climbed up the hill. Now, the female soldiers and the male soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces had already started fighting. She didn’t know how the battle was going or if they had won.","After a while, Ye Jian climbed up the hill and faced the west of the desert. In the depths of the desert was a group of female soldiers fighting for their dreams.","She sat down and unscrewed the bottle of water. She drank it in one gulp. The cold water stimulated her throat and brain. Her brain became clearer, and her heart became calmer.","After eating a few biscuits, she heard the sound of footsteps behind her. Ye Jian turned around and smiled at the young and handsome officer who had climbed up. She patted the ground. \"Captain Xia, let’s look at the scenery together. I haven’t seen the desert scenery properly after coming here for so long.\"","The man who woke up at every checkpoint stopped before he finished climbing up because of the girl who was smiling in the bright sunshine. The sunshine was so bright, but it was still not as bright as the smile on the girl’s face.","At this moment, all the beautiful things in the world were not as good as her smile.","\"Hurry up and come up. If you wait any longer, the sunlight will be blinding.\" Ye Jian patted the ground forcefully with a smile on her face. She urged, \"Are you still not awake? Don’t be in a daze. Come over quickly.\""]},{"number":5025,"title":"Chapter 5025: The Beauty Of Tenacity","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was sitting on the top of the mountain, turned around and smiled at the young officer behind her. Her smile was brighter than the sun. It was like the rising sun breaking through the shackles of darkness and welcoming a new day with its most beautiful posture.","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing still, smiled too. He knew that his girl had walked out of her sorrow and was using her best mentality to face the coming days.","In the past few days, Ye Jian hadn’t been smiling much. Even when she smiled, there was always a hint of sadness between her eyebrows. Xia Jinyuan’s heart ached when he saw this.","However, it was something that had to be done. No matter how much he persuaded her, she had to rely on herself to walk out of her sorrow. As her boyfriend, no matter how much he persuaded her, it was useless.","Now that she had moved on, Xia Jinyuan felt relaxed.","\"If you want to see the rising sun, you have to do it earlier. It’s too late now. The sun has already risen. It’s the most beautiful moment when the golden light breaks through the sky.\"","Xia Jinyuan walked over with a smile and sat down beside Ye Jian.","He naturally placed his strong long arm around Ye Jian’s shoulder and let her lean into his arms. He laid her head on his shoulder, and they looked at the desert scenery together.","Ye Jian leaned into his arms naturally. She snuggled into the arms that had been giving her strength and guiding her forward.","The scenery in front of them was not as lush and vibrant as the forest. As far as the eye could see, it even felt desolate. However, there was a firmness in the desolation. If you looked at it for a long time, your mood would unknowingly become exceptionally broad.","The undulations seemed to extend to the end of the sky. When Ye Jian saw the brownish-green bushes growing in the desolate mountain range, her pitch-black eyes narrowed slightly, and her facial expression became calmer.","\"They’re really beautiful...\" she said in a low voice. \"It’s the beauty of tenacity. They’re never afraid of the heat or the cold.\"","Who were they?","Xia Jinyuan knew who she was talking about. He put his arm around her shoulder and said gently, \"They’re not the most beautiful. I’ll bring you to see the true desert scenery when I have the chance.\"","\"The wind-dried poplar trees that stand for a thousand years, the yellow sand all over the sky, the bright golden leaves, the wind blowing from the mountains. There’s the smell of snow and the smell of sand... You’ll also see the golden leaves of the poplar trees falling, the smoke rising from the desert, the setting sun over the long river... The most beautiful scenery is that.\"","As the man beside her talked about the scenery of the desert, Ye Jian’s mind had already painted the eternal desert scenery.","She had been to the borders a few times. The scenery was right in front of her eyes, but she couldn’t stop to admire it.","Firstly, she didn’t have the time. Secondly, she didn’t think it was beautiful at that time.","Thinking about it now, she felt a little regretful.","She wondered if the female soldiers would stop and admire the scenery around them. They would probably be like her. They probably didn’t have time and didn’t think it would be beautiful.","If one didn’t admire it with one’s heart, how could one find it beautiful?","\"Do you know what the spirit of a poplar tree is?\" He tilted his head and kissed Ye Jian’s forehead. Ye Jian looked up and shook her head gently.","Spirit of a poplar tree?","She had never heard of it.","Xia Jinyuan thought for a while before continuing, \"Even a thousand years after a poplar tree dies, it won’t fall. Even after it falls, it’s around for another thousand years. After decaying, its roots are still firmly rooted in the desert and fixed to a sandpile. Even if its life is gone, it can continue to protect the sandpile until its roots decay and nothing is left.\""]},{"number":5026,"title":"Chapter 5026: Leaning On Each Other","paragraphs":["The reason why Xia Jinyuan knew about it was because he had come to a certain company for an internship when he was a second-year student. At that time, an old company commander from the Xueyu unit told him personally.","It was also because of this old company commander that he became a special forces soldier.","There was such a thing? Ye Jian was very curious. She couldn’t help but leave his arms and sit up straight. \"What’s the spirit of a poplar tree?\"","Xia Jinyuan pulled Ye Jian back into his arms. \"Sit down and listen to me. Don’t move.\"","It was good to snuggle up and talk to each other. In a few days, it would be time to part. When she entered the air force, it would be difficult for them to meet again!","There were only two of them now. He had to hurry up and gain some benefits.","To prevent Ye Jian from sitting up straight again, Xia Jinyuan hugged her shoulders even tighter. Most of Ye Jian’s body fell into his arms. He wished he could hug her and make her sit on his lap.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had always been a man of action, moved quickly. He didn’t tell Ye Jian what the ’spirit of a poplar tree’ was immediately. While Ye Jian was caught off guard, he hugged Ye Jian’s waist and made her sit on his lap easily.","Ye Jian felt like a rag doll in his hands. In the blink of an eye, her body was in the air. Before she could catch her breath, she was already sitting on his lap with her back pressed against his chest. Her waist was hugged tightly by his strong arms as if he was afraid that she would run away.","Xia Jinyuan, who had achieved his goal, smiled and said, \"You should’ve hugged me like this long ago.\"","\"Aren’t you afraid that I’ll make your legs numb?\" Ye Jian, who was leaning into his arms, pursed her lips and smiled. \"Don’t ask me to carry you down later.\"","\"If my legs are really numb and I need you to carry me, I won’t reject the idea.\" In terms of talking, Xia Jinyuan had always been the king. Ye Jian quickly admitted defeat.","After adjusting to the most comfortable position, Ye Jian, who had admitted defeat, asked him what the spirit of a poplar tree was.","Xia Jinyuan spoke slowly. His low and pure voice was like a violin. It was probably stained with the desolation of the desert. His voice became especially low. \"The spirit of a poplar tree refers to the spirit that can endure hardships and fight. As for the female soldiers you brought out, they have the spirit of a poplar tree. They won’t fall until the last moment. Even if they fall, their roots will be deep. Their mission will continue.","\"You can’t bear to part with them, but their roots are already in the desert. Their roots are still there, and their spirits are still there. One day, when you come back, you’ll see them even stronger than now. They’re like poplar trees rooted in the desert, lush and full of leaves, protecting the country.\"","Ye Jian, who had already left her female soldiers, saw the glint in his eyes. Ye Jian, who was lying on his shoulder, smiled and asked, \"Captain Xia, you want to tell me that they’ll win, right?\"","Without waiting for Xia Jinyuan’s reply, she continued, \"They will win, and they will win beautifully.\"","\"The special forces of the Blood Wolf Special Forces are quite powerful, but how can the soldiers I trained be bad?\" Her tone was extremely proud and confident, making the glint in his exquisite eyes even more dazzling. \"After half a year of harsh training, all of them have become top figures. How can they lose? They have the spirit of a poplar tree. Yes, they have the spirit of a poplar tree!\"","They wouldn’t lose. How could the soldiers she trained lose?","Xia Jinyuan loved her confidence and even the rare hint of arrogance she showed.","The girl he loved deeply rarely revealed her proud side. Tsk, tsk, tsk... Xia Jinyuan felt his heart pounding."]},{"number":5027,"title":"Chapter 5027: Lieutenant Colonel Xia Wants His Honeymoon","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan’s heart was beating faster. He retracted his arms and hugged her waist even tighter. He didn’t stop until Ye Jian was pressed tightly against his body.","Xia Jinyuan, whose breathing was accelerating, tilted his head and kissed Ye Jian’s smooth forehead forcefully. \"Look at you. Company Commander Zhu and I never thought that the female soldiers would lose. After half a year of harsh training, we saw the improvement of the female soldiers. Even if we want to see them lose, will they be willing to do so?","\"Although the difficulty of all the combat subjects has increased, the military didn’t blindly do it. It’s because the female soldiers’ training content and results have been comprehensively considered before raising the difficulty of the combat.","\"You hope that the female soldiers will win. You hope that the female soldiers can work together to realize each other’s dreams. It’s the same with the military.","\"They spent so much effort to choose female soldiers with strong comprehensive abilities from all the military units so that they could successfully form a female special forces unit. How could the military treat the special forces casually?\"","Ye Jian, who was still in good spirits, smiled even more. She felt proud. \"That’s right. They’ll definitely win.\"","\"After they win, they might sit on the top of the mountain like me and watch the sun rise and set. They might enjoy the scenery of the desert.\"","Xia Jinyuan specially observed Ye Jian’s expression and confirmed that when she mentioned the female soldier again, she didn’t look sad at all. He raised his eyebrows and smiled. \"That might not be the case. Previously, didn’t you fail to admire the scenery as well?\"","\"That’s different. There are many of them. As long as someone takes the lead, they’ll definitely take a good look at the scenery around them. I’ve seen the scenery of the northwest now. When I return to the military unit, I should have a chance to see the desert scenery you talked about.\" Ye Jian’s eyes flickered as she laid on his shoulder and said softly. There was yearning on her face. \"The beauty of the rivers of Jiangnan, the beauty of the yellow soil in the northwest, the beauty of the Xinjiang desert... We should go see all of them, right?\"","Ye Jian’s open-mindedness made the smile in Xia Jinyuan’s eyes deepen. \"The beauty of Jiangnan is a little difficult. We can go on our honeymoon and see it together. The beauty of the yellow soil in the northwest is right in front of us. We’ll see the beauty of the Xinjiang desert together.\"","Thinking about the years she would have to walk in the future, Ye Jian was filled with anticipation.","The female soldiers had their own paths to walk, and she had her own path to walk too. There was no need to be too sad. They would meet again one day.","After chatting for a long time, Ye Jian became more and more indifferent. The last trace of sorrow in her heart dissipated.","She smiled sweetly and looked forward to the future.","It was rare for Xia Jinyuan to be so relaxed. He hugged the girl he loved and talked about the rivers and mountains in their country.","He talked about the places he had been to, the people he had met, the things he had encountered, and why he joined the Xueyu unit. \"The old company commander only asked me what my plans were when I was about to return to school. He asked me if I wanted to go to a better military unit to train and if I wanted to become an ace soldier.","\"At that time, Old Xia was frustrated with me. He thought that even if I got into the military school, I would still be a bastard who would waste the food of the country. I wanted to fight for my pride, so when I heard that there was such a good place and that I was a soldier, I agreed without hesitation.\"","Xia Jinyuan had never told Ye Jian how he knew about the Xueyu unit. Now that he mentioned it, Ye Jian listened to it with relish. The real story and the plot were so filled with ups and downs. She had to listen carefully."]},{"number":5028,"title":"Chapter 5028: When Will You Get Married?","paragraphs":["Ye Jian listened attentively, afraid that she would miss a word. Seeing that she was so interested, Xia Jinyuan said excitedly, \"After that, the old company commander introduced me to Major General Yang and brought me to see Old Xia. You don’t know this, but when Old Xia saw me, his expression was so vivid and kept changing. The old company commander kept saying good things about me and said that I was a good talent. In short, there was nothing bad about me.","\"Old Xia thought that I was a bastard. When he heard the old company commander praising me, he endured it until he almost fainted. He asked the old company commander if I forced him to say that. The old company commander was hot-blooded. If it weren’t for Old Xia’s high position and military ranks, the old company commander might have punched him.","\"Later, the old company commander said that he really wanted to hit someone at that time, but he endured it. He was afraid that if he punched someone, he would feel good for a moment and get into trouble afterward.","\"The year I met you was the year I left the company. Then, I took the assessment and took over the position of captain of the Xueyu unit. I started carrying out missions not long after I joined the company. There were missions overseas and domestically. Did you notice a problem? You and I have carried out countless missions, big and small, but we’ve never gone south.\"","Ye Jian thought about it carefully. That was true.","The places they visited the most were in the borderlands and Yun Province. They didn’t touch the south, especially the Jiangnan area. Even Xia Jinyuan was surprised.","He had served for many years, but he had never gone on a mission there.","They immediately decided that Jiangnan would be their honeymoon location!","When he mentioned the honeymoon trip, Ye Jian didn’t think too much about it. Now that he mentioned it again, she couldn’t wait. Ye Jian, whose ears were slightly red, glanced at him secretly and muttered softly, \"A honeymoon? I wonder if we’ll get a honeymoon vacation.","\"Even if we get one, we don’t know if they’ll recall us halfway. You’re thinking too far ahead.\"","Xia Jinyuan was already focused on his honeymoon. He didn’t hear Ye Jian muttering. \"What do you think we should do? Fireworks in Hangzhou in March? We can start in Suzhou.\"","\"The water town, the boats, and picking lotus flowers... After Suzhou and Hangzhou, we will go to another place to continue our honeymoon. It would also be nice to go hiking. With our physical fitness, it’s not a problem to climb all four famous mountains.\"","As he spoke, Xia Jinyuan suddenly lowered his head and kissed the side of Ye Jian’s face. \"What should I do? I want to get married as soon as possible. I want to go to the south to play as soon as possible.\"","At this moment, the two of them had already put aside all their worries. They only had eyes for each other.","He kissed her until Ye Jian felt a little itchy. While dodging, Ye Jian smiled and pushed his head to prevent him from causing trouble again. \"Captain Xia, I just graduated, and I’m still young. There’s no hurry to get married. You still have to wait. We’ll get married when we’re 24 years old. I’m only 22 years old this year.\"","A bucket of cold water was poured on him.","Xia Jinyuan’s heart turned cold. He took revenge by biting Ye Jian’s earlobe. He even purposely sucked her ear. \"You heartless girl, don’t you know how hard I’ve been enduring? Huh?\"","As he spoke, he pulled the person sitting on his lap into his arms, bringing her closer. \"Do you feel it? Don’t you think I’ve been miserable enduring it for so long?\"","Ye Jian was so stiff that she didn’t dare to move. She... felt it!","How could she not feel it?"]},{"number":5029,"title":"Chapter 5029: Too Sensory","paragraphs":["Ye Jian could feel it. In the past, she could still use her young age as a shield. Now, she was old enough and an adult. The best shield she had after graduating from university was useless.","What should she do?","Ye Jian was so frustrated that she didn’t even dare to move. What else could she do? She had to extinguish this fire first.","\"We’re in the wilderness. Calm down, Captain Xia. Bear with it. Continue bearing with it.\" She was stuttering. She was the one who was panicking in the wilderness!","What if something happened to her? Should she resist or not?!","What a difficult multiple-choice question!","In the wilderness... He couldn’t possibly punish her on the spot, right? The inexperienced Captain Xia didn’t have such a fetish, right?","At this moment, Ye Jian’s heart was like a small boat swaying with the waves in the vast sea. One moment, it was about to capsize, and the next moment, it was about to sink into the sea. What should she do?!","Xia Jinyuan’s breathing was like a wild beast that kept panting beside her ear. His scorching breath was like a fire that came out of nowhere, roasting her until she felt especially uncomfortable.","\"Captain Xia, why don’t you put me down first and we’ll walk?\"","They were talking about serious matters just now. Why... did the atmosphere change suddenly?","Ye Jian, whose neck was red, suggested softly. She didn’t dare to agitate him further.","\"If that doesn’t work, why don’t you run a few kilometers to vent it out?\" she suggested again. It was all out of consideration for him.","Holding it in... was harmful to his body!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t agree with her suggestions. He was helpless too. Why did his body feel like this? Alas, he couldn’t blame his body for being like this. Think about it! How could one expect a 30-year-old virgin to be any other way?","’It’ had been abused for more than ten years. It felt wronged too!","It was just...","Xia Jinyuan laid his head on Ye Jian’s shoulder and groaned in pain. \"I’ve wronged it for more than ten years. I can’t bear to wrong it anymore.\"","Cough, cough, cough... It wasn’t just Ye Jian’s neck that was red. She felt that her entire body should be red.","She didn’t want to either!","\"Then... tell it that the location is wrong and let it calm down.\" What else could she do? Coax it! Ye Jian used her entire life to coax it!","Xia Jinyuan was in even more pain. His hands were no longer restrained around Ye Jian’s waist. Instead, they gradually started to climb up. As they moved upward, he said aggrievedly, \"I can’t coax it. It won’t listen to me. No, it won’t listen to me.\"","His voice was so soft that Ye Jian’s heart trembled. It was irresistible and extremely sexy.","Ye Jian blocked his hands that were moving upward and clenched them tightly. She gritted her teeth secretly. She persuaded him gently, \"If the soft approach doesn’t work, let’s use the hard approach. Let’s... run!\"","Run... The moment she said this word, Ye Jian, who was sitting on his lap, jumped out of Xia Jinyuan’s hot arms like a rabbit. At the same time, she rolled forward and instantly distanced herself from the man whose eyes were red.","Xia Jinyuan was speechless. He lowered his eyes and looked at the empty arms. Then, he looked at the figure running down the mountain. He gritted his teeth. \"When we’ve nailed the time and place, don’t even think about getting out of bed for three days and three nights!\"","He jumped up and caught up with the figure in front of him.","The location was really not right. As for him, he did not expect that he would suddenly have that thought. They were clearly talking about serious matters, but after a while, he missed her and had to endure the pain again!","It was necessary to see a male doctor for a thorough check-up to see if there were any problems with his functions!"]},{"number":5030,"title":"Chapter 5030: Torture","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan took a deep breath as he chased after Ye Jian. As the figure in front of him got closer and closer to him, the gentleness in his eyes got stronger. In the end, he caught up with her and hugged her until they were lying together. It was a little cold, and the ground was filled with gravel.","This time, the two of them didn’t hug or do anything else. It was better to take it easy.","The surroundings were very quiet. The two of them, who had run 3,000 meters, placed their hands behind their heads and closed their eyes. They smiled and adjusted their breathing until their hearts became calmer and quieter until there were no more distracting thoughts.","Without saying anything, the two of them laid there quietly, as if they could lie there until the end of time.","After an unknown period of time, Ye Jian was about to fall asleep. A shadow covered her eyes. She slowly opened her eyes, and a handsome face appeared in her black eyes.","\"Have you rested well?\" he asked with a smile. His voice was so gentle that Ye Jian couldn’t help but close her eyes slowly. She smiled lazily. \"No, I really want to sleep before leaving.\"","Her lazy look made Xia Jinyuan’s gaze turn soft. His slender fingers pinched her nose lightly, making her unable to breathe. \"If we sleep here, the people at the military depot will think that we’re lost in the desert.\"","\"Come, I’ll carry you to the car. Sleep well in the car. When you wake up, the results of the female soldiers’ battle in the morning will probably be out.\"","Ye Jian pinched her nose and adjusted her breathing. She opened her eyes immediately. Her black eyes were so clear that it was obvious that she was in good spirits. She didn’t feel sleepy at all.","\"How can I know the results of the female soldiers?\" Not only did she not feel sleepy, but she also sat up directly and stared at Xia Jinyuan. \"You’re not lying to me, right? Can I really know?\"","Lie to her?","Xia Jinyuan raised his head and flicked her forehead. He asked, \"When have I ever lied to you?\"","He had never!","Ye Jian smiled and lay on Xia Jinyuan’s back, hugging his shoulders with both hands. Her two slender legs swayed with his steps. She was very happy.","That was good. She could even know the results of the female soldiers.","Xia Jinyuan, who was carrying her to the car, raised his thin lips. What was happiness? Happiness was carrying her until the end of time.","After getting into the car, Ye Jian let herself fall asleep. She still had to continue driving after this. When she woke up in the afternoon, she would take over the shift. She would also know the results of the female soldiers. It was killing two birds with one stone!","The military Jeep drove onto the asphalt road built by the engineer soldiers, going from the desolate desert to the asphalt road occasionally driven by cars. Xia Jinyuan closed the car window to prevent the honking of the cars from waking Ye Jian up.","At 9:00 am, the temperature of the sun was getting higher. The female soldiers holding rifles laid on the ground motionlessly. There were chest targets in front of them and an alarm clock that rang every five minutes.","Another ten minutes passed. The alarm clock made a sharp ringing sound. It destroyed everyone’s willpower.","When the company commander heard the alarm clock ringing, he swore many times in his heart.","Damn it!","He swore that he would never buy an alarm clock in his life. He never wanted to hear the alarm clock ring again. It was too f*cking torturous!","’Hold on, female soldiers. You have to hold on!","’There’s still an hour before it ends. You’ve already endured for four hours. Don’t waste the first three hours!’","Listening to the devilish alarm clock, Company Commander Zhu kept glancing in the direction of the female soldiers. He clenched his fists tightly until the alarm stopped ringing. Then, he slowly took a deep breath and let go."]},{"number":5031,"title":"Chapter 5031: Not The Truth","paragraphs":["While the company commander was paying attention to the female soldiers, he would also pay attention to the male soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces from time to time. When he saw that the male soldiers were all very stable, he muttered in his heart, \"Damn it, hurry up and drop a few. Hurry up and drop a few!\"","Squad Leader Hu from the Blood Wolf Special Forces was watching the battle.","Unfortunately, the male soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces didn’t do what the company commander wanted. The female soldiers persevered, and so did they. They didn’t move at all. It was as if they had become one with the ground. No matter what happened, they wouldn’t waver.","The veteran special forces soldiers wouldn’t lose so easily.","Moreover, they were facing female soldiers. If they lost to the female soldiers in the first round, would they still have their dignity?","Since the female soldiers insisted, the male soldiers didn’t dare to let their guns drop.","Squad Leader Hu, who came from the Blood Wolf Special Forces, had the same thoughts as Company Commander Zhu. Occasionally, he would glance in the direction of the female soldiers. His expression was very cold. The corners of his mouth were pressed tightly, and the air pressure around him was a little low.","These female soldiers were not just pretty faces. They were all well-trained and had a certain level of ability.","Take gun training for example. Ordinary soldiers trained for about half an hour to an hour. Special forces soldiers trained for at least two hours. Normally, it would take more than two hours. At the same time, there were a few interference factors around them so that the soldiers could perform normally in chaotic environments and not be affected.","Ordinary soldiers could hold their guns for an hour, but the female soldiers had been holding their guns for three hours. Their facial expressions never changed, and they didn’t look tired at all. It could be seen that their daily gun training was done according to the standards of the special forces.","This group of female soldiers wasn’t ordinary female soldiers. They should be a female special forces unit in the 76th Army Group!","As a northwestern soldier, he didn’t know that the 76th Army Group had established a female special forces unit!","No wonder the company commander said that female soldiers weren’t simple. How could special forces female soldiers be simple?","It was easy to pick out one male special forces soldier among thousands. After all, the majority of soldiers were male.","As for female special forces soldiers? They might not be able to find a single one from thousands of soldiers!","Squad Leader Hu, whose eyes were dark, took a deep breath. The sunlight shone on his tanned face, but it couldn’t melt the coldness on his face.","Squad Leader Hu glanced at the female soldier and then turned to look at Company Commander Zhu, whose facial expression was as cold as his. After some consideration, Squad Leader Hu said casually, \"The 76th Army Group even has a female special forces unit. It looks like there’s a huge change on our side. There’s the navy and the army. It’s just the air force that doesn’t have a female unit... I think it won’t be long before they take action.\"","The Vanguard Battalion that the company commander was in was in the 76th Army Group. Hence, Squad Leader Hu felt that the female soldiers were also affiliated with the 76th Army Group.","Company Commander Zhu, who was still secretly wishing that something would happen to the male soldiers. He smiled and said, \"Our 76th Army Group doesn’t have any female special forces soldiers. Squad Leader Hu, don’t tell me you think they’re female special forces soldiers from the 76th Army Group?\"","\"Isn’t that so?\" Squad Leader Hu was stunned. He didn’t believe what Company Commander Zhu said.","\"They really aren’t. Our 76th Army Group doesn’t have any female special forces soldiers. These female soldiers are just a little ruthless during their usual training. Our division commander wants to see if they can do it. That’s why he invited the comrades from the Blood Wolf Special Forces to test the waters.\"","It was impossible to get anything out of Company Commander Zhu. Squad Leader Hu didn’t believe his half-truths. Just because they wanted to know if these female soldiers could do it, they asked the Blood Wolf Special Forces to send soldiers over to complete the confrontation?","Damn it! No one here was telling the truth!"]},{"number":5032,"title":"Chapter 5032: Work Hard","paragraphs":["Squad Leader Hu cursed in his heart. Just as he was about to say something, the alarm that could make people panic sounded again. This time, it wasn’t just the alarm. They needed to complete the chest ring shooting amidst the alarm.","They had been holding their guns for four hours!","The red signal flag was raised high and waved down. 20 male soldiers and 20 female soldiers fired at the same time. 40 rifles fired at the same time. The deafening gunshots covered up the sound of the alarm.","The company commander and Squad Leader Hu tightened their expressions and stopped talking. They looked at the shooting range intently.","It was starting!","The female soldiers loaded their bullets steadily and quickly. They didn’t experience problems that affected their accuracy, like instability of their guns and their hands trembling.","The mental fortitude of the male soldiers from the special forces was much more stable than the female soldiers. After firing their first shot, they aimed calmly and fired their second shot. Their speed was the same too. They didn’t slow down because of anything.","A smile flashed past Squad Leader Hu’s eyes. He said to Company Commander Zhu calmly, \"The soldiers in my team are all good at shooting. Their accuracy is quite high. Even after six hours, 16 out of 20 will score perfectly.\"","What he meant was that the female soldiers were probably weaker.","Company Commander Zhu wasn’t afraid either. The female soldiers didn’t aim to surpass the male soldiers. The ultimate goal was to comprehensively assess the female soldiers’ overall results. Even if they lost to the male soldiers in this competition, as long as their accuracy reached the standards required by the military, they would still pass.","In the face of Squad Leader Hu’s provocation, the company commander’s smile didn’t change. \"As expected of special forces soldiers from a veteran unit. This is a good opportunity for our female soldiers to study hard and make up for their shortcomings.\"","Squad Leader Hu, who was probing and provoking the company commander, really couldn’t figure out what the Vanguard Battalion was planning.","They weren’t special forces female soldiers, and the battalion didn’t care about their results?","What were they trying to achieve?","Could it be that just like what the company commander said, they just wanted to see how strong the female soldiers were?","Squad Leader Hu didn’t get any useful information after a long time. He bit his cheeks and didn’t ask anymore.","No matter how much he asked, he wouldn’t be able to get anything out of the company commander. He decided not to waste his breath.","He would let his comrades work hard!","The soldiers of the Blood Wolf Special Forces wouldn’t give in just because the other party were female soldiers. As long as it was a competition, there was only victory and defeat. There was no such thing as modesty!","There was no need to give in to the female soldiers.","After half a year of hard training, they had already been reborn. They were many times stronger than when they first arrived. Now, they were only one step away from their dream. They didn’t dare to relax at all. They were like swallows flying over the ocean waves, fearlessly facing the blades.","Ye Jian, who woke up from her sleep, jolted lightly. She opened her eyes and sat up straight, turning to look at the back of the car.","Behind the car was a vast desert. It was unknown how many kilometers it stretched for. She was getting farther and farther away from that place.","\"Had a dream?\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was driving, quickly looked at Ye Jian, who was looking behind. Then, he looked at his watch. It was 11:26 am. The female soldiers should have finished their second subject.","Ye Jian retracted her gaze and sat back down. She rubbed her temples that were a little sore and closed her eyes as she replied, \"I had a dream that I couldn’t remember at all. I don’t know what I dreamed of.\"","She must have had a dream about the female soldiers. Xia Jinyuan only thought about it and didn’t say it out loud."]},{"number":5033,"title":"Chapter 5033: All The Way","paragraphs":["\"There’s a service area up ahead. We’ll get down and rest for a while. We can eat something too.\" Xia Jinyuan yawned and said, \"I’m a little hungry. I need to eat something to fill my stomach.\"","Speaking of hunger, Ye Jian suddenly felt a little hungry. She nodded and said, \"Okay, I’ll drive after we finish eating. You can rest.\"","The journey was long. They needed to take turns driving.","When they reached the service area, Ye Jian looked at the cars lining up and suddenly smiled. \"Seeing the cars without camouflage prints and the civilians in casual clothes, I suddenly feel as if I’ve been separated from the world for a long time.\"","That was true. Ever since she went to the Vanguard Battalion, Ye Jian had never walked out of the desert. The camp was filled with a group of camouflage soldiers. Now that she saw the civilians in casual clothes, Ye Jian was not used to it. She even found it a little strange.","There were very few service areas on the Northwest Expressway. There would only be a simple service area after hundreds of kilometers. Every car that passed by would enter the service area to rest. There were many cars now, and many passengers got off to rest.","There were people driving around, people coming from various cities, and some workers who had entered the desert to participate in the construction. Those who came from all over the world were resting and replenishing their food in the service area.","Xia Jinyuan, who was following the car in front, was amused by the surprise on Ye Jian’s face. There was a teasing smile in his eyes. \"How do you feel about returning to a civilized society from a primitive society?\"","\"I’m homesick. I’m not used to it.\" Ye Jian smiled and sighed. \"It’s only been half a year. I’m really not used to it. Captain Xia, do you have a similar feeling?\"","The soldiers who stayed in the military unit for a long time would have the same mentality as Ye Jian, especially the soldiers from remote military units.","In the past, Xia Jinyuan had the same feeling. He found a place slightly farther away from the service area and parked the car. He smiled and said, \"I used to, but I got used to it later. You’ll get used to it in the future. Sometimes, you won’t even want to return to the lively city. You just want to return to the military unit as soon as possible.\"","\"Oh, no wonder you left in a hurry every time you saw me in the past. It turns out that you don’t even want to see me.\" Ye Jian got out of the car and took a few steps. She was a lot less dizzy now. She deliberately found fault with Ye Jian. \"To think that I’d miss you for a long time every time you left. Moreover, it would take a long time for me to get used to it.\"","Xia Jinyuan laughed softly. \"After I met you, I hated that the holidays were too short. Even if it was only two days of leave, I wanted to fly over to see you. I’ve collected seven calendars. Excluding the year I first met you, from the next year onward, I’d draw a heart shape on the calendar whenever I saw you. When you return to the team, I’ll show you.\"","Hearing about it made Ye Jian smile sweetly. Her gaze was delicate. She quietly glanced at him and pursed her lips. Her smile was like a flower waiting to bloom.","After she returned to the team, she had to take a good look at those calendars.","She calculated how many times she had met Captain Xia over the years and how many days they had interacted with each other. She wanted to see if there were any differences with her memories.","Ye Jian, a female soldier with a heaven-defying memory, could remember every day they spent together as long as she wanted to.","The car was parked a little far away. The two of them, who were wearing camouflage uniforms, didn’t hold hands to maintain their image as soldiers. Instead, they walked side by side. When they passed by a row of cars, Xia Jinyuan paused.","Other people didn’t notice his pause, but Ye Jian did. Her eyes followed the line of cars, but she didn’t find anything.","\"What’s wrong?\" she asked softly. There was a hint of vigilance in her facial expression."]},{"number":5034,"title":"Chapter 5034: Unexpected Changes","paragraphs":["Ye Jian chuckled. \"There must be people in the car. If they really wanted to steal something, they wouldn’t have shaken the entire car. They would’ve just stolen the things and quickly escaped.\"","The car windows were not broken, and no whistles sounded. Xia Jinyuan felt that he was too vigilant, so he only paused for a second.","The two of them took a few more steps forward. The sound of a door being pulled closed could be heard from the car behind them. It was as if the people in the car had sensed danger and wanted to escape in a hurry.","Something was wrong!","The two of them, who were talking and laughing, turned around at the same time and ran. A gray figure flashed past their eyes and ran toward the road.","Ye Jian’s pupils constricted when she saw the gray figure running. \"It’s a prisoner’s uniform!\" she shouted in a low voice.","\"I’ll chase after him. Go and take a look inside the car!\" Xia Jinyuan also saw that the gray figure was wearing a prisoner’s uniform. The word ’prisoner’ on his back was eye-catching!","He sped up and chased after him. Ye Jian turned a corner and found the car from where she heard the door being pulled closed.","It was a crime escort vehicle, and the windows couldn’t be looked into from the outside. All the windows were covered with reflective brown film. From the outside, one couldn’t see what was inside.","Ye Jian quickly jumped into the car. The scene in front of her made her expression change drastically!","She quickly opened the first aid kit that she brought along every time she went out. She took out the gauze and covered the throat of the policeman whose throat was slit. Blood gushed out of the policeman’s neck. He saw the person who saved him clearly. When he saw the army desert camouflage uniform, his eyes lit up. He covered his neck and raised his hand to point outside. \"Crime... Chase... serious... offender.\"","\"My comrade is chasing after him. Don’t talk!\" Ye Jian covered the policeman’s neck that was bleeding continuously. Her mouth was pursed into a straight line. The aorta was cut... She couldn’t stop the bleeding!","As she looked back, a vicious look flashed past Ye Jian’s eyes. At the back... there was another policeman whose throat was slit too!","There was no way she could save them!","She covered the policeman’s bleeding neck with one hand and took off her jacket with the other. She took out the dagger beside her thigh. After two swishes, two strips of cloth were cut out of the camouflage uniform. She used the cloth to wrap the neck of the policeman who was at the critical moment of life and death yet still asked her to chase after the offender. \"Do you still have the strength? Can you press it on yourself? Please press it! You must press it!\"","Ye Jian raised the policeman’s right hand and placed it on his neck. \"Press it! You must press it!\"","After she finished speaking, she crawled to the back and prepared to use the same method to save the other officer. Just as she reached out her hand, her fingers suddenly contracted as if she was holding something heavy.","The police officer in his early 40s had already... left.","His eyes were wide open. Although his eyes were still open, he was no longer breathing.","Ye Jian felt a stab in her heart. She didn’t have the time to be sad. Footsteps came from outside. Ye Jian restrained the anger in her eyes and retreated. She reached out her hand again to cover the neck of the policeman whose aorta had been cut. The footsteps approached. Ye Jian looked up...","Two policemen walked over with another prisoner. They looked at each other, then one of the policemen shouted.","They saw what was happening in front of them. They saw their comrades lying in a pool of blood. Blood kept flowing out of their comrades’ necks.","When the prisoner saw this, a crazy glint flashed past his eyes. When one of the police officers jumped into the car, he suddenly bumped into the police officer who was holding him.","Ye Jian took out her dagger and threw it at the prisoner who wanted to escape."]},{"number":5035,"title":"Chapter 5035: Heartbreaking","paragraphs":["With Ye Jian’s skills, as long as she threw the dagger, she would be able to kill her target in minutes. However, this was a prisoner under escort. The dagger she threw couldn’t take the life of the prisoner directly. It could only teach the other party a bloody lesson.","The dagger that Ye Jian was carrying was an open-edged combat dagger. The tip of the dagger was sharp enough to kill wolves and tigers. She threw it with all her might. Most of the dagger sank into the thigh of the prisoner who was trying to escape.","\"Ah...!\"","A miserable scream erupted, shocking the surrounding pedestrians until their scalps went numb. They panicked for no reason and subconsciously ran away.","As for what it was, no one knew. They just ran away first.","The police officer had already pounced on the prisoner and suppressed him. He used his elbow to hit the prisoner’s head. The prisoner screamed even louder.","The other policeman who rushed into the car was a local from Qingdai. He was a Tibetan policeman. When he saw his comrades lying in a pool of blood, he started yelling.","He pounced on his comrade who was lying in a pool of blood. His voice was as tense as a spring that could break at any moment. \"Hold on! Let’s go to the hospital. Let’s go to the hospital now!\"","The injured policeman opened his mouth. Blood gushed out of his mouth and nose. \"Chase after him. I... didn’t...\"","\"Someone’s already chasing after him. Let’s go to the hospital now. Trust my comrade. He’s a special forces soldier. He’ll definitely be able to catch the felon!\"","Ye Jian answered first so that the middle-aged police officer, who was still thinking about chasing after that serious criminal, could feel at ease.","Hearing that the person chasing after the escaped felon was a special forces soldier, the injured policeman heaved a sigh of relief. He instantly relaxed. Seeing this, Ye Jian’s hand that was pressing on his neck trembled violently.","\"Ciwang... Ciwang...\"","The injured policeman spoke to his colleagues. He kept spitting out blood. Even his teeth were stained with blood. He was concerned about the safety of his colleague, Dayang Ciwang.","\"Alright, alright... Don’t talk. Ciwang is fine. I’ll drive to the hospital now!\" One of the policemen looked behind the young female soldier with trembling eyes. That look made Ye Jian’s heart hurt. His eyes were bloodshot as he cried.","He was suppressing the sorrow in his heart. His chest was trembling so much that Ye Jian wondered if he would collapse from witnessing the sacrifice of his comrade.","Ye Jian had experienced heart-wrenching pain when her comrade left.","Dayang Ciwang lay motionless at the back. His face... was covered with a camouflage uniform with a sleeve missing. The other policeman wanted to rush over to see if his comrades were alright. He then turned around and rushed out of the car to escort the prisoner who was still screaming into the car. Then, he handcuffed the prisoner’s hands to the car.","\"Duo Ji, keep an eye on him!\" The policeman who locked up the felon growled at the policeman who was holding the felon.","The policeman who was holding the felon nodded. \"Okay, drive. I’ll watch him!\"","The two police officers didn’t panic when they saw their comrades covered in blood. One of them drove while the other watched over the prisoner on death row. They quickly divided the work. They felt at ease with a young female soldier helping to stop their comrade from bleeding out.","The policeman who was watching over the criminal could finally look at the injured policemen, Ah Da, who was lying in a pool of blood. Then, he saw his cousin, Dayang Ciwang, whose face was covered with a camouflage uniform. His sorrow was like a tidal wave that had broken the dam."]},{"number":5036,"title":"Chapter 5036: A Lovely And Admirable Person","paragraphs":["His comrade had died, but the prisoner was still laughing. Duo Ji’s heart was filled with viciousness as he kicked the prisoner who was still screaming. \"Zha Cuomu, you’re courting death!!\"","He kicked the injured leg of the felon until he fell. As he was handcuffed, he couldn’t land on the ground. He was suspended by his hands.","This was a serious felon. Even though he was screaming in pain, it couldn’t hide the cruelty and viciousness in his eyes.","He saw the policeman lying in a pool of blood in front of him. He suddenly grinned cruelly. \"He’s dead? He’s really dead? Good! That’s good! He wanted to catch us... Hahaha, luck’s not on his side...\"","The police officer looked ruthless. His eyes were red as he raised his leg again and kicked the chest of the prisoner. \"Shut up!\"","The prisoner coughed violently and laughed crazily. \"Hahaha, he’s unlucky! He’s unlucky!\"","In exchange, he was beaten up until he vomited a mouthful of blood. He only stopped after he fainted from the pain.","After the felon fainted, Duo Ji rushed to the front seat and took off the camouflage jacket covering the face of his colleague, Dayang Ciwang.","Ye Jian had helped Dayang Ciwang to sit up and fastened him with a seat belt to prevent him from falling again as he was already dead. She also covered Dayang Ciwang’s face with her sleeveless camouflage uniform to show respect for the deceased.","The camouflage uniform was taken away. Duo Ji saw that Dayang Ciwang was pressing his chest with his right hand. His facial expression showed a little pain, and his eyes were wide open. They were filled with blood. His lips were abnormally bruised. His body wasn’t stiff yet, so his lips hadn’t turned pale. However, his face was ashen.","Ye Jian’s hands were stained with blood. After taking a look, she retracted her gaze. The policeman who had died should have... died suddenly. To be precise, he probably died from exhaustion.","The car had already started moving. The policeman driving the car raised the siren and got the cars in front to give way. He headed to the nearest hospital at the fastest speed.","Ye Jian’s hands were stained with blood. She kept pressing on the neck of the policeman, Ah Da, who kept losing blood. His lips were turning paler. \"Hold on. We’re driving to the hospital now. Hold on.\"","Policeman Ah Da should know that he didn’t have much time left. He pursed his lips with difficulty. He wanted to smile at Ye Jian and express his gratitude.","\"You’re welcome. It’s what I should do.\" Ye Jian understood what he was trying to say. Right on the heels of that, she curved her lips and revealed a reassuring smile. \"Nothing will happen. Nothing will happen.\"","The policeman, Duo Ji, suppressed his sorrow and covered his colleague’s face with the camouflage jacket again. He wanted to take off his police jacket, but he was afraid that his colleague, Ah Da, would find out that Dayang Ciwang had left. If he got agitated, something unexpected might happen, so he used Ye Jian’s jacket again.","The heavy prisoner, Zha Cuomu, had fainted. Duo Ji suppressed his sorrow and crawled to his colleague, Ah Da. This was a seven-seater MPV that wasn’t used to escort criminals. They borrowed it at the last minute. The police and the prisoners were in the same space, so the escaped prisoner had a chance to attack.","Duo Ji, who had crawled over, grabbed Ah Da’s cold fingers. \"Ah Da, Ah Da, hold on. You’ll be fine. You’ll be fine.\"","He wasn’t speaking Mandarin. He was speaking in Tibetan.","The policeman, Ah Da, smiled. He couldn’t hold on anymore. Although he was reluctant and wanted to live well, he knew that he wouldn’t be able to do it.","He knew that he didn’t even have the strength to hold Duo Ji’s hand. He knew that he was about to die."]},{"number":5037,"title":"Chapter 5037: Tears","paragraphs":["Looking at Ah Da, whose face was turning paler, Ye Jian questioned Duo Ji, who was panting from suppressed sorrow, in a tense voice, \"Why did you stop halfway and bring a prisoner down? Why did the escaped prisoner have a sharp weapon on him?\"","According to the rules, Ye Jian had no right to ask. However, she had seen the dead policeman, Dayang Ciwang, lying in a pool of blood... And the possibility of saving the policeman, Ah Da, was extremely low. Ye Jian couldn’t help but ask.","Her questioning voice was extremely sharp.","Duo Ji choked and was about to explain when Ah Da spoke.","His voice was so weak that it was as if he could stop breathing at any moment. \"Big Brother Ciwang... fell sick. I... I tried to save him. Wu Gan... sneak attacked from behind and cut his throat. The murder weapon... plastic... sheet, the hospital... Someone... helped him.\"","It wasn’t Tibetan. It was a common language. He didn’t hide the news from the young female soldier who was helping them. He wanted Ye Jian to hear it. He wanted to answer Ye Jian’s question. He explained to Ye Jian that it had nothing to do with his colleagues.","The escaped prisoner had a sharp piece of plastic that could cut his throat. Someone from the hospital helped the prisoner. The police officer, Dayang Ciwang, had suddenly fallen sick. Duo Ji, who was guarding the prisoner, went to save him. However, Ah Da ended up getting cut by the prisoner, who had already planned it. In that case, the prisoner was very skilled seeing as he succeeded in one fell swoop.","Ye Jian lowered her eyes to hide the gloominess in them.","’Captain Xia, you have to be careful.’","After speaking weakly, blood spurted out of Ah Da’s mouth again. Duo Ji shouted at the top of his lungs, \"Drive faster, drive faster!\"","Tibetan men didn’t cry easily. At this moment, their tears and roars flew.","Duo Ji wasn’t young anymore. He was in his early 30s and was tanned from the strong ultraviolet rays on the highlands. Duo Ji, who was in his early 30s, looked like he was almost 40 years old. One of his comrades had been sacrificed, and the fate of the other was unknown. This made the Tibetan man instantly age a lot.","The police siren sounded all the way. The police officer driving increased the speed of the car to 180 miles per hour and headed toward the small county city that was more than 80 kilometers away.","In this era, there was no mobile signal in many places in the desert. Even though they had cell phones on them, there was no service. Ye Jian kept her cell phone in her line of sight and waited for the signal before making the call.","Police cars were all equipped with satellite phones, but this wasn’t a police car. It was a civilian car. They couldn’t contact the outside immediately because there was no signal!","The only satellite mobile phone used for emergency communication was also taken away by the escaped prisoner...","They should’ve borrowed a phone at the service area. As Ye Jian thought to herself, she frowned. No, there was no time to borrow a phone. The best choice was to drive to the hospital quickly.","She pressed her hand against Ah Da’s neck and didn’t dare to let go. Duo Ji kept staring at Ye Jian’s cell phone until a bar representing the signal appeared.","There were only one and two bars of signal, but it was enough to make Duo Ji ecstatic.","He called 120 and asked the hospital to immediately arrange for people to be on standby. Then, he called the station. Before he could finish explaining what had happened, the cell phone indicated that there was no service or internet.","There was no service or internet. He couldn’t even make an emergency call to the station.","Duo Ji, who was holding the cell phone tightly, heaved up and down violently. He lowered his head and kept talking to his comrade, Ah Da, whose eyes were so weak that he couldn’t open them. \"Ah DA, hold on for a while longer. Hold on for a while longer. We’re almost at the hospital. Don’t sleep, Ah Da. We’re almost at the hospital.\""]},{"number":5038,"title":"Chapter 5038: I Want To Live","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s hands were stained with blood. She looked at Ah Da, whose expression was getting worse. Her heart sank.","He couldn’t hold on for long. The policeman on the frontline couldn’t hold on any longer. His life was flowing out of her hands at a speed that she could see...","Hearing his comrade encouraging him to persevere, Ah Da struggled to open his eyes for a long time. He hummed softly in response.","Ah Da, who was trying his best to survive, knew that it was useless no matter how hard he tried. He couldn’t do it anymore.","His low and almost inaudible voice made Duo Ji, who had been waiting for an answer, cry like a child. The Tibetan man with a broad back hunched his back and laid beside his comrade, crying.","Tears welled up in the corners of Ah Da’s eyes. He heard his comrade’s sorrowful cries and his reluctance to part with him.","He also knew that Dayang Ciwang, who had been silent all this while, had already left. Dayang Ciwang had suddenly fallen ill and could not be saved in time. He had already passed away.","Ah Da, whose breathing was weak, wanted to take a last deep breath. He took a deep breath with difficulty and looked at the double image in front of him. He moved his lips. \"Stop... Stop... the car. I... want to... take a look...\"","He wanted to see the blue sky again. He wanted to see eagles flying above his head again. He wanted to get close to this land he loved deeply again. He wanted to breathe the cold wind from the snow mountain one last time...","The car stopped. When Ye Jian got out of the car, her knees were so weak that she was kneeling forward as if she was about to fall. Her hand was still on the policeman’s neck. She couldn’t fall. If she fell... she would let go of her hand.","The police officers, Ping Tao and Duo ji, carried Ah Da out of the car. They walked to the side of the road and sat down first. Ah Da sat and leaned into his comrades’ arms. Duo Ji knelt at the side and held Ah Da’s hands tightly. Ye Jian knelt too. Her hands never left Ah Da’s neck.","The wind from the mountain range blew over. Even the wind was filled with sorrow.","Ah Da tried his best to open his eyes. He looked at the blue sky to see if an eagle had flown over. The sky was so blue. When would the eagle fly over?","The air was really good. It had the smell of the desert and the coldness of a snow mountain.","This would be the last time Ah Da opened his eyes. The sunlight was so glaring that tears flowed out of his eyes. He had to try his best to keep them open and watch... because this was the last time he would see sunlight.","In less than a minute, Ah Da slowly closed his eyes. At the last moment of his life, he left behind his last words. \"Dayang Ciwang and I... are together. You... continue... to... live... on...\"","He didn’t mention his family. He only mentioned his comrades who had been fighting by his side. In the last moment of his life, he couldn’t feel at ease about leaving his comrades behind.","As for his family... He closed his eyes before he could leave any last words for them.","\"Ah Da!\"","\"Ah Da! My Ah Da!\"","The Tibetan men cried in pain. They hugged Ah Da tightly and cried loudly. Their sorrow was enough to make the wind cry.","Ah Da left. The policeman, Ah Da, had left.","Ye Jian slowly retracted her hands and staggered to her feet. Her hands were shaking so much that she didn’t even have the strength to raise them and send off the dead policeman with a soldier’s salute.","She looked down at her hands that were stained with blood. The blood had dried up and congealed into brown blood clots. The seams between her palms, hands, and hands were filled with brown blood. It was all blood that represented life... It had dried up."]},{"number":5039,"title":"Chapter 5039: The Price Behind An Era Of Peace","paragraphs":["The blood had dried up, and the policeman, Ah Da, had left...","In peaceful times, they belonged to the civilians. They didn’t belong to the police or the soldiers. They didn’t belong to the frontline staff who fought with all the criminals. This was because they had to bear the price of peaceful times. The photo they took on the first day they wore their formal attire was the photo that would be placed in the mourning hall when they died.","The true era of peace belonged only to the people. The people living in the era of peace actually had piles of bones under their feet.","They were the bones of martyrs. They used their bodies to exchange for the civilians to live in an era of peace.","Ye Jian closed her eyes. She really didn’t have the energy to raise her arm and salute. Her legs, which suddenly lost the ability to stand, plopped heavily on the gravel-filled ground. She knelt to send off the dead police officer, Ah Da.","\"Ah Da, Ah Da...\"","Ah Da’s comrades were in pain. Their tears hit the ground, leaving teardrops.","Police Officer Ah Da was sacrificed. Police Officer Dayang Ciwang was sacrificed. Within a day, two frontline police officers were sacrificed in a county police station.","The director of the police station received a call, but it suddenly ended. No matter how many times he called back, he couldn’t reach the number. The director, who was panicking, personally went out and set off with several police officers.","The three police cars in the small county city blared their sirens and zoomed out of the county city.","Duo Ji had told the director that there was a situation on their side. The repeat offender, Gongga Ningbu, had escaped, and Ah Da was injured... Then, communication was cut off and they couldn’t contact each other anymore.","How did the criminal, Gongga Ningbu, escape? He had just been caught and hadn’t been brought back to the station. How did he escape?!","The director, who was panicking, sat in the car with a dark expression. From time to time, he would use his phone to call the number that contacted him five minutes ago.","No matter what, he couldn’t contact the other party.","He couldn’t contact them during an emergency. He was so anxious that he wanted to smash his cell phone.","In 2003 and 2004, there were still many villages in the mainland that didn’t have mobile and internet signals, let alone remote areas like the northwest and highlands.","Ping Tao carried his comrade, Ah Da, who was no longer breathing, into the car. He carefully placed him on the seat and sat him side by side with Dayang Ciwang. He and Duo Ji sat at the back and held their comrades’ shoulders tightly. Ye Jian became the driver.","Ping Tao and Duo Ji told Ye Jian that they needed to return to the service area and arrest the escaped felon, Gongga Ningbu.","Ye Jian, who was worried about Xia Jinyuan, thought for a moment before agreeing. She actually wanted to send the two dead policemen back to their workplace first.","\"Ah Da and Dayang Ciwang have already left. Before they left, they were still thinking about the escaped prisoners. We have to catch the prisoners and let our comrades leave at ease. This is their last wish. We have to complete it.\"","Duo Ji’s explanation made Ye Jian change her mind. She nodded and agreed to turn around.","In the car, Ye Jian finally knew why they didn’t use a car that was for detaining criminals.","At first, the three police officers, Ah Da, Ping Tao, and Duo ji, were only escorting the prisoner, Zha Cuomu, to the hospital in the city. Half a month before that, Dayang Ciwang and his other colleagues caught a criminal in this city. As he had some work to do at the city’s police station, he didn’t return to his work unit with his colleagues.","This morning, when he found out that his colleagues had gone to the hospital so that the prisoner could seek treatment, the 45-year-old Dayang Ciwang, who had stayed up late to work until his eyes were bloodshot, decided to go to the hospital to meet them. He wanted to get his eyes checked and get some medicine.","The hospital in a small county city couldn’t be compared to those big hospitals in other areas."]},{"number":5040,"title":"Chapter 5040: Bloodstained Land","paragraphs":["Unexpectedly, before he could look for a doctor, he realized that the escaped criminal, Gongga Ningbu, was passing by with a bag of medicine in his hand. Dayang Ciwang immediately contacted his colleague, Ah Da. He then asked Duo Ji and Ping Tao to guard the Zha Cuomu who was seeing the doctor while he and Ah Da held down Gongga Ningbu in the hospital.","The police officer, Dayang Ciwang, had been in charge of capturing the fugitive, Gongga Ningbu. This time, he finally caught him. He didn’t care that he hadn’t rested for a few days and immediately escorted him back.","As it turned out, the police car that brought Zha Cuomu to the hospital was just a regular sedan. Gongga Ningbu couldn’t take the car, so the four of them borrowed it at the last minute and rushed back to the police station with Zha Cuomu.","The reason why they rushed back to the police station immediately and didn’t borrow a car from the local police station in the city was that they already had access to a car and didn’t have to wait. They also didn’t have to trouble the police station in this city.","It was normal to have four officers detain two criminals. They informed their colleagues at the city’s police station to investigate the activities of the fugitive, Gongga Ningbu. The four of them then drove out of the city with the two criminals.","To prevent any accidents from happening, they returned to the station without taking Dayang Ciwang’s medical report.","Unexpectedly, something happened halfway.","Zha Cuomu said that he needed to get out of the car because of his abdominal cramps. At that time, Zha Cuomu’s expression was indeed not good. Hence, Ping Tao and Duo Ji brought him out of the car.","As for Ah Da and Dayang Ciwang, they stayed in the car and looked at Gongga Ningbu, whose hands and feet were cuffed.","The prisoner’s uniform Gongga Ningbu was wearing was the one that Zha Cuomu had changed into.","Unexpectedly, Dayang Ciwang, who had been working non-stop, suddenly fell ill. Ah Da rushed to save him, but he didn’t expect Gongga Ningbu to open the handcuffs. While Ah Da was bending over to save Dayang Ciwang, Gongga Ningbu used a thin but sharp piece of plastic to cut the aorta on Ah Da’s neck.","After Gongga Ningbu was caught, he was searched immediately. All the items that they thought were dangerous were taken away. As for the plastic sheet, Ah Da suspected that someone had passed it to Gongga Ningbu when they borrowed the car. It was also possible that Gongga Ningbu had been hiding it somewhere, but they didn’t find it.","How did the entire process happen? They needed to catch Gongga Ningbu to interrogate him.","When Ping Tao and Duo Ji were narrating, they had hit their heads countless times with.","Unfortunately, regretting it was useless. Some things were purely coincidental.","There was no problem with three officers guarding a serious felon who came to the hospital for treatment.","Dayang Ciwang caught a serious criminal who had been on the run, and he was worried about any delays, so they decided to rush back to the station. He had made all the arrangements, but he failed to take his health into consideration.","Dayang Ciwang, who suddenly died, did not expect to have a heart attack. He did not have the time to explain anything and died while escorting the prisoners. He didn’t expect one of the felons to have the ability to unlock his handcuffs.","No other police officer would have thought of this either.","Gongga Ningbu was a murderer and a crazy poacher.","Five years ago, he hunted Tibetan antelopes and other protected animals in the depopulated zone. Two years ago, he cruelly killed three volunteers who protected the animals in the depopulated zone. Then, he used his cunningness to be on the run until now.","This was a brutal and cunning fellow. He had amazing speed and endurance when he ran. When he realized that someone was chasing after him, he turned around. It was a young man wearing the camouflage uniform of the military. He didn’t panic. He ran along the road and looked back from time to time to see if any cars were passing by.","He knew that he couldn’t run far. The best way to escape was to take a car!"]},{"number":5041,"title":"Chapter 5041: Bite To Death","paragraphs":["Gongga Ningbu confirmed that he needed a car. Only by hijacking a car could he shake off the soldier behind him.","Damn it!","He cursed in a low voice and quickly took off his prisoner’s uniform. He crumpled it into a ball before throwing it onto the road.","Running in a prisoner’s uniform was equivalent to telling the passersby that he was a criminal.","No car would stop for a criminal.","The road that was built only had two lanes and was two-way. Fortunately, the width of the road was wide enough. In addition, the desert tourism in the northwest was still in its infancy. There were very few automobiles in the past. Most of the vehicles that came and went were construction vehicles from the northwest, such as pickup trucks, vans, minivans, and so on. These vehicles were not driving very fast. With Gongga Ningbu’s speed, he could climb up when the driver was not paying attention.","After taking off his prisoner’s uniform, Gongga Ningbu started looking for a car that he could climb onto smoothly. A sedan passed by, and he retracted his gaze after taking a look.","The back of the sedan was short and smooth. There were no tools for him to hold on to. It was not within his choice.","There was a faint greenish-black scar on his left cheek. Gongga Ningbu, whose skin was reddish-black, looked back again. Seeing that the soldier who was following him seemed to have sped up again, he gritted his teeth.","He had met a tough opponent!","He had been a fast runner since he was young. In addition, he had been chasing after Tibetan antelopes almost every day for the past few years when he was hunting in the depopulated zone. As long as he ran, he would immediately leave the people behind him behind by an unknown distance. Because of this, he became known as a hunter who hunted the Tibetan antelopes.","Later on, he was wanted by the police. He relied on his running speed to escape from these guys several times. He never missed.","This time, he found himself in a dangerous situation.","He didn’t expect the soldier who was chasing after him to be good at running too!","Gongga Ningbu clenched his fists tightly. His eyes were even colder and more brutal.","It didn’t matter if he killed another person. He had already killed three people. He didn’t care if he killed one more! As long as the other party caught up with him, he would dare to kill them!","Xia Jinyuan was surprised by Gongga Ningbu’s calmness.","When a criminal realized that he was being chased by the police and soldiers, he would more or less panic. Gongga Ningbu, on the other hand, didn’t. He analyzed calmly the entire time how he could escape from the soldier chasing him.","He was cunning, bold, and meticulous. If not, he wouldn’t have the guts to appear at the big hospital in this city.","He even dared to kill the accompanying police. One shouldn’t expect him to have any good intentions.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know what was found in the car, but he could guess that something big must have happened. Otherwise, the police in the car wouldn’t have watched the criminal escape without chasing him.","As public officials, it was impossible for them to watch a prisoner escape. Since they didn’t chase after this prisoner, it meant that something had happened to the police in the car. Something big had happened!","They were either seriously injured or dead.","Xia Jinyuan had stayed in the highlands and Tibet before. He knew that the policemen in these places were fierce. Even if they were injured and their wounds were still bleeding, as long as they were still breathing, they would definitely disregard their lives and go after the criminals until they were caught.","Now, after chasing for nearly ten minutes, no police came to help. Xia Jinyuan looked at the figure running like a beast in front of him with a dark gaze."]},{"number":5042,"title":"Chapter 5042: Powerless To Stop","paragraphs":["Ten minutes. He had been chasing after the prisoner for ten minutes, but no police came. Xia Jinyuan had a very bad feeling.","A Jeep with a luggage rack roared past him. Xia Jinyuan, who was running in front, noticed that the window of the Jeep suddenly rolled down and a man’s arm reached out...","As if he had expected something, Xia Jinyuan reacted quickly and shouted, \"Retract your hand!\"","He shouted loudly. The four young men and women in the Jeep, including the driver, heard him. The young man who stretched out his arm continued to stretch his hand out and laughed wantonly. \"Damn it, I just want to high-five him. How dare he ask me to retract my hand?\"","\"Damn it, you’re sitting in the car while he’s running on the road. Why do you still want to high-five him?\" The young man driving laughed. The sunlight passed through the car window, and a few resplendent rays of light appeared beside his ears.","It was the light from the crystals on his earrings. There were two in his right ear and three in his left ear.","The four young people were only 21 or 22 years old and were squandering their youth. They had the capital to squander and the financial resources to support them.","\"Oh, there’s someone running in front. Do you want to give him a high five too?\"","The journey was too boring. They just wanted to find something to do. They didn’t care if it was exciting or dangerous. As long as they had a thought, they would act on it.","They didn’t expect to be in danger. They were just looking for something to do.","\"F*ck, he’s running like a rabbit. I’ll high-five him.\" The young man stretched out his arm and combed his hair behind his head with one hand. His actions were carefree, and he had the intention of looking handsome.","The young girl sitting at the side hugged a pillow, laughing until she bent over. Her long yellow hair hung down from her shoulders. One could vaguely see a face with heavy makeup. There was also a flash of bright red. It was the color of her lips.","The girl straightened her back and raised her hand to comb her hair on her forehead. Compared to the handsome young men, the girl’s actions were more charming. Her red lips curled up as she giggled. \"You’re all so lame.\"","\"I’ve been driving for six hours. I’m so bored that my balls are moldy. Hey, stop the car for me! I’ll get out of the car and high-five the rabbit man!\"","\"Hahahaha, bastard, do you dare to get out of the car and call him Mr. Rabbit to his face?\" The young man driving laughed even louder. \"If you dare to do that, I’ll call you ’Daddy’ for a day!\"","\"F*ck, let’s do it! Stop the car, stop the car!\" The young man retracted his hand and patted the headrest of the main seat. \"Damn it, I can’t wait to hear you call me ’Daddy.’\"","The two girls in the car laughed until their laughter echoed in the car.","Xia Jinyuan saw the arm that was stretched out of the car retract. His heart, which was in his throat, was about to relax. In the end...","The speeding Jeep braked abruptly and stopped with a sharp screech. The four people, including the driver, fell forward due to inertia.","The car door opened.","\"Drive! Drive! Murderer in front!\" Xia Jinyuan cursed.. His voice was so loud that the green veins on his neck appeared hideously.","He was less than 30 meters away from the escaped prisoner. He used all his strength to close the distance. However, even if Xia Jinyuan had a premonition, he was powerless to stop what was happening."]},{"number":5043,"title":"Chapter 5043: Hijacked","paragraphs":["The door opened, but the car engine was not turned off. The young man who made the bet had just opened the door when the leopard-like Gongga Ningbu grabbed the wrist of the man who was getting out of the car and pulled him out violently. At the same time, he got into the car.","The car door closed, and the car window was rolled down. He was already sitting in the car.","The young man, who was pulled out forcefully, was caught off guard and fell onto the road. As he fell, he shouted, \"Oh f*ck, oh f*ck.\" Obviously, he did not know what had happened and what was about to happen.","He was lucky to be pulled out of the car.","In the car, the young driver cursed. \"F*ck, you...\" Before he could say the words, he was so shocked by the scene in the back seat that he almost jumped.","The girl sitting in the back seat was slammed into the car door. The force of the collision was huge, and she made a muffled sound. She even saw stars in front of her eyes before her vision turned black.","\"Drive! Otherwise, I’ll kill her.\"","Everything happened too suddenly. The girl who was dizzy from the collision in the back seat reacted, and so did the young man driving.","The girl sitting in the front passenger seat had been watching. However, the scene in front of her had been too much. Before she could retract the indulgent smile on her face, it froze on her face.","She saw that the man who had rushed into the car for no reason had something in his hand. He had cut her good friend’s neck, and it was already bleeding.","\"Ahhh!!!\" she screamed.","A scream came from the car. Xia Jinyuan, who was sprinting quickly, grabbed the lock of the car door and used his elbow to hit the car window that had been closed by Gongga Ningbu. After one hit, the car window didn’t move at all. Xia Jinyuan raised his hand and hit it again...","The power was so great that Gongga Ningbu, who had already gotten into the car, had a cold look in his eyes. Damn it, this soldier was actually so difficult to deal with!","His voice was cold as he shouted, \"Drive! Hurry!\" The piece of hard plastic in his hand was at the neck of the girl who was under his control. The girl who started screaming. The girl in the front seat screamed too.","The young man, whose palm and face were scratched by the thorny bushes outside the road, was still at a loss. He stood still and saw a man in camouflage hitting the car window with his elbow. That strength was definitely real!","\"Excuse me...\" Just as he opened his mouth, the car suddenly rushed forward...","The young man with a few cuts on his face widened his eyes. \"F*ck, this is a f*cking blockbuster!\"","He saw the man in the camouflage uniform grabbing the lock of the car tightly. The soles of his feet left the asphalt road but he didn’t let go. He just hung there like he was filming an action movie. The young man was dumbfounded.","In the car, Gongga Ningbu pressed the thin and sharp plastic sheet against the neck of the girl in the back seat. The blood that flowed out stained the plastic sheet that was already congealed with blood.","This piece of plastic was given to him by a foreign merchant. He didn’t know what material it was made of. It looked like a piece of plastic, but it wasn’t.","In the past, he had used it to cut off the horns of Tibetan antelopes or the corners of their fur. He had used it to deal with countless Tibetan antelopes. Later, he used it to kill people.","More than ten minutes ago, he used it to kill a policeman. Was he going to kill a few more people today? Well, he didn’t find it troublesome at all!"]},{"number":5044,"title":"Chapter 5044: Causing Trouble","paragraphs":["The hands and feet of the young man driving the car were trembling. He glanced at the rearview mirror, and a pair of sinister eyes met his. The young man’s hands trembled violently. \"Hey... Hey, do you want money? We have money. Please show mercy. Don’t... hurt anyone!\"","Gongga Ningbu ignored him. He stared sinisterly at the young soldier who was still grabbing the door lock with both hands. He dared to hang onto the car. Gongga Ningbu grinned. His smile was so cold that it made people’s hair stand on end. He opened his mouth, but no one understood what he said.","Xia Jinyuan understood. The criminal in the car had said to him, \"Either you get dragged to death or I’ll kill her.\"","He was referring to the hostage.","There were three hostages in the car. The other two had a chance to escape, but the one who was in his control had very little chance of escaping. And since she was a woman, her chance of escaping was almost zero.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t doubt the authenticity of Gongga Ningbu’s words at all. If he said that he would kill the hostage, he would definitely do it.","Xia Jinyuan let go and hugged his head tightly. The huge inertia caused him to roll. Xia Jinyuan, who was skilled, didn’t let himself fall. He protected his head and rolled continuously. Other than the damage to his elbow and knee, he didn’t hurt himself.","The young man, who was pulled out of the car for no reason, finally realized that something was wrong. Also, damn it! He was here, but the car had sped off!","\"Oh my god, stop, stop! I’m not in the car yet! Wang Qian, stop the car.\" A young man wearing a black jacket, camel-colored cargo pants, and a pair of hiking shoes ran wildly. Two silver chains hung on both sides of his skeletal frame. As he ran, it sounded like keys colliding.","The young man, who knew that he couldn’t catch up with the car, stopped in front of Xia Jinyuan and reached out his hand. \"Brother, what were you doing just now? It was like a blockbuster. I was looking at you, and you didn’t seem to care about your life. The car has already driven away, but you refused to let go? Wait, did you do it on purpose?","\"Your friend is f*cking crazy. He pulled me out of the car and rushed inside on his own. My bastard friends must be crazy. They actually left me behind and drove away. Oh f*ck, how do I chase after them? Do you have any ideas?","\"Are you okay? Did you break your bones? Do you want me to help you? F*ck, why were you running just now? You ran faster than a rabbit.\"","Young people were talkative. However, he wasn’t a bad person. He even knew how to ask Xia Jinyuan if he was injured.","Xia Jinyuan panted and stood up with one hand. When he stood up, his 1.8 meters height instantly towered over the young man who was about 1.75 meters tall. The talkative young man cursed in a low voice, \"He’s so damn tall. What did he eat growing up?\"","\"Just now, I was chasing after a serious felon. He has killed people. 16 minutes ago, he might have killed one or two policemen. I was only about 140 meters away from him at that time. I was about to catch up to him. As for you, you reached your hand out the window and stopped the car. The serious felon escaped and took your friends hostage. As for me, I need to stop a car to chase after him.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to hide anything from this young man who was obviously a trouble-maker. He was at least 20 years old. Why was he still so immature?","The young man was speechless. His eyes were about to pop out.","Was he trying to scare him?!"]},{"number":5045,"title":"Chapter 5045: Ignorance Is Fearless","paragraphs":["After knowing that he had provoked a murderer and that the murderer had kidnapped his good friends and escaped, the young man, who was drenched in cold sweat, seemed to have forgotten to be afraid!","No, no, no... It couldn’t be!","Liar, liar, liar... This guy had to be lying to him!","It couldn’t be so coincidental!","Was that guy really a murderer? Was the man in front of him lying to him just to scare him?","That was possible. However, shouldn’t felons be handcuffed? Why didn’t the person he saw look like one?","\"Then what should we do now? Should we chase them?\" the young man stammered. He didn’t know what to do next.","Although he had his suspicions, he was still a little afraid.","He was 21 years old and came from a wealthy family. He was born in a sheltered environment. Usually, he would do anything for the sake of his reputation. However, he didn’t dare to risk his life.","Cold sweat flowed down his forehead, stimulating the wounds on his face that were from getting cut by thorns. The slightly prickling pain made him gasp.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t have the time to answer the other party’s question. He took out his phone and contacted Ye Jian. There was a weak signal near the service area. He could dial the number.","As he made the call, he tried to stop a car. The cars didn’t stop when they saw him. The tourists who came to the northwest were more or less wary of this piece of land. They wouldn’t stop to pick up a stranger.","Only the young man in front of him would do something so lame and dangerous.","Two cars sped past without stopping. The young man cursed again and touched the pockets of his clothes. Just as his hand touched the two pockets on the back of his jeans, the young soldier who was beside him just now suddenly ran toward the service area.","\"Hey, hey, hey, hey...\" The young man held his wallet and shouted at the figure that was running like the wind. \"Damn, what should I do?!\"","He didn’t know if Xia Jinyuan heard him, but the young man saw that he didn’t stop and didn’t look back, so he chased after him.","His good friends had been kidnapped. He could only rely on this young soldier!","Xia Jinyuan ran back to the service area at his fastest speed and found the military Jeep that they had driven all the way to the desert. He opened the door, got into the car, and reversed the car out. He was so fast that the wheels were spinning with dust. When the wind blew, the dust blew to the side.","The passengers who were resting at the side were amazed when they saw this. This technique was amazing!","Xia Jinyuan picked up the young man who was still running toward the service area. \"What’s the license plate number?\" he asked coldly. His voice was so deep that it seemed to be suppressing a terrifying storm.","The young man, who was still panting heavily, didn’t care that he couldn’t breathe and hurriedly reported.","After reporting it, Xia Jinyuan repeated it again. Only then did the young man notice that the soldier driving was holding a handheld communication device in his hand.","There was satellite communication in the car. Even if they entered the depopulated zone, they could contact the outside world.","Soon, the director of a certain county police station, who was heading to the city, received an even worse piece of news from the military. The escaped felon, Gongga Ningbu, had hijacked a Jeep. There were three hostages in the Jeep, and they were heading toward the city.","The young man sitting at the back now completely believed that he and his friends had encountered a murderer!","They got into trouble with a murderer because they were bored. In the end, he was dragged out of the car by a criminal and... his good friends were kidnapped!"]},{"number":5046,"title":"Chapter 5046: Crying In Fear","paragraphs":["At this moment, the young man was already cursing in his heart. Damn it... All kinds of vulgarities were in his mind, but he didn’t dare to curse.","The young soldier sitting beside him was too scary. He was so frightened that he wanted to go home to look for his mother!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t care if the guy was afraid or not. He asked about the situation of the car hijacking, especially the gas situation.","After knowing that they were leaving after refueling at the service station, Xia Jinyuan punched the middle of the steering wheel. The car honked and overtook an engineering pickup truck in the blink of an eye.","The vehicle was full of gas. It was enough to cover hundreds of kilometers!","The guy, who was almost scared out of his wits, saw Xia Jinyuan suddenly pressing the middle of the square plate to honk. His skinny body trembled violently like a bird that was hit by the wind and rain.","Xia Jinyuan immediately reported the car situation to the Vanguard Battalion. The Vanguard Battalion then reported it to the police in Xiji City. Fortunately, with Xia Jinyuan’s help, the police wouldn’t be going in blind.","The guy, who was trembling in fear, straightened his back again. He secretly cursed himself to boost his courage and hide the fear in his heart.","At this moment, his hand was tightly hanging on the handle on the roof of the car. From time to time, he would glance at the young soldier sitting in front of him. He wanted to say something to him, but the other party’s aura was terrifying. It pressed down on his chest until he couldn’t breathe. He didn’t have the guts to speak.","However, if he didn’t say anything, he would feel even more panicked and afraid!","Xia Jinyuan called Ye Jian’s phone number again. The call couldn’t be connected, so he immediately hung up and stepped on the accelerator. The car sped forward like an arrow.","He placed his phone in his pocket and held the steering wheel tightly with both hands. He drove at a speed of 180 miles per hour and headed toward Xiji City along the 15th national road. At the same time, he had already familiarized himself with the personal situation of the three hostages from the young man.","They were all from wealthy families in the Suzhou area. They studied in the capital city and sneaked out to play in their fourth year as they were interning. They had just arrived in the northwest for two days and were preparing to travel around the border. In the end, they got into trouble because they were bored.","When the satellite communication received a call from the Vanguard Battalion, Company Commander Sun told Xia Jinyuan that a policeman had died of a heart attack and another policeman’s throat had been slit by a fugitive. The guy sitting at the back was already frightened enough. Now, he was so frightened that he needed to pee.","M-Murder... He really... murdered someone!","He even murdered a police officer!","He slit the officer’s throat!","\"How could I have known that he was a wanted criminal? He didn’t have those words written on him! If we knew, we wouldn’t have dared to get out of the car. We would’ve run as far as we could.","\"You told us not to get out of the car, but we didn’t hear you. I was wrong. I was wrong. Don’t be angry, Let’s think about how to save my three friends!\"","The 21-year-old young man started crying.","If he had known... If he had known, he wouldn’t have made the bet, let alone gotten out of the car!","In an instant, he ended up provoking a criminal who dared to kill a police officer!","Hearing his cries, Xia Jinyuan looked at the rearview mirror and saw the man crying until his face was covered in snot and tears. Gritting his teeth, he softened his cold voice. \"Although they’ve been kidnapped, it doesn’t mean that their lives are in danger.","\"He’s a felon and wants to escape. If he takes three hostages at once, he’ll drag him down. Maybe he’ll let your friends off halfway.\"","The young man, who was about to cry his eyes out, said, \"Really? Will that bastard really let my friends off?\""]},{"number":5047,"title":"Chapter 5047: Escape","paragraphs":["At this moment, the man was no longer as high-spirited as he was in the car earlier. He was listless.","Then, he slapped himself hard and sobbed, \"I really didn’t know that something would happen. If I had known, I definitely wouldn’t have gotten out of the car.\"","He slapped himself so hard that red finger marks immediately appeared on his cheeks.","Xia Jinyuan’s cold expression softened.","\",You should start paying attention to the sides of the road to see if your friends are there.\" Seeing that he had slapped himself, Xia Jinyuan didn’t have the heart to blame the young man for being immature.","He and his friends didn’t hear the reminder Xia Jinyuan gave earlier?","Then what about giving him the middle finger?","Xia Jinyuan called Ye Jian’s phone again. This time, the call went through.","Ye Jian took a look at the caller ID and immediately picked up the call. \"Captain Xia, we’re returning now and have arrived at the service station. Two police officers have died in the car, and two police officers are accompanying us. I’m driving.\"","She quickly told Xia Jinyuan about her situation. Xia Jinyuan also told Ye Jian about his situation as well. Ye Jian, who was driving and on speakerphone, found out that the escaped felon had taken three hostages and was heading to Xiji City. Ye Jian’s heart sank.","He was a serious criminal who even dared to kill a police officer. Killing a few more hostages was not a problem for him.","When the police officers in the car heard this, they said something at the same time. Ye Jian didn’t know what they said, but she knew that it wasn’t a good thing.","\"I’m driving at 180 miles per hour now. I haven’t discovered any hijacked vehicles for the time being. I’m starting to speed up to 240 miles per hour. Just follow closely. There’s no hurry to catch up with me.\"","The military Jeep had definitely been modified before while Ye Jian was driving a seven-seater commercial vehicle. No matter how fast she sped up, she would only be able to reach 200 miles per hour at most.","The two of them had a short conversation and learned about each other’s situation. Even though they were chasing after a felon, they were even calmer than usual.","As the wanted criminal Gongga Ningbu had escaped again and taken three hostages, the entire urban police force was mobilized. Sirens sounded over the entire city, and hundreds of police officers took action.","The plan on how to rescue the hostages was urgently launched. As for where the car was now... they couldn’t find out at the moment. The transportation department checked the surveillance footage along the northwest highway, using the service station as the starting point.","Continuing forward was Gangcha County. It was also the county city that Ping Tao, Duo Ji, and the two dead police officers needed to reach. At the back was Xiji City, the provincial capital city where Gongga Ningbu was caught.","The service station where the accident happened was the Lari Village service station in Xiji City that was 567 kilometers away from the 315th National Highway. From the service station, it was nearly 400 kilometers to Gangcha County.","The two sides were so far apart. No one could guarantee that Gongga Ningbu wouldn’t abandon the car midway. Moreover, they agreed that the possibility of abandoning the car midway was very high!","Once he abandoned the car midway, it was unlikely that they would be able to catch Gongga Ningbu again.","With his survivability, he could survive for half a year or even longer in the desert. He was a brutal and cunning fellow who didn’t have many requirements for his living environment.","\"The possibility of him entering Xiji City is quite small. It’s more than 560 kilometers from the Lari Village service station to Xiji City. With Gongga Ningbu’s cunningness, it’s impossible for him to keep heading to Xiji City.","\"Also, he must know that entering Xiji City is equivalent to walking into a trap. There’s an 80% chance that he’ll abandon his car halfway.\"","It wasn’t an 80% chance. It was 100%. The fugitive, Gongga Ningbu, did plan to abandon his car halfway and escape. He didn’t consider entering Xiji City again."]},{"number":5048,"title":"Chapter 5048: Admiration","paragraphs":["The possibility of Gongga Ningbu abandoning the car midway was 100%. Now, the problem was whether he would take the hostages and enter the desert mountain with them? There were three hostages in the car, two women and one man. The female hostage in the back seat was in serious danger. The male was the driver and was relatively safe.","Once Gongga Ningbu abandoned the car midway and took the hostages into the desert, the two female hostages might be cruelly killed. The male hostage might be taken along because entering the desert mountain range required a certain amount of stamina. The male hostage would become Gongga Ningbu’s first choice.","These were all the police’s guesses and analysis. The actual situation was in the hands of the criminal.","The director of the Xiji City Police Station immediately contacted the military with a cold expression. No matter how many guesses and analysis the police had, there was only one best way. It was to let the pursuing soldiers stop the criminal from abandoning the car and entering the mountain to ensure the safety of the three hostages in the car.","There were patrolling traffic police on the 315th National Highway. The nearest traffic police had also received instructions from the brigade to rush to the Lari Village service station. When they saw cars in front, they immediately shouted through the loudspeaker and asked the cars in front to move aside.","Hearing the traffic police’s instructions, the cars avoided the road and drove to the side, making the journey even smoother. Several police cars roared past, making the drivers who avoided the cars guess that something had happened in front.","Xia Jinyuan, who was driving at a speed of 240 miles per hour, received the latest instructions. The director of XiJi Police Station hoped that he could stop the felon from abandoning the car. At the same time, he told him all his personal information.","The poacher from the depopulated zone had cruelly killed three volunteers and a policeman. Now, it was very likely that he would kill the hostages!","The man, whose face had turned pale, instantly broke down when he heard that the person who kidnapped his good friends had killed three people before. He bit his arm hard enough to bite off a piece of flesh.","Xia Jinyuan had been paying attention to the man’s emotions. Seeing this, his eyes darkened slightly. He hung up the satellite communication and said to the man, \"This is the best lesson for you. It’ll make you consider the consequences before doing anything...\"","In front, a silver-gray Jeep appeared. It was the same color as the hijacked car. Xia Jinyuan’s facial expression suddenly turned vicious. He smiled slightly. \"Sit tight. Your car is in front.\"","The chase took 15 minutes, including the time Xia Jinyuan took to turn around and run back to the service station to get his car.","The man who was biting his arm muscles through his clothes raised his head. \"Can I go down and help? I want to beat that bastard to death!\"","\"Even though he’s a criminal who has killed a few people, you won’t be able to escape punishment even if you really beat him to death. You can’t be rash, lest you harm others and yourself.\"","Just as Xia Jinyuan finished speaking, the man behind moved to the middle so that he could see the front clearly.","When he saw the silver-white Jeep and thought of his friends in it, he wiped the tears off his face and said stubbornly, \"I won’t cause trouble for you. If you get into a fight with the felon, I’ll help you a little. He must have a knife in his hand. I can remind you.\"","The young man’s words reminded Xia Jinyuan of something in the past that involved Ye Jian. That year, he just met Ye Jian not long ago. On a rainy night, he chased after Ye Jian and asked her to sit in the car. Ye Jian had whispered to him, \"The bond between the military and the people is strong. Sometimes we, as civilians, can be your backers too.\""]},{"number":5049,"title":"Chapter 5049: Righteous","paragraphs":["She was a brave girl who he remembered in his heart.","A smile flashed past his dark eyes. He said to the man, \"Thank you for your concern for me. Later, when you get in the car...\" He paused for a moment and looked at the target car that was getting closer and closer. Xia Jinyuan asked him, \"Do you know how to drive?\"","The young man, who wanted to do his best to save his friends, nodded vigorously. \"Yes, yes, yes. I can drive. I’m a better driver than Wang Qian!\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled. Fortunately, Wang Qian was the one driving the car in front now. If this young man were the one driving, the speed of the target car would probably increase. Then, Xia Jinyuan wouldn’t have been able to catch up so quickly.","There was one good thing about the pursuit on the desert national highway. There was only one road the entire time. There was not even a path that one could turn into. Even if the fugitive, Gongga Ningbu, hijacked a car, he could only drive forward.","After laughing lightly, Xia Jinyuan said, \"After saving your three friends, you’ll drive them away. Your three friends should be fine. He won’t dare to do anything to the girl in the back seat. He needs Wang Qian to drive. If he kills the girl in the back seat, Wang Qian won’t be able to drive properly.","\"There’s no need to worry about the girl in the front passenger seat. The last thing that Gongga Ningbu will do is put her in danger, so don’t be so anxious to cry. Sit properly and don’t cause trouble for me.\"","Xia Jinyuan felt that young people, especially guys, needed to have some courage. The young man’s reaction was very similar to Xia Jinyuan’s temper. Even though he knew that they were chasing a criminal who had killed four people, he didn’t think of getting out of the car to protect himself. He even wanted to get out of the car to help later.","This was worthy of praise.","Since he caused this trouble, he wouldn’t cower away and only think about protecting himself and not care about anything else. If he did that, his friends might lose their lives. Such people... deserved to be looked down on.","When the young man heard that, he immediately patted his chest and promised, \"Okay. Leave it to me. I’ll definitely bring them away.\" After he finished speaking, he leaned over and asked uneasily, \"What about you? If we leave, what will you do? Won’t you leave with us?\"","Xia Jinyuan shook his head. \"My mission now is to catch the criminal who’s at large. Take good care of yourselves later.\"","The target vehicle in front was getting closer and closer. It was so close that he could clearly see the tail lights of the vehicle. The people in the car should be able to see him too.","\"Sit tight!\" After saying that, Xia Jinyuan increased his speed by 20 miles, from 240 to 260 miles per hour.","The performance of a military unit’s military vehicle was far from what an ordinary Jeep could compare to. In addition, Xia Jinyuan was from the special forces and had top-notch driving skills. He could completely control the speed.","The hostage, Wang Qian, was sweating profusely as he drove the car. His driving skills were not good. He had only been driving for a year, and his skills had yet to mature. Driving the car at 180 was his limit.","At first, Gongga Ningbu even threatened Wang Qian to drive at the highest speed. Wang Qian, who was trembling in fear, stepped on the accelerator, and the vehicle instantly lost control, swerving out of the road. When Gongga Ningbu saw this, he roared at Wang Qian to drive properly. In response, Wang Qian cried and said that he couldn’t drive fast.","Hence, it was fortunate that Wang Qian was the one driving. If it were a young lad who knew how to drive, it wouldn’t have been a problem for him to go up to 200. Xia Jinyuan would then have had to spend some time chasing after him.","When the target vehicle was discovered, Xia Jinyuan informed the Vanguard Battalion. When the Vanguard Battalion received the news from the front, they immediately maintained communication with the municipal police station."]},{"number":5050,"title":"Chapter 5050: Something Happened","paragraphs":["When Xiji City Police Station learned that the soldier had discovered the target vehicle and was preparing to save the hostages, the leaders in the conference room heaved a sigh of relief.","\"The felon is extremely brutal and evil. Please tell the soldier to be careful and ensure his own safety!\" The words of the director were conveyed to Xia Jinyuan by the Vanguard Battalion. Xia Jinyuan had already set his sights on the target vehicle.","Gongga Ningbu had already noticed the green military vehicle chasing after him. He immediately thought of the soldier who had been chasing after him previously. His face was distorted. He exerted strength in his grip and strangled the girl in the back seat with both hands. He roared ferociously, \"Speed up to the max! Hurry! If not, I’ll strangle her to death now!\"","The girl, whose neck was strangled until she couldn’t breathe properly, struggled. She let out a painful sound from her throat. \"Please... Please, don’t... don’t... kill me. Please... Please...\"","She begged intermittently. Her face was getting paler and paler, and her lips were losing color.","The girl in the front passenger seat was trembling in fear. She didn’t dare to look at Gongga Ningbu. Wang Qian, who was also trembling, saw that the girl was about to be strangled to death. He was so afraid that tears welled up in his eyes as he begged, \"I’ll accelerate, I’ll accelerate. Please let her go. Please...\"","\"Yu Si, quickly beg him to let Tian Tian off. Hurry up and beg him...\"","Wang Qian, whose knees were weak, accelerated. He gritted his teeth and accelerated with a pale face. Without any buffer, the car suddenly accelerated. Besides Wang Qian, the three people in the car fell forward.","Xia Jinyuan, who was getting closer and closer to the target vehicle, saw this, and his heart sank. This was bad! Wang Qian was accelerating!","The speed of the car exceeded Wang Qian’s control. The entire car started floating. Something bad would happen!","\"Hurry, hurry!\"","The young man sitting at the back didn’t realize the seriousness of the situation. He saw the car, and it was close, really close! He would be able to save his friends soon!","His heart was beating faster and faster. It was so fast that it seemed like it was going to jump out of his chest. It was so fast that his hands were clenched into fists so tightly that his fingernails were about to pierce through his palms.","Wang Qian accelerated. The one who was the most scared was Yu Si, who was sitting in the front passenger seat. The car began to float, and Yu Si, who was so afraid that she closed her eyes tightly, screamed, \"Ahhh...\"","She was too afraid.","\"Yu Si, escape from the car! Hurry up and jump off the car!\" Wang Qian screamed. He was using too much strength to yell, and his neck was red. \"Jump off the car! Hurry!\"","Damn it, he wanted as many people to escape as possible!","He couldn’t escape, but Yu Si could!","The girl who screamed was too afraid. She was so afraid that she didn’t hear what Wang Qian shouted. Her voice was so loud that it even covered Wang Qian’s voice.","Gongga Ningbu’s head was slammed into his seat, and he released his grip momentarily. When he heard Wang Qian’s shout, he straightened his body and saw a heavy truck driving in front of him. He suddenly grinned and said, \"Fine! You want to jump off the truck? I’ll fulfill your wish!\"","He had originally planned to only let the male hostage drive for him. He would find an opportunity to let the other two hostages get out of the car. Now, heh, heh... He would let them get out!","The crazy Gongga Ningbu narrowed his eyes. Just as the truck overtook them, he suddenly opened the door at the back and cruelly pushed the girl with a deep wound on her neck out of the truck...","Wang Qian was crazily pressing the horn to signal the cars in front to avoid them. He didn’t have the time to pay attention to the back. Yu Si’s lack of cooperation let him know that things were getting more and more dangerous. He had to think of a way!"]},{"number":5051,"title":"Chapter 5051: Tragic","paragraphs":["The moment the door opened, Wang Qian suddenly turned the steering wheel, and the Jeep rushed out of the road.","\"Ahhhhh!!!\"","The girl who was pushed out of the vehicle let out a miserable scream. The driver who heard the honking of the car behind him looked at the rearview mirror and stepped on the brakes. He said to his wife, who was sitting in the passenger seat, \"In the past year, more and more people have come to the northwest to travel...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, the driver, who was paying attention to the car behind him, realized that the door of the car behind him had opened!","The driver suddenly panicked. He subconsciously turned the steering wheel and drove toward the right side of the road...","All kinds of sharp and ear-piercing sounds could be heard. It made people panic. The truck rushed to the right of the road and into the ravine by the side of the road.","The Jeep rushed to the left of the road and toward the ravine.","The truck driver had consciously stepped on the brakes in advance and rushed to the right side of the road. On the contrary, Wang Qian’s Jeep was like a horse that had escaped from its cage and rushed out of the road madly.","Tian Tian, who was pushed out of the vehicle, rolled on the side of the road like a rag doll. Her screams made the couple in the truck who braked to avoid rushing out of the road feel their scalps go numb.","However, at this moment, they couldn’t care about the girl who suddenly rolled out of the vehicle. They needed to stabilize themselves first.","The front of the truck had fallen into the ravine. The driver and his wife slammed into the windshield in front of them. The truck full of vegetables was overturned, and the front of the truck sank into the ravine...","The seatbelt pulled the driver and his wife back to their seats. The truck stopped, and the couple’s blood surged in their chests.","In the back of the car, Xia Jinyuan braked twice. The car was still drifting when he collided with the young man beside the door. He shouted, \"Get out of the car and look at the girl who rolled down. Don’t move her body casually! Do you understand?\"","They didn’t know if her back, cervical spine, and internal organs were seriously injured. If they suddenly moved her body, she would be seriously injured.","The man who bumped into Xia Jinyuan screamed in reply.","The military Jeep was then parked properly. Xia Jinyuan was like a cheetah that was about to attack. He turned his body and faced the Jeep that had fallen into a ravine on the road. The driver’s side of the door was deformed.","Wang Qian, who was hit directly, fell into a daze. Blood slowly flowed out of his head, and the window beside him was shattered. Yu Si, who was sitting in the passenger seat, was in a much better condition than Wang Qian. The airbag popped out. She first hit the airbag, then slammed back into the seat. Her body swayed violently before she fainted.","From the looks of it, other than the car rushing into the ravine, there were no obvious injuries on her body. At least, there was no blood.","Gongga Ningbu’s situation wasn’t any better, but he knew how to protect himself better than the young man in the car. The moment the car hit the ravine, he protected his head.","The car flipped sideways. His feet were on the side, and his head was facing the other side.","He shouldn’t even think about the hostages now. He should hurry up and escape.","Xia Jinyuan had already rushed over. The shocked driver and his wife got out of the truck too. The driver’s wife wanted to see how serious the damage to their truck was, but the driver said, \"What are you looking at? Hurry up and check on the person lying by the roadside! Find the warning triangle and place it in front! Hurry!\"","Human lives were more important. Even if the truck was damaged, it could still be repaired!"]},{"number":5052,"title":"Chapter 5052: Kind","paragraphs":["He had been driving on this national highway in the northwest since it opened. Besides resting in the heavy snow, he worked the rest of the time. He was used to the scenery along the way and had seen too many car accidents. He had seen even more tragic car accidents than the one in front of him.","He had been in a car accident before and was saved by tourists who passed by. Now, a car accident had happened right under his nose. Since he and his wife were unscathed, he would try his best to help those who needed help.","Humans had short lives. They had to have good intentions. They couldn’t do evil or leave people in the lurch. They had to live up to their conscience.","They might need other people’s help one day.","The couple didn’t look at how badly their truck was damaged anymore. As the driver ran, he kept telling his wife what to do. \"Go and see if that lady is alright. I’ll go to the Jeep to take a look. If that lady is fine, come and help.\"","The people in the Jeep were probably dead.","Xia Jinyuan had already run to the side of the girl, Tian Tian, who was lying on the road and screaming in pain. He didn’t have much time to check if she was seriously injured. He bent down and said in a low voice, \"We’re safe now. Lie down and don’t move. Cai Yan will come and accompany you!\"","Cai Yan was the guy who was with Xia Jinyuan.","Cai Yan was still running behind. He was just an ordinary university student. He didn’t usually exercise much. Even when he ran with all his might, he still fell behind Xia Jinyuan.","After falling from the car, every part of her body hurt. Tian Tian, who felt like her internal organs were burning, heard someone talking in her ears. There was a sense of security in his low voice that seemed to keep death away from her. It was also very warm. It was so warm that she couldn’t help but want to get closer.","\"Save... Save me... Save... Save... Save me...\" She wanted to raise her powerless arms to grab the source of warmth. She felt like if she did, she would be saved.","Her fingers moved lightly, but she didn’t have the strength to raise them.","Seeing this, Xia Jinyuan held Tian Tian’s left hand that was doing slightly better. \"You’re saved now. Lie down properly. The ambulance will be here soon.\"","The palm of her right hand brushed past the asphalt road, and the skin on her entire palm had been scratched off. Although the wound wasn’t deep, it was hideous.","As he spoke, Xia Jinyuan saw that her lips were trembling slightly as if he were very cold. He quickly took off his jacket and covered Tian Tian.","\"Tian Tian! Tian Tian!\" Cai Yan, who ran over with all his might, saw who the person who rolled out of the car was. His face was as pale as paper. He tripped and staggered a few steps before falling.","Xia Jinyuan stood up and let Cai Yan take care of Tian Tian.","Tian Tian, who was in a daze, felt the person she was talking to get up and leave. She started to get anxious. Her lips moved. She wanted to yell at the person to stay behind.","The warmth she had felt from him was like a bright ray of sunshine in a dark abyss.","There was a scratch on her forehead, and blood was flowing down her heavy eyes. Tian Tian really wanted to open her eyes to see who it was. But her eyes were too heavy, so heavy that her vision was blurred.","\"Young lady, young lady, don’t move!\" The driver’s wife came over and said anxiously. Cai Yan crawled over and said in a trembling voice, \"Tian Tian, Tian Tian... Don’t sleep, don’t sleep. Open your eyes!\""]},{"number":5053,"title":"Chapter 5053: Game","paragraphs":["Cai Yan was so frightened that he thought that his friend was gone when he saw that her clothes were torn, her face was covered in blood, and her eyes were still closed.","It was not until Tian Tian replied in a low voice that Cai Yan knew that she was still alive. \"You’re alive, you’re still alive. You’re still alive...\" He was crying and laughing. He even remembered Xia Jinyuan’s advice and didn’t move Tian Tian casually.","On the other hand, Gongga Ningbu endured the pain and wanted to pull out one of his legs that was stuck in the deformed car door. He was ruthless to others and equally ruthless to himself. He knew that if he didn’t escape now, he wouldn’t have a chance. He didn’t mind even if his left leg was injured.","The vehicle had flipped to the left, and the accelerator was damaged. The entire tank of petrol flowed out like water, and the smell of petrol in the car became stronger.","He grabbed the storage in the middle of the two seats in front of him tightly for support. But he still couldn’t pull his legs out. As he struggled, he grabbed something. Just as he was about to throw it away, he realized that it was a lighter.","A lighter...","If he wanted to escape to the desert, he needed to start a fire!","At a time like this, Gongga Ningbu’s mind was very clear. He knew what he needed to do next.","Before he could escape from the car, he saw a figure standing in front of the car. Gongga Ningbu tightened his grip on the lighter in his hand and looked at his legs that had not been pulled out. His eyes were vicious.","He had to think of a way. He had to think of a way.","First of all, he couldn’t let the people outside realize that one of his legs was stuck...","Xia Jinyuan, who was rushing over, saw a large area of oil leakage. The black engine oil had spilled everywhere. He quickly scanned the area but didn’t find any smoke. He relaxed a little.","He rushed to the front of the vehicle. Through the cracked windshield, he could feel a fierce gaze staring at him from inside.","The hostage was still in the car, and so was the felon. Xia Jinyuan didn’t choose to catch the felon immediately. Instead, he saved the hostage.","The car had flipped to the left, and the right wheel was half in the air. Xia Jinyuan, who was tall enough, couldn’t open the door of the passenger seat on the right. He could only choose to climb up from the front of the car and open the door.","Wang Qian had intentionally let Yu Si, who was in the passenger seat earlier, escape. The moment she rushed out, he used the central control to open the four car doors and windows. It could be said that Wang Qian made the wisest decision at the most dangerous moment.","As Xia Jinyuan climbed, the car shook slightly. Gongga Ningbu licked his dry lips with a fierce expression. It was probably because his lips were bruised that he tasted blood.","Not bad, he loved the smell of blood the most!","The smell of petrol in the car got stronger and stronger. It was so strong that it was as if he were in a gas tank and would suffocate at any moment.","The car door opened, and the strong smell of petrol wafted over.","Gongga Ningbu, who didn’t move, finally saw what the soldier who was chasing him looked like. He held the lighter and placed his hand on the lighter gear. He licked the corner of his lips as he chuckled. \"You’re a soldier. Do you want to save this person? If you reach your hand in again, I’ll get angry and flick the thing in my hand.\"","There was a lighter in his hand, and he was holding a few pieces of paper beside it.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at him and slowly reached his hand. He opened the car door with one hand and squatted at the front of the vehicle after opening it completely.","He didn’t take Gongga Ningbu’s threat to heart. Instead, he smiled coldly. \"Do you want to die?\"","Glancing at the lighter and paper, the sarcasm on Xia Jinyuan’s face deepened. \"Are you sure you want to die?\"","No, Gongga Ningbu didn’t want to die."]},{"number":5054,"title":"Chapter 5054: Scheming","paragraphs":["His thoughts were seen through at a glance. The long scar on Gongga Ningbu’s face twitched twice, making him look even more ferocious. \"If I drag you down with me, I don’t mind dying.\"","Gongga Ningbu was a lunatic, a lunatic who could do anything! If you pressed him too hard, he would go crazy.","In the game between the two sides, Xia Jinyuan was at a disadvantage because he had scruples. In addition, his vision was blocked by the two seats in front of him, so he didn’t notice that one of Gongga Ningbu’s legs was stuck.","\"Okay, I won’t move.\"","As he spoke, Xia Jinyuan had already sized up the two hostages trapped in the car. The driver, Wang Qian, was heavily injured. His waist was caught from the airbag that popped out to protect him. There was blood on the left side of his head. When he flipped over, he must’ve hit the car frame.","Yu Si’s injury was the lightest as she was in the passenger seat. There were no signs of injury. When he heard that she was breathing heavily... he deduced that she fainted from fright. She was still unconscious.","Wang Qian needed to be rescued immediately.","Xia Jinyuan, who had an idea of what was going on, stared coldly at the felon who was struggling to fight for a way out for himself. He didn’t force Gongga Ningbu too much. If he went crazy, he would burn the car.","Gongga Ningbu thought that the other party would have some scruples after his threat. He didn’t expect to meet such an unpredictable soldier.","He wasn’t afraid, though. He grinned, revealing two rows of yellow teeth. \"Really? I’ll shout to three. If you don’t leave, I’ll light a fire. If we die, we’ll die together.\"","\"Once the car explodes, everyone will die! I’m fine with that. If I get caught by you, I’ll die too. I’m not afraid. But they’re different. Look at how young they are. They even drive their own cars. Their families must be rich.","\"They can still live, but you can’t force me to light a fire and kill them. If I die, that’s that. But if you die, you’ll be infamous for killing the people you wanted to save. You’re a soldier. Is it worth it?\"","He was eloquent, had clear thoughts, and was logical. He was so calm that Xia Jinyuan was slightly shocked.","He had carried out countless missions and encountered countless criminals who were struggling on the verge of death. However, none had ever been as calm as the felon in front of him.","However, the calmer he was, the more certain Xia Jinyuan was that... he wanted to live!","Only those who wanted to live would be so calm. They would look for a way to escape. Those who wanted to die would not say anything.","Xia Jinyuan, who understood the other party’s thoughts, pretended to hesitate. He frowned, and his originally calm gaze suddenly turned sharp. \"What requests do you have?\"","The smell of petrol in the car was getting fainter and fainter. It was all because of the open car door. Xia Jinyuan tightened his grip on the car door. He wasn’t worried about the lighter in Gongga Ningbu’s hand now. He was worried that... the felon would take the opportunity to take another hostage when he couldn’t move due to the traffic jam.","If he took another hostage... That was good too. Xia Jinyuan could let him out first so that he could save the heavily injured and unconscious Wang Qian.","Gongga Ningbu saw his every move. Although he was happy that Xia Jinyuan had relented, the cunning Gongga Ningbu did not let down his guard. \"Two things. First, prepare a car for me immediately! Second, you have to stay at least a kilometer away from me! Do that, and I’ll release the hostages and let you save them.\"","\"Impossible!\" Xia Jinyuan’s expression changed as he shouted.","\"Then let’s die together!\" Gongga Ningbu shouted. Just as Xia Jinyuan had expected, he suddenly leaned over and pounced on the passenger seat."]},{"number":5055,"title":"Chapter 5055: Timely Rain","paragraphs":["His left hand, which he hadn’t revealed, reached out to Yu Si, who was still unconscious. Xia Jinyuan was blocked by the car door and couldn’t save her immediately. A thin and sharp piece of plastic was pressed against Yu Si’s neck.","As for his leg, it broke free the moment he rushed out with brute force. It was as painful as getting your bones scraped. It was so painful that his legs trembled violently.","\"I’ll give you five minutes. If you don’t make the arrangements, I’ll kill her. I’ll kill her!\" Gongga Ningbu shouted with bloodshot eyes. There was a smug look in his eyes.","Set fire to the car? No, he wouldn’t! He didn’t want to die!","What he had wanted all along was hostages!","A sharp pain suddenly came from Yu Si’s neck, and she felt as though there was a thunderclap in her ears. Yu Si, who had fainted, suddenly opened her eyes. However, she was in a daze. It was not until she heard a cold laugh that Yu Si remembered what she had encountered.","\"Ah...\" She screamed. Before she was done, she felt her neck hurting again.","\"If you scream again, I’ll kill you.\"","A fierce voice was heard. Yu Si’s scream stopped abruptly. Xia Jinyuan closed his eyes lightly. Her voice was still full of energy. There shouldn’t be a problem.","Gongga Ningbu was already laughing wantonly. Even the heavens were on his side!","So what if Xia Jinyuan was a soldier? The hostages were all in the car. Although Xia Jinyuan didn’t believe that he would burn the car, he still had scruples!","As long as Xia Jinyuan had any scruples, Gongga Ningbu would have a chance to escape.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at him coldly. His sharp gaze almost made Gongga Ningbu think that his plan had been seen through. The next second, he saw the fellow who made him worry nod. \"Okay, I’ll arrange it for you!\"","\"Very good!\"","It was not until this moment that Gongga Ningbu heaved a sigh of relief!","Five minutes was enough time for Ye Jian to arrive. She sped all the way here and saw the military Jeep parked in the middle of the road. Then, she saw the entire event location.","Before the civilian sedan could stop completely, the police, Duo Ji and Ping Tao, had already pushed open the door and gotten out.","They noticed Tian Tian lying on the ground. The moment they got out of the car, they checked on the injured. When Ye Jian got out of the car, the first thing she saw was a familiar figure.","\"Go and check on the injured. I’ll go and take a look in front.\" Ye Jian jumped down from the car and ran forward without waiting for the two police officers to reply.","She still had a police pistol in her hand.","The director of the municipal police station said that if necessary, they could kill the criminal on the spot. At that time, Ye Jian applied for the right to use a police gun and told the director that she was a sniper in the military unit.","The director of the municipal police station agreed on the spot to let a sniper use a pistol to kill a serious offender!","Xia Jinyuan saw Ye Jian too.","\"How’s the situation?\"","She met Xia Jinyuan who was running over. When she saw his dark expression, her heart sank too.","\"No wonder he was able to escape for two years without being caught. He’s quite cunning.\" Xia Jinyuan knew that he had missed the best chance to save the hostages. \"His leg was stuck, but I didn’t notice it immediately.\"","\"Blocked vision?\" Ye Jian pointed out the problem.","She knew Xia Jinyuan’s ability. If he didn’t notice the problem immediately, it had to be because his vision was blocked. Otherwise, it would’ve been impossible for him not to notice it.","In addition, there were hostages in the car, so he had more scruples.","\"Yes.\" Xia Jinyuan nodded and said, \"Wang Qian needs to be rescued immediately. He has taken control of Yu Si and demands for a car. He also asked me to retreat a thousand meters away. If not, he’ll kill the hostage in his hands.","\"This time, he’ll do what he says,\" Xia Jinyuan added."]},{"number":5056,"title":"Chapter 5056: Responsibility","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan blamed himself for not discovering that Gongga Ningbu had one leg stuck earlier. If he had discovered it, Yu Si would’ve been rescued by now.","However, even if he had discovered that Gongga Ningbu’s leg was stuck, he wouldn’t have chosen to save Yu Si immediately. That was because... Wang Qian, who was heavily injured and unconscious, was still in the vehicle. Based on the situation at that time, he wouldn’t have been able to save two people at the same time.","If he saved Yu Si first, he would definitely make Gongga Ningbu retaliate and do something crazier. For example... killing Wang Qian in the vehicle.","It was just that...","He didn’t notice it immediately, so there was still a thorn in his heart.","Just as Ye Jian was about to say something, she suddenly heard a ferocious and crazy shout from the overturned Jeep. \"Don’t play tricks on me. A car! Hurry up and prepare a car for me! Hurry!\"","The driver and his wife, who were participating in the rescue, heard it too. The couple was shocked. Just now, the driver wanted to go to the overturned Jeep to save those inside. Fortunately, Xia Jinyuan caught up with him in time.","\"Old Tan, you... You... I...\" The driver’s wife was so frightened that her hands and feet were trembling. Fortunately, the driver was bold. He said softly, \"Don’t be afraid of anything else. There are police and soldiers here. We don’t have to be afraid. Stay here and talk to the young lady.\"","Like Cai Yan, the couple chatted with Tian Tian.","With her husband’s courage, the driver’s wife felt a little more at ease. However, she didn’t have the guts to talk to Tian Tian anymore.","Yu Si, who was being held hostage, didn’t make a sound. She was already in a daze. She was so frightened that she didn’t have any self-awareness.","The crazy roar made Ye Jian’s heart jump. She ran back with Xia Jinyuan and said, \"Give him the car. Give it to him immediately! Let’s get him out of the car first!","Xia Jinyuan’s heart ached. His expression was cold, and even the surrounding air became a little oppressive. \"The hostage, Yu Si, is completely frightened. She can’t move at all. I can only...\"","Ye Jian understood him the best. The faint gloominess on his cold expression made Ye Jian’s heart hurt as if it was being pricked by needles. \"Is Wang Qian still unconscious?\"","As soon as Xia Jinyuan nodded, Ye Jian seized the time and said quickly, \"That’s right. Even if you had realized that the felon had one leg stuck and couldn’t move and even if you had saved Yu Si, you wouldn’t have been able to save Wang Qian immediately. You would’ve put Wang Qian in a hopeless situation, and the crazy felon would’ve done something to him.","\"Captain Xia, you don’t have to blame yourself for not discovering that the felon’s leg was stuck. It’s a good decision to lure the felon out of the car and save the seriously injured! I think you’ve already thought about it, Captain Xia. We’re all doing our best to save all the hostages, so we don’t have to blame ourselves.\"","It was every soldier’s duty to protect the safety of the people. When he realized that he couldn’t protect the safety of the people, Xia Jinyuan blamed himself.","Rescuing the hostages, especially when the hostages were unable to move, was extremely difficult. Even Xia Jinyuan, who was a special forces soldier, had to be careful.","To rescue hostages, the priority was to stabilize the criminal first, then stabilize the hostages so that they would cooperate and not struggle blindly. Only then could the rescue plan be launched.","Before Ye Jian and the two police officers came, the entire scene was controlled by Xia Jinyuan alone. He even pulled back the driver who wanted to help.","It was not easy to stabilize the situation on his own."]},{"number":5057,"title":"Chapter 5057: Careful","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan exhaled softly. He understood what Ye Jian was saying. He didn’t let the situation affect him. He calmly made arrangements. \"The felon hasn’t seen you. You’re in the dark while I’m in the light. I’ll drive to cover you. Take the opportunity to get close to Gongga Ningbu. I’ll retreat a kilometer before you move.\"","Although he blamed himself, it didn’t affect Xia Jinyuan’s control of the entire situation. He knew what he should do next to better rescue all the hostages.","\"Okay!\" Ye Jian nodded. She looked at the two parked cars and flashed the police pistol in her hand. \"Drive the Jeep over. I’ll settle the rest.\"","There were two dead police officers in the civilian passenger vehicle, so they couldn’t drive over.","Seeing the police phone in her hand, a vicious look flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s dark eyes. \"Okay!\"","Looking at the police officer running over, he narrowed his dark eyes. He perfected the plan he had just laid out again.","Time was tight. Everything needed to be arranged quickly.","To the few people who participated in the rescue of the hostages, time passed too quickly. However, to Gongga Ningbu, time was too slow.","He climbed to the front passenger seat from the back. The small space made most of his body press against Yu Si, who was so frightened that she was speechless.","He released Yu Si’s seatbelt. His gaze was sinister as he helped the hostage who was weak all over. The thin and sharp plastic piece was pressed against the aorta on Yu Si’s neck. \"Behave yourself, or I’ll kill you!\"","With that, he pushed Yu Si out of the car. Yu Si, who was already in a daze, didn’t make any sound.","Yu Si’s mental state had been severely affected, and she couldn’t move. Wang Qian was heavily injured and unconscious, so he couldn’t move either. Gongga Ningbu’s desire to live was extremely strong. Xia Jinyuan was betting that before Gongga Ningbu got into a new car, he wouldn’t be afraid of acting rashly. Hence, he chose to agree to Gongga Ningbu’s request.","Gongga Ningbu, who ran out of the Jeep, didn’t care about Wang Qian, who was still inside. He wouldn’t waste his energy on a hostage whose fate was unknown.","The sharp plastic piece in his hand was pressed against Yu Si’s neck again. He dragged Yu Si away from the Jeep and headed toward the road.","As soon as he approached the road, he saw two police officers and lost control again. He shouted, \"Stay away from me, do you hear me? Stay away from me! Where’s my car? Where’s my car?\"","Cai Yan, who was sitting in the middle of the road with Tian Tian, raised his head and looked forward in shock. He saw Yu Si.","Recalling what the two police officers had told him just now, Cai Yan bit the tip of his tongue with his teeth to suppress the shock that rushed from his chest to his throat.","The police officers had told him not to look in front. He could not look in front. He just needed to take care of Tian Tian.","Tian Tian’s situation was still alright. Cai Yan kept talking to stimulate her, waking her up bit by bit. She could still talk intermittently.","However, she didn’t know about Wang Qian’s and Yu Si’s situation. Cai Yan, who was shocked and afraid, didn’t dare to tell her as he was worried that she would be agitated.","Tian Tian, who had woken up, also heard the voice that frightened her. She finally regained her senses and was shocked again.","\"Young man, don’t look, don’t look! He’s far away from us. He can’t hurt us. Don’t be afraid.\" Cai Yan was so afraid that the driver even comforted him softly. \"Don’t worry, we have the police and the People’s Liberation Army to protect us. Your friend will be fine too. They’re all thinking of ways to save your friends.\""]},{"number":5058,"title":"Chapter 5058: Evil","paragraphs":["The driver didn’t realize that Tian Tian was afraid too.","\"That’s right, that’s right. Don’t be afraid. We’ll accompany you. Let’s listen to the police. Don’t run around.\" The driver’s wife, who was also very afraid, comforted Cai Yan. \"I just saw a woman from the People’s Liberation Army. She’s not afraid at all. You’re a young man. What are you afraid of?\"","Cai Yan didn’t know what to say to that.","He was indeed afraid. However, with the driver and his wife accompanying him, he felt more at ease. He could even comfort Tian Tian, whose eyes were filled with fear. \"It’s okay, it’s okay. Lie down. The ambulance will be here soon. Wait a while more.\"","The two policemen who were warned immediately stopped in their tracks and retreated step by step. Gongga Ningbu was still worried. They had guns in their hands. He would only be safe if they were too far away to be seen.","He shouted at them, \"Retreat! Retreat! Don’t let me see you!\"","Xia Jinyuan started the car. The sound of the engine attracted Gongga Ningbu’s attention.","In the gully on the left side of the road, which was the side where the Jeep overturned, Ye Jian, who had already started moving, hunched her back and quickened her pace as the car started moving. She chose to shoot from Gongga Ningbu’s blind spot.","She needed to kill this serious felon with one shot.","The police used a Type 92 9mm pistol with a magazine capacity of 15 rounds. The moment she took the cell phone, Ye Jian was glad that only Ping Tao and Duo Ji had guns. The two police officers who died didn’t have guns.","Ye Jian was already close to the overturned Jeep. She quickly walked around the front of the Jeep. As she walked around, she glanced at the front windshield that was cracked into a spiderweb. Among the fragments, she could vaguely see a motionless figure lying on the side of the completely deformed left door.","That was... Wang Qian.","Ye Jian tightened her grip on the gun in her hand. With a fierce look in her eyes, she rushed out of the front of the vehicle.","Xia Jinyuan had already stopped the Jeep. He jumped down from the vehicle and waved the car keys in his hand. He looked past Gongga Ningbu’s shoulder and saw Ye Jian raising her gun.","Gongga Ningbu saw the shaking car keys. His gaze was tense, and he didn’t dare to relax at all. \"Put the car keys...\"","As soon as he opened his mouth, he, who had a beastly instinct for danger, seemed to sense something and slashed at Yu Si’s neck.","Bang!","The gunshot sounded before he could react. Before he could finish slashing Yu Si’s throat, the bullet that tore through the air behind him passed through the back of his head with the smell of death.","The bullet penetrated the hard skull and was lodged in his brain. Blood didn’t flow out immediately.","The moment the two police officers heard the gunshot, they ran over. They should have succeeded!","A sniper from the military unit should be able to kill a serious felon with one shot, no matter the distance!","The two police officers ran over. Xia Jinyuan jumped up and raised his leg to kick Gongga Ningbu away.","From shooting to kicking, it was done in a flash. The confrontation lasted for nearly half an hour before the felon was killed.","Gongga Ningbu, who was kicked to the ground, widened his eyes before he died. There was an indelible fear in his fierce expression. When he sensed danger coming from behind, Gongga Ningbu, who had a strong desire to live, was afraid. The fear rose from the bottom of his heart as if an avalanche had pressed down on his body.","He noticed it, but it was too late. Before he died, he even heard the gunshot behind him."]},{"number":5059,"title":"Chapter 5059: Justice","paragraphs":["Gunshot...","Who fired the gun?","Shocked, unwilling, and struggling, Gongga Ningbu fell into the wide ravine behind him. His head hit the rocks in the ravine. Blood mixed with something white flowed out and meandered into the cracks in the rocks, staining the ground with white sand.","His hands were full of sins, and the kindness in his heart had long been devoured by evil. He had killed thousands of Tibetan antelopes and three volunteers. This serious felon was finally killed.","His blood was stained with sin. It was a blasphemy to the ground.","Yu Si, whose eyes were empty, was supported by Xia Jinyuan. Even the gunshot didn’t pull her senses back. Her facial expression was blank as she slid down Xia Jinyuan’s arm.","Xia Jinyuan let her sit down and shouted at Cai Yan, who was still talking to Tian Tian, \"Cai Yan! Cai Yan!\"","Xia Jinyuan was worried that the hostage would go crazy from fright.","This was not the first time such an example had happened.","The moment the gun sounded, Cai Yan was so frightened that his body trembled violently.","When he heard the soldier calling him, he crawled over.","Ye Jian put away her pistol and ran over. She took Yu Si from Xia Jinyuan’s arm. The crisis was resolved. She was more suitable to take care of Yu Si than Xia Jinyuan.","\"I’ll save Wang Qian!\" Xia Jinyuan retracted his arm and stood up quickly. Two police officers ran over. Xia Jinyuan only said that they had successfully killed Wang Qian. The two of them didn’t check and quickly moved toward the overturned Jeep.","The driver took a careful look. Seeing the situation, he patted his chest and said to his wife, \"I’ll go over and help. You accompany the girl.\"","\"Old Tan!\"","Her husband wanted to run over to the scene again. As his wife, she was a little unwilling. Who knew if something would happen again?","\"It’s okay. They need help.\" The driver ran over after he finished speaking. What would happen? There were police and soldiers. There was nothing to be afraid of!","Also, the person who fired just now... was that female soldier, right?","How bold!","She even dared to shoot.","The criminal was most likely killed by her!","It served him right!","Such a person should be killed. He shouldn’t be allowed to roam outside and harm others!","The bold driver even pulled along Cai Yan, whose legs were so weak that he couldn’t run. He sent Cai Yan to Ye Jian’s side and then looked at Ye Jian curiously.","From the corner of his eye, he suddenly saw the guy lying in the ditch. Blood flowed all over the ground. Even the bold driver trembled at the sight.","Oh my god, he was really shot to death!","\"Thank you, mister.\"","Ye Jian thanked him, distracting the driver from the scene of the dead body. It was better for the commoners not to look at such a bloody scene.","The driver immediately retracted his gaze and said hurriedly, \"You’re welcome. I’ll help if I can. I can’t cause trouble for you.\"","Pointing at the overturned jeep, he asked, \"Shall I go over and help?\"","Ye Jian smiled. \"Thank you very much. Please take care of yourself.\"","The kindness of the driver accentuated the extent of Gongga Ningbu’s evil.","Ye Jian watched as the driver left. Then, she said to Cai Yan, who was sweating anxiously, \"Come, let’s help her to the car first.\"","Cai Yan didn’t even dare to look into the ditch. He nodded frantically and followed Ye Jian to help Yu Si into the car.","The smell of blood wafted over with the wind and entered his nose. The smell of blood made Cai Yan glance into the ditch from the corner of his eyes. He only dared to take a look. When he saw that the person was motionless, he didn’t dare to look anymore."]},{"number":5060,"title":"Chapter 5060: Miss Soldier","paragraphs":["Ye Jian saw Cai Yan’s small actions. It was normal for a young man to be curious. Now that the criminal who left a shadow in his heart had been killed, he should feel better after taking a look.","That was what Ye Jian thought.","Cai Yan only dared to glance briefly. He muttered a prayer in his heart. He was really dead! Blood flowed out from the back of his head. He must have... He glanced at the female soldier who was helping Yu Si walk...","Ah, she was so beautiful!","Cai Yan’s eyes lit up when he saw Ye Jian. He quickly retracted his gaze. She had blown up the fugitive’s head so beautifully. Thinking about it, he was... quite afraid.","If it were him, he wouldn’t dare to blow up the fugitive’s head even if he had a gun.","That wasn’t right. He was just an ordinary person. How could he shoot other people’s heads? Even a soldier couldn’t do it. It was because of the special situation!","Yu Si was helped to the car, where she sat down. Cai Yan saw that her clothes were stained with dust and her forehead was bruised. He relaxed a little.","He hesitated for a moment before saying to the female soldier who was pouring water from a military canteen, \"Miss, was she too frightened?\"","Ye Jian wanted to splash cold water on Yu Si’s face to stimulate her to come back to her senses. She nodded. \"Yes, she was too frightened. She needs to sober up.\"","She patted Yu Si’s pale face with her wet hands. \"Do you have towels or handkerchiefs?\"","\"Is a handkerchief okay?\"","\"Sure.\"","\"Here, here...\" Cai Yan unzipped the pocket of Yu Si’s jacket and took out a small square handkerchief. \"She bought it the moment she got off the plane. I was wondering why she wanted to buy such a thing. She said that she would eventually find a use for it. Miss, it seems like her words came true unintentionally.\"","Ye Jian took the small square handkerchief and smiled. \"It’s a beautiful square handkerchief. I can see why girls will like it.\"","\"Miss, do you like it?\"","Ye Jian, who was pouring water into the handkerchief, looked at the boy who was talking too much. She saw the uncontrollable nervousness in the boy’s eyes and knew that he was speaking to ease his nervousness. \"Me? I wear my military uniform all year round. I don’t need it.\"","\"Miss, you’re a lieutenant, right? Miss, how old are you? You’re a lieutenant at such a young age? Did you join the military very early? Did you join the military at the age of 18? That’s not right. There are people my parents’ age who have joined the military. I heard that they even made meritorious contributions. But they hadn’t become officers.\"","Cai Yan was an extroverted and talkative boy. In addition, his family background was not bad. He was very likable. In addition, he was quite handsome. He was good at talking and coaxing women, which was why they adored him.","As for Ye Jian, she found boys who talked a lot to be a headache.","If it weren’t for the special situation and because she saw the fear in his eyes, she would’ve left.","\"I’m 22 years old. I guess you can say that I joined the military early.\" Ye Jian picked up the wet silk handkerchief and gently wiped Yu Si’s face. Cai Yan, who was beside her, exclaimed, \"22 years old! You’re the same age as me! I’m 22 years old too! If that’s the case, I shouldn’t have been addressing you as a miss!","\"You joined the military at a young age. Did you join the military after graduating from high school? Why did you think of joining the military? I heard that it’s hard for females to get into the military. You’re quite lucky.\"","Ye Jian sighed softly in her heart. She turned her head and looked at him seriously. \"Yu Si hasn’t woken up. Talk to her more.\" It was fine to ask about other things, but he always asked questions that were difficult for her to answer."]},{"number":5061,"title":"Chapter 5061: A Handsome Man","paragraphs":["Cai Yan blinked. \"Oh... Oh, okay. I, I... I thought she was fine, so... I wanted to talk to you.\"","After receiving the order, Cai Yan immediately forgot what he had asked just now. Just like before, he kept talking to Yu Si and even patted Yu Si’s face from time to time.","Shouts of ’one, two, one’ came from the side of the road. As Wang Qian’s lower body was stuck, he couldn’t be rescued from the vehicle directly. After a short discussion, Xia Jinyuan and the two police officers decided to right the overturned Jeep properly.","Two more trucks passed by, as well as a private sedan. When the drivers saw the car accident, they thought that it was a collision between two cars, so they stopped to save them. The four of them became 11 people.","In order to prevent the Jeep from shaking and harming Wang Qian a second time, Xia Jinyuan requisitioned a sloping wooden step used for unloading the truck and attached it to the suspended side. He then tied it tightly with two thick hemp ropes and pushed the side while shouting ’one, two, one’. The four enthusiastic drivers pulled the thick ropes on the sloping wooden step on the suspended side. With the cooperation of eight people, and with three people on both sides giving constant instructions, the overturned vehicle was slowly moved bit by bit.","Although the vehicle shook a little, it wouldn’t hurt Wang Qian a second time.","They were all working hard to save Wang Qian. With Xia Jinyuan around, Ye Jian only needed to take care of Yu Si.","As for the dead felon, Gongga Ningbu, he was already covered with an old blanket. It was used by the police officers who were on an overnight mission to block the cold when they rested in the car. This was to prevent him from scaring the enthusiastic drivers and passengers who participated in the rescue.","Those who participated in the rescue actually saw the dead body. However, they didn’t know that the person lying on the ground was a dead felon. They thought that it was an unfortunate person who died in the car accident.","Halfway through straightening the Jeep, Yu Si finally came back to her senses.","She blinked, focus gradually returning to her eyes. Then, right on the heels of that, her lips trembled violently, and her body and hands started trembling too. Ye Jian was afraid that she would bite her tongue in shock, so she immediately stuffed the wet silk handkerchief into Yu Si’s mouth. She raised her voice slightly and said gently, \"Yu Si, Yu Si, don’t be afraid. Don’t be afraid. You’re safe now. Do you understand? You’re safe now.","\"You’re safe now. Look, Cai Yan is accompanying you.\"","Cai Yan immediately understood what Ye Jian meant. He held Yu Si’s trembling hand tightly and said loudly, \"Yu Si, we’ve all been saved! Wang Qian, Tian Tian, and I are all fine. Hurry up and talk to me. We’re all saved. We’re all fine! Really!","\"Do you see that? There’s the People’s Liberation Army beside us. Haven’t you always wanted to find a soldier as your boyfriend? Let me tell you, you don’t even need me to introduce you. Your future boyfriend is right in front of you!\"","Ye Jian didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","\"He’s so handsome! He’s even more handsome than the most handsome guy in our school! Really, I’m not lying to you. He’s even more handsome than a celebrity! He’s tall and handsome. You’ll definitely like him at first glance! He’s really a handsome soldier, an officer! Lieutenant colonel! If you don’t look, you won’t have a chance. Tian Tian will snatch him away!\"","Ye Jian didn’t know if it was because of Cai Yan’s familiar voice or because of the soldier boyfriend Cai Yan mentioned or because of the last sentence about Tian Tian snatching the soldier boyfriend away, but Yu Si threw herself into Cai Yan’s arms and cried."]},{"number":5062,"title":"Chapter 5062: Rest In Peace","paragraphs":["\"Cai Yan, Cai Yan!\" She cried and cursed loudly, \"You screwed me over! I almost lost my life! I almost lost my life!\"","Yu Si’s loud voice made Ye Jian feel relieved.","It was good that she was crying. She was still crying and cursing her friend at the same time. When the time came, she would be sent to the hospital for the doctor to observe and decide if she should be hospitalized.","After escaping death, Cai Yan didn’t care about the difference between men and women. He hugged Yu Si, who was crying in his arms. Then, Ye Jian saw him cry too. Tears fell on Yu Si’s head. \"Yes, yes, yes. I admit to my mistake.","\"We’re fine now. We’re fine. We’re fine! We’re saved! We’re even sitting in the military Jeep. Let me tell you, this car is huge. There’s also that satellite communication. I saw it on television before. You know those scenes where a guy is chasing after a criminal while talking to a few parties. Do you want to take a look?","\"A very handsome officer was driving this car! Do you want to take a look? I guarantee that you’ll like him! Shall I bring you to take a look now? Have you cried enough? Do you want to wash your face before taking a look?\"","Ye Jian touched her forehead and said to Cai Yan, \"Stay with Yu Si now. I’ll go and see Wang Qian.\"","In order to quickly sober up his good friend, Cai Yan, who kept mentioning Xia Jinyuan’s looks, cried and nodded. He pulled Yu Si out of his arms. \"Do you see that? There’s a very beautiful soldier beside you, a lieutenant! She’s even prettier than a celebrity. Just look at her and you’ll know that I’m not lying to you. There’s really a very handsome male officer too!\"","Ye Jian, who was prettier than a celebrity, smiled at Yu Si who was looking up at her. \"Yu Si, you’re saved now. All danger is far away from you. A car will arrive later and send you back to Xiji City. You and Cai Yan can rest in this car for now.\"","Yu Si, who was crying until she was out of breath, had blurred vision because of her tears. In her daze, she couldn’t see who was talking to her. She only knew that she was safe now. The pervert who pounced on the car and held a ’knife’ to her throat was no longer around.","She choked on her tears and thanked Ye Jian a few times. Then, she continued to pull Cai Yan’s sleeve and cry. As for the handsome male soldier and pretty female soldier, she couldn’t be bothered about them.","Ye Jian came out of the Jeep and immediately participated in the rescue of Wang Qian. The Jeep on the left was completely deformed and had collapsed. Although the front of the Jeep was placed on the side of the ravine, they were already able to rescue Wang Qian more smoothly.","Due to its remote geographical location, the road was flat and there were no obstacles on both sides. The car accident happened on a road that had never had a car accident since the construction of the national highway. The ambulance and fire trucks couldn’t rush over immediately, so they could only rely on themselves.","This was why drivers who passed by would stop to participate in the rescue. Those who were familiar with this part of the road knew the situation.","The director of XiJi City Police Station and the director of Gangcha County Police Station, who were rushing over, immediately knew everything after Gongga Ningbu was killed, including the fact that a hostage, Wang Qian, was trapped in the car and needed to be rescued urgently.","A sniper from the military unit shot Gongga Ningbu in the back of the head and killed him on the spot. When the news came, the director of Xiji City Police Station downed two cups of warm water. The director of Gangcha County Police Station, who was sitting in the car, held his cell phone tightly with one hand. Two streams of tears appeared on his tanned face.","He hoped the sacrificed police officers would rest in peace now!"]},{"number":5063,"title":"Chapter 5063: Heroes Will Last Forever","paragraphs":["The criminal had been executed. He wouldn’t be able to cause trouble anymore. The sacrificed police officers didn’t have to worry about him.","The director hoped they would rest in peace.","The director of Gangcha County Police Station covered his face with his hands that were so rough that there were fine black lines on the back of his hands. He panted heavily.","In the car, the three police officers who drove the car were already in tears.","At this moment, the police officers from Gangcha County Police Station already knew that Dayang Ciwang and Ah Da, who had joined the police force for less than three years, had died. The entire police station was shrouded in sorrow. Everyone’s faces were filled with deep sorrow. They had been working in the communication room for their entire lives. Among them, an old man who didn’t want to leave even after reaching retirement age, wiped his tears and muttered, \"More sacrifices...\"","\"When I go back... I’ll tell Ah Da’s and Ciwang’s families. You guys... don’t tell them first. I have to go to Ah Da’s and Ciwang’s house. I have to apologize...\" The director informed the police station with red eyes. He first hid the matter from the families of the two police officers.","The officer on duty swallowed his words.","The bodies of the two civilian police officers who were sacrificed had yet to return. The civilian police officers who were out on duty in the county knew about it and told their colleagues to inform them when their comrades came back so that they could rush back to see their comrades.","Gangcha County Police Station was filled with sorrow. The event location where the car accident happened was also filled with sorrow. The three police officers and three traffic police who took turns guarding Lari Village all year round were the first to arrive. On the way there, they already knew that their comrades had died. They didn’t have time to see them before they joined the rescue mission.","Xia Jinyuan suggested that the enthusiastic drivers and passengers who participated in the rescue could leave. Hence, a traffic policeman directed the parked vehicles to leave first.","\"Look! They’re saluting us!\"","A driver suddenly realized that the two young officers who were sending them off were standing by the road and saluting them. For a moment, he was touched and proud.","Those were the soldiers who would definitely stand up to protect the people in times of danger!","They didn’t know that the commercial van parked at the side of the road which they passed by contained two dead bodies of police officers. They could no longer open their eyes...","As for the dead felon, Gongga Ningbu, no one looked at him except for the traffic police who were standing at the side.","They worked together and used a jack to open the deformed door. Wang Qian was successfully rescued. The ambulance hadn’t arrived yet. It was all up to Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan to check on him.","Wang Qian was lucky that he didn’t have any internal injuries. Only his legs were fractured. The extent of the fracture was unknown. His arm was dislocated too. After Ye Jian checked that his arm wasn’t fractured, she placed it back. Her technique was swift. Wang Qian, who was unconscious, didn’t feel anything.","They didn’t wait for the ambulance in the same spot. After confirming that the ambulance had set off from Xiji City and that Wang Qian’s life wasn’t in danger for the time being, they carried Wang Qian to the military Jeep. Tian Tian had been carried to the police car that came to rescue her. A police officer took care of her and rushed all the way to Xiji City.","Before they left, Ye Jian, Xia Jinyuan, and the two police officers who left first came to the van and saluted the two police officers who had been sacrificed.","The heroes of the people would live forever!","Half an hour later, a soft voice came from Wang Qian’s mouth. Ye Jian, who was taking care of him, noticed it immediately and woke him up gently.","At this moment, all four hostages had been successfully rescued. No one died, and the felon was successfully killed.","Evil could not defeat good. That was how it was."]},{"number":5064,"title":"Chapter 5064: Guard","paragraphs":["Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, who still had a mission to complete, couldn’t continue to escort the two dead police officers back to their hometown, Gangcha County. They could only salute the solemn soldiers and bid farewell to the eternal heroes of the people.","The police, Ping Tao and Duo Ji, drove the van and rushed back to Gangcha County with their comrades.","The body of the criminal, Gongga Ningbu, was transported back to Gangcha County with the murder weapon. He was from the county city of Gangcha County. Even though he had been killed, his trial still needed to be carried out.","In front, two traffic police officers were escorting the vehicle that carried the returning heroes in police cars. The sirens were howling as they cleared the way.","The four cars split into two groups. The sun would still shine on the four hostages who had survived tomorrow. The dead heroes would rest forever, and the dark land would accompany them.","Xia Jinyuan drove while Ye Jian took care of the unconscious Wang Qian. Their hearts were heavy. The two of them were very silent along the way.","After a huge turn, Ye Jian turned around and looked behind the car. She saw that the car at the back had already disappeared. The pressure on her chest made her unable to breathe.","She had already faced countless sacrifices, but she still couldn’t accept it. Sadness, anger, heaviness... It was like a huge mountain pressing down on her until she couldn’t even straighten her back.","Ye Jian exhaled softly and asked Xia Jinyuan, who was driving, \"Captain Xia, are low-level police officers often sacrificed?\"","\"It can’t be said to be frequent. It’s just that wherever they are, there will be sacrifices. There’s no avoiding it 100%. We can only try our best to reduce the numbers. Just like us, sacrifices are unavoidable. We can only lower the sacrifice rate.\" Xia Jinyuan let out a sigh of relief. There was a faint haze in his dark eyes. \"Ye Jian, after you go to the air force, study hard and learn the real hard skills. In the future, they’ll be your life-protecting shield when you’re in danger. You’ll be able to go out and return safely.\"","Ye Jian hummed softly. She lowered her eyes slightly to hide the shadows in the depths of her eyes. She should study hard. In the future, she had to train harder than she was now.","Every second was worth its weight in gold. If they wasted time, they were wasting their lives.","After a few sentences, the two of them fell silent again. Xia Jinyuan drove seriously while Ye Jian took care of Wang Qian, who had yet to wake up.","The two of them had faced the topic of ’sacrifice’ countless times. They both knew in their hearts that sacrifice was inevitable. There was no need to discuss the issue of ’sacrifice’ again and again. They faced it together in silence.","After driving for about 20 kilometers, Ye Jian saw the unconscious Wang Qian frowning. Before he could open his eyes, the expression on his face turned from pain to shock. Ye Jian pressed Wang Qian’s shoulder lightly with one hand and said in a soft and calm voice, \"Wang Qian, you have some small injuries. Don’t struggle. We’re going to the hospital now.\"","Wang Qian didn’t open his eyes immediately. Instead, he struggled. He seemed to be having a dream. His limbs were twitching slightly. As he frowned, the expression on his face became deeper.","\"Wang Qian, you’re saved now. The criminal who kidnapped you is under the control of the police. Yu Si, Tian Tian, Cai Yan, and the rest are all fine. You’re fine too. There’s no need to be afraid anymore.\""]},{"number":5065,"title":"Chapter 5065: Travel Together","paragraphs":["It was unknown if it was because of Ye Jian’s voice, but Wang Qian, who had been struggling in pain, panted heavily and opened his eyes.","Unlike Yu Si, he wasn’t stunned. He felt as if his body had been crushed by a car. Waves of pain made him sober up. The pain and fear in the depths of his heart made him widen his eyes. He stared at the face of the unfamiliar woman who appeared in front of him. Right on the heels of that, he instinctively wanted to get up...","\"You can’t move now. Lie down properly.\" Ye Jian’s hand never left his shoulder. She smiled and said, \"We’re going to the hospital now. You can only move after the doctor has examined you. Also, you’re fine now. You, Cai Yan, Yu Si, and Tian Tian are fine.\"","Wang Qian blinked. Just as he was about to say something, he choked on his saliva and coughed violently.","When Ye Jian saw this, her gaze changed slightly. She asked Wang Qian, who was coughing violently, in a low voice, \"Does your chest hurt? Is your head dizzy? Do you want to vomit?\"","Wang Qian, who was so out of breath that he couldn’t speak, only raised his wrist slightly and waved his hand to show that he didn’t feel anything besides pain, damn it! It was so damn painful!","Was he going to be a cripple?","He coughed so hard that he tilted his shoulder to one side. He coughed until he could breathe smoothly and then slowly lay back down.","\"Damn it, we’re finally saved.\" Wang Qian, who was lying down comfortably and twitching his fingers in pain, opened his mouth. The moment he opened his mouth, something seemed to have pricked it. His expression froze. Then, it changed again. His tongue moved agilely in his mouth. A hard little thing made his stiff cheeks twitch.","Damn it! A tooth! It was definitely a tooth!","He broke half a tooth.","Wang Qian’s expression changed drastically. He closed his eyes in pain. Half of his teeth were broken. How could he face anyone in the future?","Ye Jian was shocked by his ever-changing expressions. She hurriedly asked, \"Are you feeling unwell? If you’re feeling unwell, you must tell me in time! When you were unconscious, we only gave you a simple check-up. We couldn’t confirm if there were any other problems with your body.\"","\"No, I just bit on my broken tooth,\" Wang Qian replied in a weak voice. He tilted his head and spat out his broken tooth.","Ye Jian lowered her head and looked at the tooth. There was a smile in her eyes.","Wang Qian, who had a broken tooth, heaved a long sigh of relief. After he heaved a sigh of relief, he felt that he was really alive.","Looking at the face of the unfamiliar woman who was looking at him with concern, Wang Qian thanked her. She was very young and was probably the same age as him.","As he had been in a daze, he didn’t know who saved him. In addition, Ye Jian had taken off her camouflage jacket and covered the body of the policeman who had been sacrificed. Now, she was only wearing a dark green thermal loose undergarment. Wang Qian couldn’t tell that the person who saved him was a soldier.","After thanking him, Wang Qian took the initiative to ask how the person who kidnapped them was doing and if he had been caught by the police. Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief when she saw that he still had the energy to talk to her. She smiled and replied to his questions one by one. \"It’s all settled. He was also taken away by the police. He won’t be able to commit crimes in the future.\"","Hearing this, Wang Qian seemed to have vented his anger. He was just short of clapping and celebrating!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say anything. As he listened to the young man talking, his tense and handsome face softened a lot. As long as he was fine, everything would be easy."]},{"number":5066,"title":"Chapter 5066: Life","paragraphs":["Halfway through, the Vanguard Battalion contacted Xia Jinyuan through satellite communication. The simple call from the military unit made Wang Qian, who was lying on the ground, feel that something was wrong. Why was it like watching a military television show?","\"Entering National Highway Section 3067, 137 kilometers away from the two vehicles, over.\"","\"Roger that. Please drive carefully to ensure the safety of the injured.\"","\"Roger that!\" Xia Jinyuan replied.","Wang Qian, who spoke to Ye Jian from time to time and even asked Ye Jian to help feed him water, felt a little excited. He stared at Ye Jian and suppressed the excitement in his throat. He asked, \"Are you... soldiers? Am I on a military vehicle now?\"","\"Yes, we’re serving in the military, and we’re on a military Jeep,\" Ye Jian replied with a smile. Every time she saw the trust in the eyes of the people she was protecting, Ye Jian couldn’t help but feel proud.","When Wang Qian heard this, he was so excited that he forgot that he was injured. He raised his hand and dug into his pocket. As soon as he raised his arm, he cried out in pain. Waves of dull pain came from the bones of his right arm.","Ye Jian pressed his shoulder and sighed. \"I just told you that you shouldn’t move now. If you want to find anything, you can tell me.\"","\"I want to ask for your autograph! This is the first time I’ve met a soldier.\"","After knowing that Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan were both soldiers, Wang Qian started to talk more. He was even worse than Cai Yan. Xia Jinyuan, who was driving, felt the back of his head hurting, let alone Ye Jian.","Wang Qian didn’t stop until they met up with the ambulance from Xiji City.","Soon, Wang Qian and Tian Tian were carried on stretchers. The medical staff quickly checked their injuries. When Wang Qian was carried out of the vehicle, he saw Xia Jinyuan standing by the car door. Even though it was just a quick glance, he said, \"Damn, he’s even more handsome than me!\"","On the other side, Cai Yan and Yu Si got out of a sedan.","There were not enough vehicles, so they took the car of a civilian that was returning to Xiji City.","The police officer who was protecting the two of them thanked the driver of the sedan. The two of them didn’t wait for the medical staff to come over and ran toward the two ambulances parked in front.","They wanted to know how their good friends, Wang Qian and Tian Tian, were doing.","Tian Tian was asleep. She didn’t even wake up when she was carried into the ambulance. Naturally, it wasn’t good to wake her up. Wang Qian didn’t sleep as he had chatted the entire journey. He was really in pain. The first thing he said when they handed him to the medical staff was, \"Doctor, can you give me two painkillers?\"","At this moment, a nurse was administering an IV drip, and a medical staff was checking his body.","Cai Yan and Yu Si popped their heads in. Wang Qian was so happy that he wanted to sit up. He only stopped when the medical staff shouted at him.","Yu Si, who was pushed out of the vehicle and injured by Gongga Ningbu, could already run and jump. She even hit Cai Yan in the car in front of the escorting police and told the police what had happened. She originally wanted the police to teach Cai Yan a lesson, but in the end, the two of them were reprimanded together. The two of them lowered their heads like chicks and didn’t even dare to breathe loudly.","When the two medical staff saw that the two of them could jump, they smiled at the policeman who was jogging over. \"It’s obvious that there’s no problem. They don’t even need to go to the hospital.\"","The policeman who was escorting them knew that the two of them were fine. But he was still a little worried. \"We should still go and take a look. She received a big shock just now.\"","At least the hostages were safe and sound. He felt a little comforted."]},{"number":5067,"title":"Chapter 5067: Them","paragraphs":["Yu Si was a little embarrassed. \"I was too frightened just now. Now, I’m fine. Mr. Policeman, I want to thank the two people who saved me. Can I... go over?\"","\"You want to see the handsome soldier, right?\" Cai Yan teased her softly. Yu Si raised her leg and kicked him sideways. She warned, \"Shut up!\"","Wang Qian, who was on an IV drip, dragged his sick body and joined the conversation. \"He’s indeed very handsome. I didn’t even know that there was such a handsome soldier driving. Ha... Ouch, it hurts...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, the nurse who was giving him an injection smiled and said, \"It’s good to be young. The bones in your legs are broken, and there’s a hole in the back of your head, but you can still talk and laugh.\"","\"I know what you want to say. Before you woke up, I talked to the soldier for a long time. Let me tell you, that beautiful female soldier is only 22 years old! She’s the same age as me! She was holding...\"","\"Cai Yan, if you don’t go over, your savior will leave.\"","The policeman who was escorting the two of them interrupted Cai Yan. Cai Yan, who was reminded, swallowed his words in time and scratched the back of his head unhappily.","For a moment, he was so happy that he almost forgot to tell them that he saw the beautiful female soldier shooting a gun.","The medical staff and police officers smiled kindly. When they saw Cai Yan stop talking, the police officer smiled and said, \"Stop chatting. Hurry up and go over. If not, they’ll leave.","\"You should thank the soldiers who saved you. If it weren’t for them, who knows which corner of the mountain we would’ve found you. Go and thank them. And don’t do anything stupid again.\"","\"Definitely. I promise to be a good person in the future.\" Cai Yan nodded repeatedly. He was scolded by the police officers in the car and didn’t dare to talk back. He would definitely be a good person in the future. He didn’t want to be scolded by the police a second time.","Yu Si just wanted to thank the people who saved her. Seeing that he was still dawdling, she dragged Cai Yan and turned to the back.","There was only one military Jeep parked at the back. If they walked toward the back, they would definitely be able to find the soldiers.","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan, who had finished moving the injured, were communicating with the two Xiji City police who were receiving them. They told the two police officers why they met and where Ye Jian found the sacrificed police officers... They also told them the details of this hostage rescue mission.","The two police officers wanted to invite the soldiers who had made great contributions to the rescue of the hostages and killed the criminal back to Xiji City. However, they were rejected.","\"We’re sorry, we still have a mission to complete, so we can only cooperate until here. If there’s anything else, you can contact us before the day after tomorrow.\" Xia Jinyuan reported his phone number and explained, \"We’re returning to the military unit the day after tomorrow. According to the relevant rules of the military unit, mobile electronic devices have to be handed over.\"","\"Then, do you have the contact method of the military unit?\" A policeman who was taking notes looked up and asked. \"It’s mainly because we might need to contact you later.\"","Xia Jinyuan said, \"I’m sorry. If you still need my cooperation, you can leave a message. I’ll contact your institute after I turn on my phone.\"","The policeman looked at Xia Jinyuan and seemed to understand something. Then, he looked at Ye Jian. Ye Jian shook her head. \"I’m sorry, I’m in the same military unit as him.\"","The two police officers laughed and closed their notebooks. They reached out their hands to thank them again."]},{"number":5068,"title":"Chapter 5068: It’s Good To Be Alive","paragraphs":["The older policeman said in an extremely serious tone, \"I feel that the two of you are very cooperative. If the two of you hadn’t helped out in the hostage rescue and killed the felon, the consequences would’ve been unimaginable. Since the two of you still have a mission to do, we won’t waste your time. Thank you again!\"","Xia Jinyuan shook hands with them and said politely, \"This is what we should do. Thank you for your hard work.\"","The police officers glanced at the two figures who were peeking out from the front of the Jeep and said, \"There are people looking for the two of you in front. We won’t disturb you anymore.\"","The two people who were looking around heard the police’s words clearly. They hurriedly ran over and stood still. Without a word, the two of them bowed 90 degrees to Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian.","The older police officer smiled when he saw this. \"Not bad. You know how to come over to thank your saviors. Don’t do anything stupid in the future. Many people get into trouble because they make a stupid mistake and end up losing their lives. I hope you learn your lesson and don’t joke around with your lives. Do you understand?\"","The two of them knew that the police were doing this for their own good. They nodded obediently and accepted their reprimand. Cai Yan said, \"I understand! We won’t dare to do it again!","\"Thank you, officers. Thank you, soldiers.\"","Yu Si bowed deeply again. Her eyes were red as she sniffed. She bent over and didn’t get up for a long time. \"Thank you, officers. Thank you, soldiers.\"","Ye Jian smiled and helped her up. \"You’re welcome. You’ve all been given a scare. Don’t think too much when you go back. It’s over, so don’t take it to heart.","\"No matter how arrogant these criminals are, they won’t be able to escape the punishment of the law. You have to protect yourselves and take care of yourselves at all times. After all, the words ’criminal’ won’t be written on the faces of the criminals.\"","Yu Si was a girl. Ye Jian was the most suitable person to enlighten her. Facing the gentle guidance, Yu Si’s tears fell one after another. In the end, when she thanked the soldiers again.","One day, Yu Si said regretfully to Tian Tian, who was discharged from the hospital, \"Tian Tian, what I regret the most now is that I didn’t ask that beautiful soldier for her cell phone number. She’s beautiful and gentle. I like her so much.\"","After being discharged from the hospital, a blurry male face flashed past Tian Tian’s mind. She had a big regret too. That was... She pursed her lips and sighed. \"At least you know who saved us. As for me, I didn’t even see what they looked like.\"","\"It’s a huge loss for you! They’re a good-looking pair whose looks surpass any celebrities!\"","\"Stop talking! The more you talk about it, the more regretful I feel.\"","\"Hahaha, don’t regret it. You might have a chance in the future. I’ll tell you when I see them next time.\"","\"I hope there’s still a chance.\" Tian Tian sighed.","Yu Si thought for a moment before replying, \"There’ll definitely be a chance. After all, we’re still alive, right?\"","That was right, there would definitely be a chance. As long as they were alive, there would definitely be a chance.","It had been a month, but the two police officers who were sacrificed would never have a chance.","The sun was shining brightly outside. Spring had arrived. The mountain was filled with greenery. It was the peak of peach blossoms. It was good to be alive.","As long as one was alive, one would be able to see the sun, the flowers, the changes of the four seasons, the sun in summer, the fruits in autumn, and the snow in winter... As long as one was alive, one would be able to see them.","It was good to be alive.","Ye Jian hugged the parachute and jumped down from 3,000 meters in the air. She felt the strong wind whistling in her ears. She felt her chest being squeezed and her pulse jumping. When the snow-white parachute opened with a bang, she pulled the rope and landed in the designated area.","She had become an air force soldier."]},{"number":5069,"title":"Chapter 5069: All Around","paragraphs":["After coming out of the northwest, Ye Jian didn’t rest at all. She didn’t even know the results of the female soldiers’ assessment before heading to an air force special training base.","That day, the two of them arrived at the military depot in the evening. Xia Jinyuan had just parked the car and had yet to hand over the car keys when two air force soldiers walked out of the military depot. When they saw Ye Jian, they strode toward her quickly.","Xia Jinyuan, who was still holding the car keys in his hand, was stunned. Then, he turned his head and said to Ye Jian, who had gotten out of the car and closed the door, \"Why are they here so soon?\"","Ye Jian, who had closed the car door, saw the soldiers in the air force’s blue camouflage uniform striding toward her. She was also stunned.","Why were they here so soon?","Two air force soldiers came over and saluted the two of them. One of them, a round-faced and energetic young air force soldier, stood upright and introduced himself seriously. Then, he told Ye Jian that they would leave in an hour on a military helicopter.","They would leave in an hour!","That meant that Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan could only spend another hour together.","Their parting was a little sudden. Even though the two of them were already prepared, they were caught off guard. Fortunately, the two of them were calm and didn’t let others notice anything amiss. Xia Jinyuan handed the car keys to the soldiers at the military depot and pulled Ye Jian to walk around the military depot.","The military depot they arrived at was a small county city. The small county city was located under a group of gray snow mountains. As long as they raised their heads, they could see the white snow on the top of the snow mountains. Although it was spring, the temperature in the small county city was still a little low. They could even smell the cold smell of snow in the air.","This was a very small county city. If one drove in a straight line for 20 minutes, one could go from the east to the west.","The two of them left the military depot and walked around. Xia Jinyuan even brought Ye Jian to drink a bowl of mutton soup. When he saw that it was about time, he sent Ye Jian back to the military depot.","They were already used to being apart. After walking around, the sadness brought about by their sudden separation faded a lot. When he sent Ye Jian off, Xia Jinyuan remained standing at the entrance of the military depot. He stood tall and straight with an elegant smile on his face as he watched his lover leave.","In the past, Ye Jian was the one who sent him off. Now, Xia Jinyuan was the one who sent Ye Jian off.","Only the two of them knew what it was like.","The two of them parted ways in such a small county. Xia Jinyuan and Ye Jian were headed in two opposite directions.","If there was no special reason, it would be difficult to see each other again in the past two years.","In addition, the two of them were in a special military unit and couldn’t contact the outside world at any time. One of them might have time, but the other might not. That meant that in the next two years, they probably wouldn’t even have many phone calls together. It might even be zero. It might even be the longest time they would lose contact since they fell in love.","The last time they lost contact for so long was when Xia Jinyuan was lurking around Cobra.","After entering a place in the southwest that couldn’t even be found on the company’s map, Ye Jian had three days to adapt. They mainly wanted to see if she could adapt to the highlands.","When Principal Chen and Grandpa Gen were still alive, Ye Jian had undergone high altitude climate training. After Grandpa Gen passed away, Principal Chen brought Ye Jian to the high altitude area to complete her training. During the training, she met Xia Jinyuan and helped Xia Jinyuan to eliminate a foreign mercenary who entered the territory."]},{"number":5070,"title":"Chapter 5070: Hide Your Strength","paragraphs":["Because it involved the Xueyu unit, this training was classified as a Class A military secret. Hence, other than Commander Xia, Major General Yang, and Xia Jinyuan, no one else knew about it.","Even when Ye Jian was lent to a certain military unit, the information wasn’t revealed. Only the top figures of the air force unit knew all her personal information.","For instance, Captain Lei. He knew what training Ye Jian had undergone and how many military achievements she had. Other than that, he didn’t know anything else.","As for her military merits, Captain Lei only knew that Ye Jian had three third-class honors and two second-class honors. He didn’t know what missions she earned these military merits from.","Even though he didn’t know the exact reason, it was enough to shock Captain Lei and the others.","She was still a military school student. When she was still in school, she received a total of five military merits. There was a photo from when she was awarded the lieutenant rank at her graduation ceremony last year. She had gun wounds, knife wounds, cuts, bruises, and abrasions. When Captain Lei and the other people in charge saw this photo, they felt a faint pain in their bodies.","How much pain was Ye Jian in back then? How much willpower did she have to endure the pain until she came back alive?","After seeing the photo, the other figures who were still unhappy with the female special forces soldier didn’t complain anymore. When Ye Jian arrived, the instructors in charge of the female airborne soldiers’ training specially came out to welcome her personally to show their respect.","During the three-day observation period, Commander Sun avoided Captain Lei and the rest and secretly chatted with Ye Jian for nearly two hours. After sending Commander Sun off, Ye Jian rubbed her forehead for a while.","Ye Jian felt that this was a difficult problem to solve. At the same time, she felt that Commander Sun thought too highly of her.","As an army soldier who came from the army to learn from the air force, did she still need to hide her strength and slowly display her strength to the carefully selected female airborne soldiers in the later stages?","Was that possible?","That was impossible.","Was there a need to hide her strength?","In the air force unit, she was just a new recruit. Why should she hide her abilities?","She just hoped she wouldn’t drag the rest down.","Three days later, Ye Jian, who was wearing an army camouflage uniform, appeared among the 14 female soldiers in the blue sky camouflage uniform. It was very abrupt and eye-catching.","Ye Jian was now about to jump down from the sky. The most nervous person wasn’t her but Captain Lei, who was observing her, as well as a few instructors in charge of the female airborne soldiers’ training.","\"Don’t be nervous, don’t be nervous. Take a deep breath. Everyone has to have their first time. After the first time, the second time will be fine. Don’t be nervous. It’s a game of the brave, a month of hard work.\"","If she didn’t pass... she would die.","An air force lieutenant standing behind Captain Lei raised his head and looked at the white parachutes in the sky.","Captain Lei, who was so nervous that he almost crushed his high-powered binoculars, took a deep breath. He kept his eyes fixed on Ye Jian, who was making the jump.","At this moment, white parachutes bloomed in the sky. Ye Jian’s parachute hadn’t appeared yet.","He was really nervous now. He was probably as nervous as Ye Jian, who had jumped.","No, it should be said that all the soldiers on the ground team were very nervous, especially Ye Jian, who was jumping for the first time.","In order to let Ye Jian complete her first jump successfully, she had to overcome the nervousness, obstacles, and fear of her first jump. After observing the weather for a few days, she decided to complete the jump today. The weather was beautiful, and the visibility was 100% good."]},{"number":5071,"title":"Chapter 5071: First Jump","paragraphs":["After a month of tough training, Ye Jian had her first jump today.","Before they left, Captain Lei specially accompanied her and kept encouraging her. Although it looked like she didn’t need it, as the captain, he had the responsibility to take care of every soldier.","Especially since it was Ye Jian’s first skydiving experience. He had to keep an eye on her and solve any problems immediately.","The nine female soldiers in front jumped down one by one with parachutes on their backs. They didn’t hesitate at all. The process was very familiar and adaptable.","When it was Ye Jian’s turn, she contacted the ground in the air and instantly entered a nervous mode.","While Ye Jian was carrying her parachute and waiting to jump, the instructor in the cabin kept encouraging Ye Jian to relax and not be nervous. Based on her usual training mentality, there would definitely be no problems.","Ye Jian, who was mentally prepared, kept nodding to show that she understood. She knew that she was fine now. Actually, no one felt that she was fine.","Including the five female soldiers who hadn’t jumped yet, they all thought that she was very nervous now.","\"Odd numbers, pull left. Even numbers, pull left. Avoid your neighbors. Number 10, do you know what number you are? Even number. Remember, you’re an even number. Pull right!\"","The instructor tightened the safety belt on Ye Jian’s shoulder and reminded her again. Ye Jian replied with an ’OK’ gesture to show that she was fine.","Her calmness made the instructor feel slightly at ease.","Ye Jian, who was thought to be very nervous, took a step forward. With a jump, Ye Jian completed her first jump after entering the military unit.","The wind blew past her ears. The scenery of the highlands entered her eyes. The sky was blue, and the magnificent scenery spread out like a painting. She was a speck in the painting.","As her body descended rapidly, the white parachute opened with a bang and turned into a pure white ’cloud’ that floated toward the ground.","\"No. 10 has successfully completed the first jump. The parachute bag has been opened successfully. Prepare to enter the landing area. Ground team, prepare.\" In the cabin, the instructor contacted the ground and connected the air situation to the ground.","Captain Lei locked his gaze on Ye Jian’s white parachute through his binoculars and replied calmly, \"Roger that. The ground team is ready to receive.\"","\"No. 11 has completed the jump.\"","\"No. 12 has completed the jump.","\"No. 15 has completed the jump.\"","\"Ground team, received. Aerial team, please return to the point of descent. Ground team, prepare to attack!\" Captain Lei, who had his binoculars in his hand, calmly issued the next order.","The 15 female soldiers successfully completed their parachute jump from the cabin. Now, it was time to land smoothly.","Their formation was a special one. Hence, the problems they faced were not ordinary problems. Even if they completed the first jump, Captain Lei would combine actual combat according to the special nature of the formation.","In actual combat, the casualties of airborne soldiers were the most tragic. From the time they left the plane to the time they landed, how to let the airborne soldiers land quickly and safely had always been a problem that the various countries had been working hard to study.","This time, Captain Lei combined it with actual combat and waited to see the reactions of the female soldiers.","To be safe, Captain Lei didn’t attack the female soldiers who were still floating in the air. Instead, he waited for the 15 female soldiers to land before starting.","It couldn’t be helped. Even if Captain Lei wanted to be ruthless, he had to consider it carefully. He needed to ensure that no female soldier would be sacrificed during the training."]},{"number":5072,"title":"Chapter 5072: Rejection","paragraphs":["It was much harder to select female paratroopers than female special forces in the army. It was even harder to select female soldiers who were outstanding in all aspects. Only 14 female soldiers were selected from the air force. Including Ye Jian, who was borrowed from the army, there were a total of 15 female soldiers. They could barely make up two ordinary classes.","Before that, the division commander wanted to form two intensive classes!","They were barely able to get into ordinary classes. There was no need to think about intensive classes. They would see if it was possible in the future.","If a female soldier died during training, Captain Lei didn’t dare to imagine the consequences.","Among the 15 female soldiers, only Ye Jian didn’t undergo systematic airborne training. Before this, she didn’t have any airborne experience. Among the other 14 female soldiers, two of them were squad leaders. They were quite capable and were the two strongest female soldiers among the 15 of them.","Ye Jian, who came from the army, appeared in the team of 14 female soldiers wearing the green army camouflage uniform. She was ostracized on the first day.","Captain Lei didn’t coordinate things well, so it was normal for her to be ostracized. If she dragged the class down, it was very likely that she would discredit the team and implicate her teammates. Especially since Ye Jian was from the army. It was normal for her to be ostracized.","If she wanted to be accepted by the female soldiers of the air force, Ye Jian had to rely on herself. She could only be accepted if she caught up with the female soldiers.","This was a crucial jump for Ye Jian as everyone was watching to see if she could complete it successfully.","If she failed, the rejection she faced would be even worse.","As for the instructor, he would reconsider whether Ye Jian could continue the training.","Captain Lei didn’t know that Commander Kong had secretly looked for Ye Jian and asked Ye Jian to keep a low profile during training after joining the team. He wanted to hide her strength so that the female soldiers would think that Ye Jian would drag them down after meeting her for the first time.","Ye Jian, who was preparing to descend, pulled the parachute rope and adjusted it according to the wind direction. She maintained a safe distance from her left and right so that she could successfully land.","She didn’t focus on how to descend. Instead, she observed the ground calmly as she descended.","The female air force soldiers who had completed their descent were quickly packing their parachutes. They didn’t know that there was actual combat training on the ground.","The first female soldier who jumped down was a second lieutenant from the air force. She was also a former squad leader of a male airborne squad. When she was 18 years old, she entered the military unit directly. This year, she was already 23 years old. She had made many contributions to the military.","She was the first to keep her parachute. She quickly helped the second female soldier who had completed the descent to keep her parachute. She said in a low voice, \"The army soldier is No. 10. After confirming her approximate position, we’ll go over and help her keep her parachute.\"","\"No, I don’t want to.\" The second female soldier who completed the descent rejected her without hesitation. \"We’ve been forced to cooperate with her recently. This is her first jump. Do we still need to help her?\"","\"The army should stay in the army. Why did she come to our military unit? She’s just dragging us down. Squad leader, we should make her retreat as soon as possible. If not, it’ll be too late.\"","In the past, she was the squad leader of the male soldier class. Now, she was the squad leader of the female soldier class. The second lieutenant sighed softly, \"There must be a reason why she came to our class. Usually, she trains hard. Although there are some things that she can’t complete immediately like us, it’s because she’s in the army and didn’t undergo the airborne soldier system training. It’s already very impressive that she can complete her first jump in just a month.","\"Think about it. How long would it have taken you to complete your first jump after you enter the military unit? It’ll take at least three months. As for her, she did her first jump in a month. Don’t always say that she’s a burden in front of her in the future. Try to be more considerate.\""]},{"number":5073,"title":"Chapter 5073: Occupy A Place","paragraphs":["The squad leader’s words didn’t have much effect. If Ye Jian’s military branch was the same as theirs, there would be no rejection at all. If her personal ability really dragged the class down, they would lend a hand.","However, Ye Jian was from the army. Even if they helped her, it wouldn’t benefit them much. They wouldn’t be working together in the future anyway. If Ye Jian was facing problems, then she should leave quickly.","If she really became a martyr, it was her family who would suffer the most.","The second female soldier, who had already kept her things, didn’t agree with what the squad leader said. She retorted calmly, \"Are her feelings more important than someone’s life? She should go back to where she belongs. Ever since she joined, all the soldiers have been worried about her safety. Squad Leader, she’s not from the same military as us.\"","The female soldier who completed the second jump came from the Aerial 17th Division. Previously, she was from the first brigade of the air force. The first division commander was Division Commander Wang. She was also the first elite of the first military unit of the country in 1950. The Aerial 17th Division had made countless contributions and was one of the top elite divisions.","The female soldier from the Aerial 17th Division was one of the best even among the male soldiers. The tradition of the Aerial 17th Division was survival of the fittest. Those who failed would be eliminated.","Hence, this female soldier felt that Ye Jian, who was from the army, was a member who needed to be eliminated. There was no need to waste too much energy on her.","It was not easy to groom an airborne soldier. She hoped that everyone who joined this team would be a real airborne soldier.","One had to know that their current direction of development meant they would not be ordinary airborne soldiers who would retire after serving for two years. Instead, they were special scouts among the airborne soldiers. They were special forces soldiers in the air force!","As an army soldier, Ye Jian shouldn’t take up the slot.","After saying this, she pursed her lips and continued in a low voice, \"Her arrival caused our comrades who originally had a chance to stay to leave. She was the one who pushed away our comrades who should be training with us.\"","The female soldier was talking about the two female soldiers who were under observation previously but couldn’t adapt to the high altitude climate. In the end, they had to return to their original military unit. One of the female soldiers was also from the Aerial 17th Division.","The squad leader thought of this too. Her expression turned a little cold. She took a deep breath and comforted the female soldier as they ran, \"It’s not a decision that we can decide, nor is it a decision that Ye Jian can decide. Also, those two couldn’t adapt to the highlands. It wouldn’t have done them any good to stay.","\"They couldn’t adapt to the highlands, so whether Ye Jian joined us or not, they wouldn’t have been able to stay.\" The squad leader’s tone gradually turned serious. \"You can have an opinion if Ye Jian drags the class down, but you’re targeting her because the female soldier from the Aerial 17th Division had to return to her military unit. Ye Jian is just a first-class soldier. She can’t make any decisions.","\"Don’t say such things again. If you continue to target Ye Jian unfairly, I’ll have you reflect on yourself! Do you hear me?\"","The squad leader heard that the female soldier targeted Ye Jian because Ye Jian was an army soldier who was dragging down the class and also because a female soldier from the Aerial 17th Division could not adapt to the highlands and left on the third day after Ye Jian arrived. The squad leader did not let it go and immediately issued a warning.","The squad leader was a little angry. Although the female soldier still had complaints in her heart, she didn’t dare to continue talking. She bit her lower lip and nodded. \"Understood!\"","\"Louder!\"","\"Understood!\" the running female soldier replied loudly."]},{"number":5074,"title":"Chapter 5074: Rarely Despised","paragraphs":["The female soldier who landed third didn’t hear the first part clearly. She only heard the word ’understood’. She quickly put away her parachute and asked the female soldier who landed second, \"What did you talk to the squad leader about?\"","\"It’s...\" The female soldier opened her mouth and swallowed the rest of her words. Her expression was a little dark as she replied calmly, \"It’s nothing. We just talked about how we should walk out of here later.\"","The female soldier who landed third didn’t believe her. She looked at the female soldier suspiciously and replied with a dry hum. Then, she took the time to keep her parachute.","Because they were all jumping into the highlands for the first time, Captain Lei did not go to the parachute point at an altitude of more than 4,000 meters but chose the lowest point.","Although they were at a high altitude and their vision was wide, they were surrounded by rocks of all sizes. In front of them, there was a river that was about five meters wide. The river was bone-chilling. It was formed by snow water.","Soon, several female soldiers landed successfully. The correspondent reported the situation to the ground team.","\"Has Ye Jian completed the landing?\" The instructor’s cold voice entered the female soldiers’ ears. \"Please confirm if Ye Jian has completed the landing immediately.\"","\"Yes!\" After the communications female soldier replied, she immediately ran to the squad leader. \"Squad Leader, the instructor of the ground team wants us to confirm if Ye Jian has landed!\"","13 people had already gathered. The squad leader was now clearing the crowd. When she heard that, the squad leader, who thought that something had happened, changed her expression slightly. Her vocal cords tensed up. \"Did anyone see Ye Jian? Did anyone see Ye Jian?\"","\"Report, no!\"","\"Report, no!\"","\"Report, besides Ye Jian, Guo Cui, who jumped eleventh, isn’t here either!\"","The two of them didn’t reach the gathering point. Moreover, the two of them had not jumped sequentially. The squad leader’s facial expression was a little anxious now. \"Quick, split up and look for the two of them!\"","They parachuted in order and didn’t reach the gathering point immediately. The squad leader was very worried that there was a ’special situation’ in the air when she wasn’t paying attention. For example, their parachutes were entangled with each other or their ropes were stuck... Once there was a ’special situation’ in the air and it wasn’t dealt with in time, the two of them would fall from the sky. Their survival rate would be almost zero.","These female airborne soldiers had opinions about Ye Jian, who was in the army. They excluded her secretly and targeted her openly. When they heard that Ye Jian had not arrived yet, everyone had only one thought in their minds—’We knew it!’","Just as they were preparing to split up and search, a clear and cold voice came from behind the female soldiers. \"Report, Ye Jian has landed successfully.\"","\"Report, Guo Cui has landed successfully.\"","Hearing this, the female soldiers didn’t turn around immediately. They were in formation and needed an order to move.","This was a rule that had to be observed at all times.","\"Everyone, turn back!\" The squad leader gave the order. The 12 female soldiers who had completed their formation moved in unison. They turned back at the same time with a sonorous force. Everyone completed their actions at the same time. They were as orderly as one person.","When they turned around, they saw the two people who were the last to arrive. Everyone was anxious as they held each other’s hands. It was obvious that something had happened.","The expressions of the 13 female soldiers, including the squad leader, changed. In the end, all of them showed expressions that seemed to say, ’As expected, this won’t work out.’"]},{"number":5075,"title":"Chapter 5075: Displeased","paragraphs":["The two of them didn’t reach the gathering point in time to complete the landing report. The squad leader’s expression wasn’t good.","Ye Jian could feel the rejection in their gazes and sighed in her heart.","In the past, she often heard that there would be rejection among the classes. It was very common for military school students to experience rejection when they were sent to the company.","Everyone came from all over the world. There would definitely be a period of time for them to get used to each other’s habits. For instance, Captain Xia was ostracized and isolated when he first entered the Xueyu unit.","She was already mentally prepared, but she felt a little uncomfortable now that she really encountered such a situation. This was because she had never encountered rejection before.","She also understood why Commander Kong specially came to have a heart-to-heart talk with her. He wanted her to be stronger so that she wouldn’t want to return to the army military unit just because she suffered some grievances during training. He had reminded her repeatedly before leaving.","Although she was a little aggrieved, it depended on how one understood and accepted it. She wasn’t a soldier from the airborne military unit to begin with. After she came over, she met two airborne soldiers who were still under observation but had to leave in the end. It was normal for the 13 female soldiers, including the squad leader, to have some opinions about her.","Under the 13 gazes, Ye Jian and Guo Cui supported each other and returned to the team.","When they got closer, the squad leader didn’t let the two of them return to the team immediately. She glanced at the female soldier, Guo Cui, as if to confirm something. Then, she looked at Ye Jian. Her gaze was very cold. \"According to the plan, everyone must reach the gathering point within ten minutes after landing. Did the two of you reach the gathering point according to the plan?","\"As a soldier, you don’t even have the most basic sense of time. How did the military unit teach you? Please answer me loudly!\"","The expressions of the female soldiers who were looking at Ye Jian became even more serious. They couldn’t let her continue staying in the air force. The army should go to the army. They shouldn’t go to the air force to die.","Although the squad leader seemed to be criticizing both of them, Ye Jian knew that it was directed at her. She asked Guo Cui in a low voice, \"Can you stand up?\"","\"Yes.\" Guo Cui, who could tell that the squad leader was only criticizing Ye Jian, nodded. Ye Jian released her grip and straightened her back. She lowered her chin and replied without explaining, \"Please punish me, Squad Leader!\"","Being late meant being late. There was no need to explain too much.","A delay in the military unit wasn’t something that could be solved with a deduction of salary. Being late in the military unit could often affect the entire situation. It wasn’t a small matter!","The squad leader thought that Ye Jian would explain. She didn’t expect her to ask her to punish her directly. The squad leader’s heart skipped a beat, and her face darkened. She glanced at Guo Cui, who had a restrained expression. A faint darkness flashed past her eyes.","She didn’t ask Guo Cui and continued asking Ye Jian, \"Do you think that punishment will solve the problem? As a soldier, don’t you know the importance of time?\"","\"Everyone arrived on time. Because of the two of you, all of us had to wait at the same spot! The situation on the battlefield is ever-changing. Everyone has their own responsibilities. Comrades who charge into the battlefield will lose their lives because of your tardiness!","\"Ye Jian, this is the air force, not the army! Airborne soldiers have to fight against time on the battlefield to win a decisive victory. If you’re late by three minutes and 46 seconds, that’s enough to drag the entire battlefield down. You’ll even make your comrades sacrifice themselves to find you! Can you bear it? As a soldier, can you continue wearing this military uniform?!\""]},{"number":5076,"title":"Chapter 5076: Troubled","paragraphs":["Of course, Ye Jian couldn’t afford it. She had carried out many missions, big and small. She knew the importance of time. She would always consider the overall situation. Even if there was a reason for her delay this time, she couldn’t explain it.","Also...","She vaguely felt that the squad leader was only criticizing her... She seemed to have other intentions.","\"Report, Squad Leader, I have something to say!\" Guo Cui, whose face was slightly pale, spoke loudly. The squad leader’s words were all directed at Ye Jian. Although she usually rejected Ye Jian because she was in the army, it wasn’t Ye Jian’s fault today.","The squad leader, who had a cold expression on her face, finally looked at Guo Cui. She paused for a moment before saying in a low voice, \"Speak!\"","Just now, when Ye Jian asked Guo Cui to stand properly, the squad leader already knew what was going on.","Just now, she criticized the female soldier who landed second, Liu Meiyue. Now, she criticized herself in his heart and did a deep reflection.","Since Ye Jian was able to join the air force, she must have her own reasons. As the squad leader, it was her negligence that Ye Jian was being singled out.","As long as Ye Jian was in the air force and was a member of her class, she had to abandon her personal bias and take care of everyone in her class.","As the squad leader, no matter how unhappy she was with Ye Jian, she couldn’t take the lead to reject Ye Jian. She would take care of what needed to be taken care of. Whether Ye Jian could be accepted by her comrades depended on Ye Jian’s ability.","\"Squad Leader, Ye Jian was late just now because she wanted to help me! This time, she was late because of me. It has nothing to do with her. I implicated her and made her late. Please punish me!\"","Guo Cui spoke softly at first, but toward the end, her voice got louder. \"When I landed, I slipped into a crack in the rock and my foot got stuck. When Ye Jian, who was packing her parachute, saw me in that situation, she immediately ran over to help me move the rock away.","\"It wouldn’t have taken so long to move the rock, right? It’s been four minutes.\" A female soldier in the team spoke softly. It was loud enough for all the female soldiers to hear her.","That was right. Would it take a few minutes to move a rock?","When Guo Cui heard that, she shouted, \"I made a mistake in choosing the landing point. The rock looks small, but most of it was buried underground. Ye Jian used her knife to dig out most of the rock before moving it away.\"","With Guo Cui’s explanation, the female soldiers didn’t say anything.","On the highlands, many rocks looked like small ones, but most of them were buried deep in the ground. It was impossible to tell how big they were.","Guo Cui continued, \"Squad Leader, there was no problem with Ye Jian’s descent this time. It’s because of me that she’s late. She had to use her knife to dig out the rock. I urged her to ignore me and gather quickly. If not, she’d be dragged down. Ye Jian said that I was her comrade, and on the battlefield, there are no cowards who only care about their lives and not their comrades’ lives. She said she was willing to be punished alongside me.","\"Ye Jian also said that real comrades will never leave each other’s side! Squad Leader, Ye Jian was implicated because of my unprofessionalism. If you want to punish someone, please punish me alone! I will accept any form of punishment!\"","After entering the military unit for a month, a female soldier finally spoke up for Ye Jian. Although there was a reason for it, this was at least a good sign, right?","Captain Lei, who was in the ground team, couldn’t help but laugh when he knew the details.","This female soldier from the military unit was not bad. It had been a month. The moment she made a move, people would change their opinion of her.","\"Real comrades will never leave each other’s side...\" Captain Lei repeated it carefully, and the smile on his face deepened."]},{"number":5077,"title":"Chapter 5077: Burden","paragraphs":["That was right. On the battlefield, the person you’d trust the most was your comrade. Your comrades would be the ones guarding your back.","What would happen next should be even more exciting. The male soldiers in his class had not had a chance to compete with Ye Jian, so this time, they would have a chance to compete.","After that competition, the female soldiers who disliked her would be able to accept her faster.","That was what Captain Lei thought. It was a good idea.","What a pity!","Commander Kong had asked Ye Jian not to display her power to the female soldiers for now. He was really worried that the female soldier from the army would be too powerful and destroy the self-confidence of the female soldiers. That wouldn’t be worth it.","Captain Lei didn’t know that Commander Kong had chatted with Ye Jian. He didn’t know what Commander Kong told Ye Jian either. If he knew, he wouldn’t have made such an arrangement.","\"Assault team, get ready. Assault team, get ready. The female soldiers have gathered and are preparing to go to the guidance area. All teams will focus on attacking Ye Jian from the female soldier class. All teams will focus on attacking Ye Jian from the female soldier class.\"","In order to exchange blows with Ye Jian, Captain Lei asked the male soldiers to focus on attacking Ye Jian.","In the end...","In the end, Ye Jian was defeated early!","\"Ye Jian, you’ve been ’killed’ now. Find a place to rest!\" The squad leader adjusted her helmet and glanced around with a cold facial expression. Fortunately, the rest hadn’t been defeated and could continue moving forward.","When she left, the squad leader had an ugly expression on her face.","A few female soldiers who passed by Ye Jian snorted and said that she was a burden before leaving.","\"Stop talking nonsense and leave quickly! Otherwise, you’ll be the next one to be dealt with!\"","\"Everyone reacted, and she was the only one who didn’t. She was killed by the male soldiers like a piece of wood. It made me angry.\"","\"She probably hasn’t received similar training in the past, so she failed to react in time. Didn’t you see that the squad leader’s expression was very bad?\"","\"How could her expression not be bad? We only took a few steps and one of our members was killed. Our morale is thwarted.\"","The female soldiers who were moving separately spoke one after another. In the end, they had to say that Ye Jian from the army unit was really incompatible with the air force. She should hurry up and leave. She shouldn’t implicate them.","Unexpectedly, there was a surprise attack midway. Ye Jian was defeated by a male soldier before she could even display her skills. The squad leader didn’t have the time to care about Ye Jian. She led the 13 female soldiers and arrived at the infiltration point.","The sun was shining brightly, and the stream of water was clear. Ye Jian, who had ’died’, scooped up some water to wash her face. She hugged her gun and prepared to relax.","A month of tough training had made her, an army soldier with a zero foundation, suffer. It was even harder than her training in the Storm Commando Brigade.","As expected, each training would only be tougher and tougher.","Even though she had enough willpower, after 31 days of intensive training without rest and having to secretly give herself extra training from time to time, Ye Jian also felt a little tired.","It wasn’t very difficult. It was just that she had zero foundation. Commander Kong also hoped that she could surpass the airborne female soldiers as soon as possible. He also said that their air force headquarters had high hopes for her. It made her, who only wanted to learn the skills of an airborne soldier, feel pressured and feel even more responsible.","Under these circumstances, the hardships she faced were naturally much greater than others. She had to learn new skills crazily. At the same time, the hardships she had to go through couldn’t be explained in a few sentences.","Ye Jian heaved a long sigh of relief. She didn’t think she needed to suppress her true ability. She needed to continue working hard as she was facing a group of outstanding people.","However, she could avoid the sneak attack on the ground just now. It was just that she didn’t."]},{"number":5078,"title":"Chapter 5078: Suspicious","paragraphs":["Commander Kong asked her to hide her skills from even Captain Lei. When the male soldiers came out to launch a sneak attack, she immediately recalled that the male soldier who launched the sneak attack was the special scout, Small Head, who had a problem with her at the experimental center in the desert.","Since they wanted her to conceal her abilities, she naturally had to do what she did.","Ye Jian, who was enjoying the sunlight, pulled down her helmet to block the sunlight. She yawned.","A low and deep laughter came from behind. \"Ye Jian, did you let yourself get killed by the male soldiers on purpose just to rest?\"","Captain Lei happened to see Ye Jian yawning. When he received the news that Ye Jian was killed in the first round, his first reaction was to insist that it was impossible and that there had been a mistake. After confirming that it was true, he couldn’t help but come over to ask what was going on.","In addition, Small Head said that before his sneak attack, Ye Jian discovered him before any female soldier and even glanced at him. Captain Lei felt that he should have a chat with Ye Jian.","How could the special forces female soldier from the army, the female sniper who calmly sniped on the plane a few months ago, be dealt with in the first round?","There had to be something wrong!","The male soldier, Small Head, who launched a sneak attack on Ye Jian, also felt that something was amiss. He could guarantee that the sniper, Ye Jian, had discovered him before he launched his sneak attack and even glanced at him!","However, she didn’t react!","Then, Captain Lei thought about Ye Jian’s performance during the month of training. The more he thought about it, the more he felt that there was something wrong. The more he thought about it, the more uneasy he felt. When he saw Ye Jian basking in the sun leisurely, Captain Lei was even more certain of his guess.","She didn’t care that she was taken out so soon. She didn’t care how the female soldiers looked at her either. This was a huge problem!","Could it be that she regretted it and didn’t want to stay in the air force for training and wanted to return to her old military unit?","How could that be?","They had agreed that she would stay for two years!","It had only been a month. How could she leave?","Ye Jian opened her eyes when she heard that. She quickly stood up and saluted Captain Lei.","She was just a first-class soldier now. When she saw her captain, she would definitely salute him.","\"Ye Jian, let’s not beat about the bush. I’ll go straight to the point.\" Captain Lei returned the soldier’s salute and asked directly. He didn’t give Ye Jian a chance to prepare. \"You’re an outstanding sniper. Your information has clearly revealed your skills to me.","\"And just now, Small Head, who successfully launched the sneak attack, told me that you discovered him long ago and had enough time to dodge. So how did Small Head successfully attack you?","\"I think we need to have a good chat about this.\"","Facing Captain Lei, who was straightforward, Ye Jian felt that he was very compatible with the personality of a special reconnaissance soldier. She thought for a moment and dropped Commander Kong’s name. \"This question is not difficult. It’s just that it’s not easy for me to answer. Captain Lei, you should ask Commander Kong. Commander Kong will be able to give you an answer.\"","Commander Kong?","\"Did the division commander look for you alone?\" The sharp Captain Lei caught the main point at once. \"Did he specially remind you about some things?\"","Ye Jian smiled. \"You should ask Commander Kong. If he can answer, he will.\"","\"Okay! Then I’ll ask the division commander directly.\" Captain Lei knew that he wouldn’t be able to get anything out of Ye Jian, so he nodded seriously. \"There must be something wrong. I have to ask clearly.\"","Yes, there was something wrong. She felt resigned.","The feeling of being rejected by the female soldiers... was really not good!","Far away in the highlands, Ye Jian’s mood wasn’t good. Far away in the capital city, Old Master Fu wasn’t in a good mood when he heard Mrs. Qin’s casual conversation."]},{"number":5079,"title":"Chapter 5079: Coincidence","paragraphs":["Old Master Fu was at home now. Besides Uncle Fu, who had been taking care of Old Master Fu, there was also Li Jinnian, who had been back for two days.","When Mrs. Qin came to visit, Old Master Fu could tell that she had something to say to him alone. He sent Li Jinnian, who only came back once every two years, to the kitchen to help Uncle Fu. He was now alone with Mrs. Qin in the tea room.","He had always treated the younger generations of the Qin family as his own and was willing to step in to solve any problems. But the Qin family was kind and never bothered Old Master Fu.","It was obvious that Mrs. Qin had something to say when she came to visit today. Old Master Fu took it seriously.","When he was at home, he would often visit the Qin family, who were the closest to him. In addition, the two families had been friends for decades. The old men of the two families didn’t treat each other as outsiders. Although they weren’t blood-related, they were like family.","Before Ye Jian returned to the Fu family, the two brothers of the Qin family took turns taking care of Old Master Fu. Every time they returned to Dan Gui Garden to visit the two elders of the Qin family, they would definitely come to visit Old Master Fu.","Although there was someone in the first generation of the Qin family who was unfilial, overall, he was alright. He wouldn’t commit murder or arson. He only liked to offend women. Even the illegitimate son of the Qin family, Qin Yi, was respectful to Old Master Fu and didn’t dare to cause trouble.","Hence, Old Master Fu treated the descendants of the Qin family as his grandchildren.","Especially Qin Xiu. He had watched him grow up since he was young. Even though Mrs. Qin was Qin Xiu’s mother, Old Master Fu felt uncomfortable to hear her scold Qin Xiu.","On the other hand, Old Madam Qin and Old Master Qin were already used to it. They didn’t want to argue with their daughter-in-law and didn’t want to interfere with their grandchildren’s matters anymore.","Everyone had their own paths in life. The two of them didn’t have much time left to worry about others. They would let their children and grandchildren settle their own matters.","As for their daughter-in-law, they would just let her vent for a while. If not, she would feel uncomfortable.","Old Madam Qin and Old Master Qin had stopped caring about their children and grandchildren. Mrs. Qin didn’t manage to get the two elders to persuade Qin Xiu even after visiting them in Dan Gui Garden a few times, so she came to beg Old Master Fu.","Old Master Fu was not completely free. He was teaching aviation at a university in the capital city. He was specially hired for this specialization. He didn’t have to go over every day. He had two major lessons a week teaching graduate students.","There were only two classes every week, but the old man was passionate about it. He did his best to impart everything he learned to his students. In addition, his lectures were funny and humorous. He was able to make the extremely awkward professional knowledge interesting. In the words of the students, it was no longer cold knowledge. It was a garden and a mountain of treasures. It made people want to explore it.","The old man, who had a second career, was at home today. It just so happened that Mrs. Qin came to visit.","Mrs. Qin had looked for Old Master Fu several times but could never manage to catch him. Today, she was overjoyed. After sitting down for less than five minutes, she started talking about Qin Xiu.","\"Old Master, when Xiu comes back later, I hope you can persuade him not to be too stubborn. He’s 30 years old. He should start a family. However, Xiu doesn’t want me to interfere in this matter at all. As a mother, I feel bad when I see my son alone.","\"You watched Xiu grow up. When he was young, he always went to your house whenever he made any mistakes. Only you can persuade him and let him realize what mistake he’s made.\"","This time, Mrs. Qin treated Old Master Fu as her savior. She choked up and revealed the bitterness in her heart. She only hoped that Old Master Fu could help her."]},{"number":5080,"title":"Chapter 5080: Assistance","paragraphs":["Old Master Fu listened quietly and sighed in his heart for a while.","He felt that Qin Xiu was a rare talent. Why was the Qin family’s eldest daughter-in-law speaking as if Qin Xiu had made so many mistakes?","Mrs. Qin lowered her head with red eyes and wiped the corners of her eyes with a tissue from time to time. Every word she said was filled with bitterness. \"This time, I’m really left with no other choice. I can only trouble you to help me talk to Xiu. He’s already 30 years old. Why is he still making me worry so much?","\"Qin Ying is the same, and Xiu, who has always been obedient and sensible, followed suit. What sin did I commit for them to provoke me? Most of Xiu’s peers listened to their parents’ arrangements to get married and have children. Why is it so difficult for me? My husband doesn’t care, and the two elders don’t care either. I... I feel... uncomfortable.\"","Mrs. Qin’s eyes were red as she wiped the corners of her eyes with a tissue.","In the face of Mrs. Qin’s request, Old Master Fu didn’t agree immediately. He personally brewed a new cup of tea for Mrs. Qin. After Mrs. Qin calmed down a little, he said, \"Since I watched Xiu grow up and you requested to meet me, I’ll tell you some things.\"","Old Master Fu had a calm personality. He wouldn’t intervene in the matters of his family members, especially the marriage of juniors. He wouldn’t say anything.","However, the Qin family was not his family. The two families had known each other for decades and had been through thick and thin together. The brothers from the Qin family were like his nephews. Although it was inconvenient for Old Master Fu to interfere with some things, Mrs. Qin had already come to initiate a conversation with him. Old Master Fu sighed slightly and decided to voice out.","When Mrs. Qin heard this, she immediately sat down elegantly. \"Please speak.\"","Old Master Fu looked at Mrs. Qin with his wise eyes that had seen countless storms. As soon as he spoke, his strong voice made Mrs. Qin nervous and serious.","\"First of all, Xiu is already 30 years old. He’s no longer the child that you need to take care of. He’s now the youngest diplomat in the Ministry of Foreign Affairs. He carries the heavy responsibility of the country. If you ask a diplomat who carries the heavy responsibility of the country to listen to your arrangements, he’ll definitely refuse.","\"Secondly, he has his own plans. Marriage is obviously not part of his plan for the time being. Your insistence will only mess up his mind and make him avoid you even more.","\"Since you’re so anxious to get him married, I’ll give you an idea.\"","Before Old Master Fu could say his idea, Mrs. Qin’s eyes lit up.","\"In that case, why don’t you go to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and kick up a fuss? Let Qin Xiu retire from his current position and go home in peace to continue being your obedient son. You can consider it.\"","Mrs. Qin’s expression changed slightly. What kind of idea was that?!","That wasn’t right. How could Old Master Fu have such a thought? It had to be...","Mrs. Qin, who was a little uneasy, tightened her grip on the tissue in her hand. \"How can I do that?\" How could she ruin her son’s bright future? \"Xiu has always wanted to be a diplomat since he was young. How can I... ruin his dream?","Facing Old Master Fu’s sharp gaze, Mrs. Qin clenched the crumpled ball of tissue in her palm. She suddenly didn’t dare to stay in the Fu family’s residence anymore. She... wanted to leave.","\"Why not? Don’t you want a good son who listens to you, listens to your arrangements, and listens to your advice? Since you want that, go and fight for him. With Qin Xiu’s personality, if you go to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and make a fuss, he’ll definitely leave the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and go home to be your good son.\""]},{"number":5081,"title":"Chapter 5081: Interrogation","paragraphs":["\"Old Master, I’m not...\"","Mrs. Qin wanted to explain, but Old Master Fu stopped her with a smile. \"Xiu is the youngest official in the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, but as his mother, you want to suppress him. You use the excuse of doing it for his own good.","\"He resists you and doesn’t want to listen to your arrangements. In your eyes, he’s unfilial. Let me ask you, are you being filial? Old Qin and his wife were angered by you until they were disheartened and no longer want to take care about things anymore. Is this your filial piety?\"","His expression was serious but not stern. His questioning was calm and composed. Mrs. Qin was gradually unable to resist his wise response.","\"You’re not filial, but you’re forcing Xiu to meet your standards of filial piety. You’re selfish and independent. You’re not wrong to say that a man should start a family and a career when he’s 30 years old. But does it mean that only by following your parents’ arrangements and getting married can you be filial and do great things?\"","Old Master Fu kept asking questions. Mrs. Qin’s forehead was covered in sweat. She was so nervous that she couldn’t sit still.","However, Old Master Fu didn’t stop. His voice didn’t change much either. It was as if he was talking about something extremely normal. However, Mrs. Qin was nervous.","She really regretted coming over to beg the old man!","\"Go and see how many scientists from the older generation in Dan Gui Garden have never married in their entire lives. Elder Yan and Elder Su, who are next door, have never married. How much have they contributed to the country? Do you dare to go over and ask Elder Yan and Elder Su if they’re lonely since they didn’t get married? Do you dare to ask?\"","Mrs. Qin’s face turned pale. Even as the wife of an ambassador, she didn’t have the guts to ask the country’s heroes that.","\"I also heard that Ying likes a soldier. I heard that the young man is a major. He’s tall, big, and mighty. However, you despise him for being a poor soldier. His family comes from a small county city, and his parents are only middle school teachers. You used the excuse that his family background is not good. On New Year’s Eve, you even slapped Ying.","\"Didn’t you ask yourself whether Ying would get lonely if she didn’t marry? Are you intent on satisfying your selfishness and continuing to control Ying and Xiu?","\"Ying clearly wants to get married, but you’re stopping her from doing it and even look down on the man’s family background. Xiu doesn’t want to get married for the time being and wants to achieve big things in his career, but you’re trying all means to break his plan. Mrs. Qin, you’re not anxious for your children. You’re just thinking for yourself.\"","Mrs. Qin’s face turned pale as her body swayed a little. She wanted to ask the old man for an idea, but in fact, she wanted him to help persuade Xiu. However, in the end, she was reprimanded by Old Master Fu.","Mrs. Qin knew that she had come to the wrong place and begged the wrong person.","Old Master Fu felt a little tired. \"That’s all I have to say. Don’t look for me for these things in the future. Although my relationship with the Qin family is closer than family, I’ve never cared about the juniors’ plans for marriage.","\"You’re going to go down a dead end if you continue doing this. Go back and think about it. Once you figure it out, everything will be clear.\"","If she could figure it out, Mrs. Qin wouldn’t have tormented Qin Xiu for so many years.","She still felt that she hadn’t done anything wrong. She would definitely support her son’s career. As for marriage, his parents had the right to make the decision."]},{"number":5082,"title":"Chapter 5082: Big Trouble","paragraphs":["For a reputable family like theirs, the marriage of their children was a big deal. How could they allow the younger generation to mess around?","Although she regretted coming here, Mrs. Qin’s upbringing didn’t make her leave the Fu family’s residence immediately. Old Master Fu didn’t ask her to leave either. He just sat there quietly and drank tea.","Before this, he had been making preparations for his lectures. He had exerted some effort earlier, so he should just have some tea and take a good rest.","After a moment of silence, Mrs. Qin sighed. \"I’ll remember what you said. I’ll have a good chat with Xiu again. If he really doesn’t want to marry that girl, I won’t insist anymore.\"","She wanted to save some of her reputation in front of Old Master Fu.","Old Master Fu didn’t know that Qin Xiu had someone in his heart. Hearing this, he frowned slightly. \"Both children have already met someone they like, but you don’t agree with either of them?\"","\"It’s not that I don’t agree. I’m just afraid that they’ll suffer in the future. Ying likes a soldier. I admit that I don’t like the man’s family background, but most importantly, I’ve asked Ying, and that soldier is in the military unit all year round and can’t take care of his wife and children at all. If she marries him, it’ll be no different from staying single. She even has to take care of the man’s family.","\"She’ll suffer if she marries. How can I agree? On New Year’s Eve, I slapped Ying in a fit of anger. But my heart ached too.\"","\"As for Xiu, two years ago, I discovered that he liked a military school student. She’s indeed good-looking. I wanted to understand her family background, but Xiu denied it and said that he didn’t like her. I gave up at that time.","\"Some time ago, the Du family’s young lady told me that the military school student Qin Xiu likes is an orphan. Her cousin’s family even committed a crime. Before the crime, her cousin even tried to cling to the Du family.","\"I asked the Du family and found out that the military school student that Xiu likes is an unbearable person. How can I agree? Xiu is a diplomat. How can he have a wife who will drag him down?","\"Even though the other party graduated from the military school, I don’t dare to take that risk. Not to mention that the girl Xiu likes even...\" At this point, Mrs. Qin suddenly thought of something. She almost forgot that Jiayi said that Li Jinnian liked that military school student too!","Li Jinnian was Old Master Fu’s biological grandson!","His biological grandson liked a girl who wanted to climb up the social ladder. It would be impossible for Old Master Fu to sit back and do nothing!","At that time, he would definitely persuade Qin Xiu to give up on that girl. He would also ask his grandson, Jinnian, to stay away from that girl with the surname Ye.","Mrs. Qin glanced outside the tea room. She came at the right time and happened to see Jinnian coming home...","Taking a sip of tea, Mrs. Qin lowered her voice and said worriedly, \"I heard that Jinnian likes that girl too. Even Commander Xia’s only son likes her. That girl is really capable. As a military school student, she managed to make the best men in the capital city fall in love with her.\"","The news was a little unexpected. Old Master Fu was a little surprised. \"Jinnian likes her too? Little Six likes her too?\" Xia Jinyuan liked the princess of the Fu family. When did he like another military school student?","A military school student...","Jinnian liked her? So does Xia Jinyuan?","Coincidentally, his precious granddaughter was also a military school student.","Why did he feel that the military school student Mrs. Qin was talking about was his precious granddaughter?","Old Master Fu’s expression turned cold.","\"Old Master, if you don’t believe me, why don’t you ask Jinnian when he comes back?\" Mrs. Qin, who didn’t know that she was about to cause trouble, was very certain. \"I’m not lying.\""]},{"number":5083,"title":"Chapter 5083: Anger","paragraphs":["Although Old Master Fu was amiable to his juniors, that didn’t mean that he was casual about things. He wouldn’t judge one’s character just because of a few words from his juniors.","Also, it was nonsense to say that the Xia family’s boy liked her too!","As Ye Jian’s grandfather, he knew which family the Xia family’s boy liked. He clearly liked the precious princess of the Fu family!","Old Master Fu, who didn’t ask his grandson immediately, had a serious expression on his kind face. \"Mrs. Qin, let me ask you something. Have you heard or confirmed whether the girl Xiu likes is good or bad?\"","As a scientist, Old Master Fu was casual about life, but he had always been truthful and strict. He didn’t believe what Mrs. Qin said.","His grandson, Jinnian, was not easy to fool. He had always been in the military unit. Why would he like the same girl as Xiu?","What a joke!","In addition, Mrs. Qin said that the Xia family’s boy liked that girl too. What a joke.","Old Master FU didn’t need to ask further to confirm that what Mrs. Qin said couldn’t be true.","However, she was so certain that he was puzzled. That was why he asked.","Facing Old Master Fu’s sharp gaze, Mrs. Qin hesitated for a few seconds before lowering her voice and replying softly, \"I’ve investigated a little. Most of the other things are known by Staff Officer Du’s wife. I don’t think she’d lie to me about this.\"","Old Master Fu had a good temper. If it were any other old man, he would probably be so angry that he would chase her away.","\"But what did you investigate? Don’t tell me you only found out where the girl Xiu likes lives and who her parents are?\"","Mrs. Qin sat up straight. There was a hint of awkwardness in her facial expressions. \"Yes.\"","When she saw the cold expression on Old Master Fu’s face, Mrs. Qin couldn’t help but speed up her explanation. \"This girl is a little strange. I want to investigate her properly, but other than where her family lives, how many family members she has, and what school she graduated from, I can’t find any other information.","\"I even sent people to her house and found out that her elders are no longer in the village. The villagers don’t know much about her either. However, they know everything about her uncle’s family. They were greedy for money and did many bad things. They were really a rotten family.","\"I also found out that the reason why her uncle fell off his high horse was because of that girl’s revenge. Old Master, tell me, how can I not be worried? She was treated unfairly by the wife of her father’s younger brother when she was young and bullied by her cousin. When she grew up, she directly took down her uncle’s family. Of course, based on what her uncle did, he should be punished by the law.","\"I’m not worried about anything else. It’s just that this girl is too scheming. Every time I think about how she personally destroyed her uncle’s family, I shudder. Xiu has a gentle personality, and the girl has a scheming personality. I’m worried that one day, they’ll turn against each other and hurt one another.","\"In that case, shouldn’t I end it as soon as possible so that they won’t get injured in the future?\"","The old man, whose facial expression had turned cold, no longer felt that it was a coincidence. Instead, he was 100% sure that the military school student Mrs. Qin was talking about was his precious granddaughter!","His granddaughter had lived outside and was tortured. She almost died in the hands of the Ye family. Later on, Ye Zhifan and his wife didn’t want Ye Jian to participate in the university entrance examination. In order to prevent Ye Jian from becoming successful, they kept making moves before the university entrance examination. In the end, although she got into Municipal No.1 Middle School, she ended up auditing.","Fortunately, Ye Jian worked hard. She took a year off from school and jumped to grade eleven. That was how she escaped from Ye Zhifan and his wife."]},{"number":5084,"title":"Chapter 5084: Chase Her Away","paragraphs":["However, Ye Zhifan’s family of three still refused to give up. Even the old madam of the Ye family brought her daughter’s family out to torture Ye Jian. Such a vicious family was finally punished by the law. Why did the Qin family’s daughter-in-law say that it was Ye Jian’s fault?","\"Mrs. Qin, don’t come and look for me for help anymore. I really can’t help you. If you ask for too much, you’ll never be able to satiate your appetite. Go home.\"","Old Master Fu waved his hand and stood up. He didn’t look at Mrs. Qin anymore. Mrs. Qin was stunned. \"Old Master, are you not going to care anymore? Aren’t you going to ask Jinnian?\"","\"Try to find out more about that girl. Seeing is believing. I believe that the girl that the three children like is definitely not a scheming person, let alone a girl with a bad character.","\"The descendants of the Qin family, the Xia family, and the Fu family can’t be blind. My grandson, Jinnian, often stays in the military unit. If he really has a girl he likes, I can’t ask for more.","\"Old Fu, come and send the guests off.\" Mrs. Qin was kicked out of the residence by the old man and was listed as a ’guest’. From now on, it would be difficult for Mrs. Qin to enter the Fu family’s residence again.","Uncle Fu heard the commotion and walked over quickly from the kitchen. He didn’t ask for the reason and immediately asked Mrs. Qin to leave. \"Mrs. Qin, let me send you off.\"","Mrs. Qin was extremely anxious. \"Old Master, I really don’t have any other intentions. I just wanted to ask you...\"","\"Don’t. Even Xiu’s grandparents won’t come here to talk to me about his matters. Although I watched Xiu grow up, I’m not his biological elder. How can I casually advise him?","\"You said that the girl is bad and that the girl’s family is evil from the roots. Let me say something else today. To be able to grow up in such a family and walk on her own path in the end, a girl like her must have a good character.","\"Let me ask you again. Did the girl Xiu like to pester him? Did she give Xiu hope? No, right? If she had really given Xiu hope, you wouldn’t have come here to talk to me.","\"You don’t like such a good girl and even despise her family background. How about this? The next time you see her, ask Xiu to bring her to my side. I’ll definitely introduce an excellent marriage partner to her!","\"There’s no need to say anything else. I won’t tell your in-laws about what happened today. Just pretend that you never came and that I never met up with you.\"","In the end, Mrs. Qin’s face turned pale. She knew that Old Master Fu was angry.","However, she didn’t even know how she had angered him.","Just because she said that Jinnian liked the girl Xiu liked too?","She really had good intentions and just wanted to remind the old man not to let the girl who was trying to climb up the social ladder succeed. She really didn’t have any other intentions.","In the end, Mrs. Qin didn’t go home. Instead, she was so frightened that the driver had to send her to the hospital. She experienced a relapse in her heart condition.","In the Fu family’s residence, the old man said to his grandson, Li Jinnian, who was helping him to the courtyard, with a livid expression, \"She’s getting more and more unreasonable. She actually came to me and said bad things about your cousin. She basically said that your cousin is out of her family’s league.","\"Gaining connections? Does our Fu family need to do that? I’m so angry!\"","Li Jinnian, who had a cold expression on his handsome face, was also angry. However, he couldn’t add fuel to the fire. With a sinister look in his eyes, he comforted the old man, \"Calm down. Mrs. Qin doesn’t understand my cousin well, which is why she’s spouting nonsense. Why do you have to lower yourself to her level? If you get so angry to the point it harms your health, Ye Jian will feel the most heartache.\""]},{"number":5085,"title":"Chapter 5085: A Tree With Deep Roots","paragraphs":["Li Jinnian was a person who didn’t show his emotions. In addition, many years of being a soldier had trained his personality to be calmer and more tolerant.","He was clearly furious deep down, but there was no anger on his face or in his words. He calmly persuaded Old Master Fu and accompanied him for a walk in the small courtyard. Gradually, Old Master Fu’s expression softened.","After thinking about it carefully, he said, \"Your cousin has already graduated and has successfully been transferred to the company. Logically speaking, her worries shouldn’t exist anymore. I should let the outside world know that your cousin is my granddaughter.","\"At first, I thought that since your cousin and uncle are both soldiers and soldiers need to keep a low profile when they do things outside, there’s no need to be too ostentatious. Now, it looks like I’ve thought too much.","\"The Fu family wants to keep a low profile, but others are riding on your cousin’s head. They really think that your cousin is an orphan with no one to rely on!","\"I have to have a good chat with the Xia family and see when I can announce your cousin’s identity. I don’t feel good about her having to hide her identity even after coming home for so many years.\"","Today, Ye Jian was slandered by Mrs. Qin. Old Master Fu’s heart ached so much that it was as though it was bleeding. \"She suffered so much outside and was even criticized by unrelated people. Jinnian, your cousin has suffered too much!\"","Li Jinnian knew the reason why they didn’t acknowledge Ye Jian immediately. Later on, because the Li family kept investigating who killed Li Chuhai, they could only delay it for Ye Jian’s sake. Old Master Fu didn’t even tell his good friends.","Today, he saw Ye Jian being humiliated with his own eyes. Old Master Fu really didn’t want to endure it anymore.","Li Jinnian knew that Old Master Fu was sad, but he couldn’t mess up the arrangements because of a moment of anger.","Li Jinnian helped Old Master Fu to the pavilion. After he sat down, Li Jinnian massaged Old Master Fu’s shoulders and said slowly, \"As long as the Li family is still around, once we acknowledge Ye JIan, she’ll undoubtedly become the Li family’s number one suspect. At that time, with Old Master Li’s connections, it’ll be easy for him to find out anything. Ye Jian will be in harm’s way.","\"When I came back, I received a call from the Li family. A year ago, my father secretly invited a rehabilitation team back from overseas. It’s said that the old master can take a few steps now and speak much more fluently than before. Based on the current situation, he can still last for a few more years.","\"Before we find out who killed Li Chuhai, before we find out if Aunt left any descendants behind, he won’t let himself fall so easily.\"","He was referring to Old Master Li.","Old Master Fu, who was sitting down, frowned slightly. \"He can actually get off the bed? Why didn’t I hear of it?\"","\"You have many things on your plate, and you’re an honorary professor in a university. It’s normal that you don’t know what’s happening outside.\" If it weren’t for Old Master Fu wanting to reveal Ye Jian’s identity, Li Jinnian wouldn’t have told him these things. \"The Li family doesn’t lack money or people. As long as a patient is willing to work hard, there are many cases of patients getting back on their feet.\"","Old Master Fu didn’t say anything else. However, there was a hint of seriousness in his peaceful expression.","There was a buzzing sound from his cell phone. Li Jinnian took out the cell phone he carried with him and looked at the caller ID. There was a faint smile in his cold eyes. \"The son-in-law you like is calling. Do you want to talk to him? My cousin should be by his side.\""]},{"number":5086,"title":"Chapter 5086: Holding Back","paragraphs":["It was that brat from the Xia family!","The serious-looking Old Master Fu immediately smiled. There was no anger in him anymore. \"Hurry up and answer it first. I’ll talk to him after the two of you are done.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t call home directly. Instead, he contacted his grandson first. Old Master Fu thought that there must be something serious, so he waved his hand and asked Li Jinnian to take the call first.","Li Jinnian answered the call and walked away.","He and Xia Jinyuan had known each other for many years. Even though their relationship deepened because of Ye Jian, they rarely contacted each other on their personal phones. No, it should be said that they rarely even had work calls.","Different soldiers had their own things to do. It was hard for them to meet for work and personal matters.","Today, Li Jinnian felt that Xia Jinyuan probably had something serious to say.","Xia Jinyuan, who came out of the military building, was walking toward the cafeteria. It was almost noon. He had been hungry since noon yesterday and urgently needed to fill his hungry stomach.","His stomach needed to be filled, and he needed to ask about serious matters.","The other party picked up the call. When he heard the usual cold voice, Xia Jinyuan wanted to greet his future cousin-in-law first. However, his future cousin-in-law said coldly, \"Cut the crap.\"","\"I heard that Old Master Li is already able to get out of bed. It’s said that he hired a top professional rehabilitation medical team from overseas. Is that true?\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t waste any time and asked directly.","A few minutes ago, he learned this information from his father that when he came out of the building. He immediately contacted the duty room of Storm Commando Brigade. When he found out that his future cousin-in-law was on leave, he hurriedly called his private number.","\"Yes, the information is correct. Li Ronghuan came back from overseas a year and a half ago,\" Li Jinnian replied calmly. \"Three months ago, the old man could already get out of bed and walk. Now, I heard that he can walk more than a hundred meters.\"","More than two years ago, Old Master Li suffered a stroke and was bedridden. He didn’t give up on treatment because of this. With his connections, his eldest son, Li Jinnian’s father, got the top medical team in the country to help Old Master Li recover.","A year and a half ago, Old Master Li’s second son, Li Ronghuan, secretly hired a top rehabilitation team from overseas to treat him. It was not difficult to tell that the Li family was also guarding against the outside world. They did not want the outside world to know that Old Master Li, who had already fallen, could stand up again.","Not only did they hide it from outsiders, but they also hid it from Li Jinnian.","After confirming the news, Xia Jinyuan’s handsome face turned cold. \"It looks like the Li family has been creating a facade for the past two years. They’re hiding and waiting to make a big move.\"","Outsiders might think that the Li family had given up, but in fact, they were just no longer as high-profile as before. Even Du Jiayi’s mother, Madam Li, and Old Master Li’s second wife, Second Old Madam Li, had unknowingly kept a low profile for the past two years. Now, there was very little news about the Li family in the capital city.","Everyone would just say similar things, like, ’Alas, the Li family has already gone downhill. The hero has taken a bow and left,’ or ’Old Master Li suffered a stroke and became paralyzed. It’s like a building has collapsed. There’s no way he can rise again’.","Everyone thought that the Li family had collapsed and could not be compared to the past. Who knew that even though Old Master Li had a stroke, he had survived it?","Even Li Jinnian’s second uncle, Li Ronghuan, who only cared about painting in the past and was quite famous, stayed in the country to serve the Old Master Li for more than a year.","The person Li Jinnian had arranged in the Li family told him that the top rehabilitation medical team that came from overseas was invited by his elusive second uncle."]},{"number":5087,"title":"Chapter 5087: Discussion","paragraphs":["Li Jinnian came back this time because he wanted to see his second uncle, Li Ronghuan, whom he had not seen for 11 years.","What puzzled him was that the outside world didn’t know that his second uncle, Li Ronghuan, had returned to the country. Even the servants in the Li residence didn’t know about it. Moreover, some of the old servants in the Li residence had been sent home for a year or so.","Thinking of his second uncle, Li Jinnian’s cold eyes turned a little serious.","No matter how unwilling he was to return to the Li family, he had to meet Li Ronghuan who was nothing more than a stranger to him.","Li Jinnian looked up at the old man who was resting in the pavilion. He calmly asked into the phone, \"When are you coming?\"","\"I’ll go and visit Grandpa tomorrow.\" Xia Jinyuan knew that his cousin-in-law was asking him where he was. He slipped into the car and didn’t drive immediately. Instead, he sat in the car and asked, \"How much do you know about Li Ronghuan? The Li family is in politics, yet one of their descendants is walking on such a different path. Doesn’t Old Master Li have any objections?\"","\"I don’t know anything about him. We haven’t seen each other for 11 years.\" Li Jinnian had never hidden anything from Xia Jinyuan about the Li family, especially since the Li family was still investigating who killed Li Chuhai. He and Xia Jinyuan had to be wary of the Li family. There was no need to hide anything about the Li family.","Just like now, Xia Jinyuan came to ask him if he had any doubts. As long as Li Jinnian knew anything, he would tell Xia Jinyuan.","\"The Li family’s waters are deep. Outsiders only see the superficial side. I can’t see how deep it is or how many undercurrents there are. I’m from the Li family, so I have reservations about Li Ronghuan.","Xia Jinyuan’s already cold and handsome face suddenly became a little murderous. \"Is there something wrong with Li Ronghuan too?\"","\"I don’t know. If there’s a problem, I’ll tell you.\"","\"Li Ronghuan is famous in the art world, but most of the awards he wins are given overseas. His reputation overseas is far greater than in the country. He’s clean and has no criminal record, so he can come and go freely. If there’s anything wrong with him, it’ll be even more difficult to investigate than Li Chuhai.\"","Li Jinnian would not speak without thinking. There had to be something that aroused his suspicion. It was just that it had not been confirmed yet.","\"If you need anything, please tell me. Jian’s family is my family. I hope that our family will be safe,\" Xia Jinyuan said solemnly.","A smile flashed past Li Jinnian’s cold eyes because of his words. They were a family. The Fu family was his family. Now, with the addition of Little Six from the Xia family, it was not bad.","\"Yes. Come over tomorrow. I’ll return to the Li family’s residence in the afternoon. Contact me if anything happens.\"","\"Be careful,\" Xia Jinyuan reminded him. The Li family... Although his cousin-in-law’s surname was Li, he was really not from the Li family. He only had the surname Li.","However, it was precisely because of this that every time he returned to the Li family’s residence, Xia Jinyuan would think it was inexplicably dangerous. He felt that his cousin-in-law wasn’t returning to his home but to a tiger’s den that could swallow people.","There was the hypocritical Second Old Madam Li, Old Master Li, who dared to kill his own brother and was extremely ruthless, and a father who only cared about his own well-being. It was a miracle that Li Jinnian, who lost his mother when he was young, survived.","Just like his little fox, it was a miracle that the siblings could survive.","Xia Jinyuan then shared a few words with the old man and said that he would come over tomorrow. Xia Jinyuan ended the call while the old man laughed heartily.","The next day, Xia Jinyuan woke up early and planned to drive to Dan Gui Garden. The healthy Old Master Xia was moving the vegetables he planted to the back of the car. There was someone serving him, but Old Master Xia insisted on doing it himself."]},{"number":5088,"title":"Chapter 5088: Old Urchin","paragraphs":["Old Madam Xia was very worried when she saw this.","Xia Jinyuan was going to see Old Master Fu, and Old Master Xia wanted Xia Jinyuan to bring over three small bags of vegetables. Wasn’t he afraid that Xia Jinyuan wouldn’t even be able to enter Old Master Fu’s house?","Old Master Xia didn’t think that there was a problem. He carefully placed the three bags of green vegetables down and reminded Xia Jinyuan, \"Little Six, when you go, you must hand these vegetables to Old Master Fu personally. Tell him that I planted these myself. Do you hear me?\"","Delivering vegetables wasn’t the main point. The main point was that these vegetables were all planted by Old Master Xia.","Xia Jinyuan looked at the three plastic bags that were filled with vegetables. He was in a difficult position. \"You don’t have a lot. Why didn’t you save some for yourself?\"","In response, Old Master Xia punched him. Was Xia Jinyuan mocking him for not knowing how to grow vegetables?","Old Madam Xia felt that her husband was becoming more and more like a child as he got older. She quickly pulled Xia Jinyuan over and stuffed him into the car. \"Why are you dawdling with your grandfather? It’s getting late. Hurry up and visit Old Master Fu. That’s your future wife’s grandpa. If you’re not filial, your wife won’t let you off.\"","After stuffing him into the car, she closed the door with a bang. Old Madam Xia, whose hair was silver-white, was exceptionally healthy.","Xia Jinyuan, who returned to the Xia family’s old residence in the afternoon yesterday, looked at the time. It was a few minutes past six. Was it getting late?","When he went to Dan Gui Garden, Xia Jinyuan came to visit Old Master Fu with three bags of vegetables.","Li Jinnian looked at Xia Jinyuan, who was coming over with three small bags of vegetables. His cold and handsome face twitched slightly. \"You even went to the market?\"","\"Old Master Xia planted these vegetables himself.\" Xia Jinyuan was helpless too. He didn’t want to come here with three small bags of vegetables. \"He specially instructed me to pass them to Grandpa Fu and tell him that my grandfather planted them personally. From digging to fertilizing the plants, he did everything himself.\"","Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian looked at each other. There must be some unspeakable secrets between them.","Old Master Fu was very interested in the three small bags of vegetables that Xia Jinyuan had brought over. He took them personally and sent them to the kitchen. He said to Uncle Fu, who was still making breakfast, \"Cook up a portion this morning. Although the amount is a little small, it’s still considered a successful yield.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who rushed over early in the morning, didn’t eat breakfast. Although Old Master Fu was very happy with his future grandson-in-law, he still criticized him. How could he come over without breakfast? He shouldn’t be left to starve.","At first, he only criticized Xia Jinyuan. However, he remembered that his grandson was a soldier too. Hence, the old man decided to criticize Li Jinnian too.","The two of them only reprimanded people in the military unit. Now, in front of Old Master Fu, they could only be obedient and be his grandsons. They accepted the old man’s criticism humbly and did not dare to refute him at all.","After getting scolded for a few minutes, it was time for breakfast. Uncle Fu, who was busy in the kitchen, looked at the old man a few times. When he saw that Old Master Fu was educating his grandchildren, he appeared so energetic that Uncle Fu laughed in the kitchen for a while before coming out with breakfast.","It was good. The Fu family was really good now. No, it should be said that ever since the princess of the Fu family came back, the Fu family had been getting better and better. Old Master Fu’s body was getting healthier and healthier. It looked like it wouldn’t be a problem for him to live for another ten or twenty years!","Old Master Fu and Old Master Xia were of the same age. If they lived another ten or twenty years, they would be more than a hundred years old!"]},{"number":5089,"title":"Chapter 5089: Happiness Comes After Bitterness","paragraphs":["When Uncle Fu placed the vegetables that Old Master Xia personally grew on the table, Old Master Fu told them the story of the vegetable delivery. It was just a bet between the two of them.","Old Master Fu said that Old Master Xia had been marching and fighting for his entire life, so he had never grown vegetables himself. Life was less fun for him.","Old Master Xia had glared at him. If he didn’t grow vegetables, would his life be less fun? What twisted logic!","Then, Old Master Fu talked about the interesting things he did in the past. Old Master Xia was eager to try, but Old Master Fu shook his head. \"No, no. I’m afraid a boor like you won’t be able to grow vegetables. It’s better not to waste the seeds.\"","Old Master Xia, who didn’t accept it on the surface, remembered it in his heart. Old Master Fu said that he couldn’t grow vegetables, so he insisted on growing them!","From winter to spring, Old Master Xia planted vegetables. It was almost summer now. He finally planted the first vegetables in his life. He took good care of them and even caught insects with his chopsticks.","He didn’t eat the first batch of vegetables that he planted in his life. He quickly harvested them and sent them to Old Master Fu. He used his actions to tell the old man that a boorish person like him could grow vegetables too!","After hearing this story, the coldness on Li Jinnian’s face turned into a warm smile.","After his cousin returned home, the Fu family’s residence was filled with happiness. Old Master Fu’s life was also reborn. Just like now, one could feel his comfortable and hopeful life from his smile.","After breakfast, the two of them accompanied the old man for a walk after dinner. Along the tree-lined path of Dan Gui Garden, the two of them accompanied and took care of him. Old Master Fu smiled until the wrinkles in his eyes deepened.","When Old Master Qin heard this, he smiled and pointed out, \"Good for you, Old Fu. No wonder you didn’t look for me to play chess yesterday. It turns out that Jinnian is back.\"","Looking at Xia Jinyuan at the side, Old Master Qin’s eyes were red. \"Even your future grandson-in-law came back to accompany you. Old Fu, I’m really envious of your life in your later years.\"","The first time Xia Jinyuan brought Ye Jian back to the Xia family, Old Master Qin brought Old Madam Qin to visit the Xia family. After the introduction, Old Master Qin knew that Little Six had a bright and beautiful girlfriend.","Later, when Ye Jian returned to Dan Gui Garden, she met Old Master Qin, who was chatting with Old Master Fu, and the diplomat, Qin Xiu. Hence, Old Master Qin and Qin Xiu knew that Ye Jian was Old Master Fu’s granddaughter. Old Madam Qin also knew.","At this moment, Old Master Qin wasn’t surprised to see Xia Jinyuan here. Instead, he was happy for his old friend.","His hardships had come to an end.","With Old Master Qin’s participation, they couldn’t talk about some topics, such as the Li family. They could talk about the country, social news, and the situation overseas. Every sentence from the two knowledgeable old men made Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian listen carefully.","After walking for a long time, they were about to pass by the Qin family’s door. Old Master Qin had no intention of going home. He said to Old Master Fu, \"Let’s go to your house and play chess.\"","He didn’t enter his house and walked away very quickly. It was obvious that Old Master Qin didn’t want to go home at all.","The Qin family was quite lively now. There was Mrs. Qin, who came to Dan Gui Garden to visit her father-in-law and mother-in-law early in the morning, as well as Madam Li and her daughter, Du Jiayi.","This was Madam Li’s first time at the Qin family’s door. She smiled slightly and looked elegant. Du Jiayi, who was sitting beside her, was even more elegant. She looked like a good daughter raised by a good family.","Unfortunately, they shouldn’t have talked about Ye Jian."]},{"number":5090,"title":"Chapter 5090: Offended","paragraphs":["If Old Madam Qin didn’t know Ye Jian’s identity, she would’ve just listened to the gossip without taking the words to heart. But Old Madam Qin knew that the girl that the sixth son of the Xia family liked was Old Master Fu’s granddaughter, so Li Jinnian, as her elder cousin, naturally liked Ye Jian.","The Qin family and the Fu family had a good relationship. Old Madam Qin knew Li Jinnian’s relationship with the Li family very well. Old Madam Qin was unhappy that her daughter-in-law suddenly brought Madam Li and her daughter to the Qin family’s residence.","At this moment, they were talking about Ye Jian again. She listened to Madam Li and her daughter-in-law echoing each other. Then, she looked at Du Jiayi, who seemed to be speaking up for Ye Jian but was actually adding oil to the flame. However, her daughter-in-law didn’t notice anything. Old Madam Qin was so angry that her fingers were trembling.","\"Alas, the world has really changed. Old Madam, don’t you think that people are too impetuous? They insist on climbing up the ladder by stepping on other people’s shoulders. They even think that they have the ability to make many men bow down to them. Alas, girls still have to respect themselves.\"","When Madam Li talked about family education, she secretly brought the topic to Ye Jian. She frowned and sighed worriedly. \"She was raised by no parents. Although it makes people pity her, she lacks discipline. No matter how smart she is, she’s messy. She’s not upright enough and has lost her innocence.\"","Old Madam Qin was an old lady who had experienced many storms. The Qin family was still able to become a diplomatic family after coming back from overseas. Old Master Qin’s merits could not be extinguished. Even though Old Madam Qin was old and her eyes were not as clear as before, she was open-minded. Madam Li’s action of sowing discord was nothing but child’s play in front of her.","Old Madam Qin, who was sitting at the master seat, didn’t reply. Mrs. Qin, who had specially brought people to Madam Li’s door, was afraid that Madam Li would feel awkward. She smiled elegantly and continued, \"That’s right. Actually, it’s all because she’s not satisfied and doesn’t know her limits. She just thinks that she’s talented and beautiful. No matter how beautiful such a girl is, she’ll only be a flash in the pan. She won’t be able to last long.","\"Jiayi is still the best. She’s outstanding in everything and doesn’t rely on her family. Mom, Jiayi might only be 18 years old, but she entered the Ministry of Foreign Affairs with her own ability.\"","So far, Mrs. Qin still felt that Du Jiayi was better than the ladies she liked.","Old Madam Qin, who didn’t say much, was really angry now. She wasn’t angry at Madam Li for talking nonsense. She was angry that she lost her basic judgment when choosing a daughter-in-law.","There were so many daughters from prestigious families in the capital city, but she kept her eye on the daughter of the Du family!","Madam Du had bewitched her daughter-in-law many times. It had been a few years, but she still wanted to marry her daughter into the Qin family.","How difficult was it for the daughter of the Du family to get married? She knew that Xiu didn’t like her, but she still didn’t give up after so many years! She was already 28 years old. Did she think that she was only 21 or 22 years old and could still be willful?","If it weren’t for the mother and daughter’s visit today, she wouldn’t have known that as it turned out, Xiu liked Old Master Fu’s granddaughter!","Old Master Fu’s granddaughter was clearly a hundred times better than the Du family’s daughter-in-law. Not only did Madam Li not like Ye Jian, but she also kept saying that Old Master Fu’s granddaughter only had a pretty face and was trying to climb up the social ladder.","Old Madam Qin hadn’t been this angry in so many years!"]},{"number":5091,"title":"Chapter 5091: A Slap In The Face","paragraphs":["Suppressing her anger, Old Madam Qin didn’t let the juniors see it. She was already old. She wouldn’t let outsiders laugh at her.","Du Jiayi, who had lowered her head shyly after being praised by Madam Qin, heaved a sigh of relief. Today, she was suddenly informed of this visit, and her heart was in a mess.","Now, she could finally heave a sigh of relief.","Old Madam Qin looked at her with a kind gaze. She was probably very satisfied judging from the smile on her face. Old Madam Qin must have a good impression of her.","Du Jiayi heaved a sigh of relief and thought about it slowly. Her posture became even more dignified.","Madam Li had always been strict and careful in cultivating Du Jiayi’s manners. She believed that a person’s manners could be seen at a glance from the quality of their family’s conditions and were the face of the family. If one did not even have the right manners, they would never be able to go far.","That was the truth. It was hard to be elegant even if one didn’t have a good bearing.","She was raised by Second Old Madam Li. Madam Li had the bearing of a rich lady, and so did her daughter. However, no matter how good their bearings were, it couldn’t hide the malice in their hearts.","Especially when they felt that someone was hindering their future, they would definitely think of ways to get rid of them. This was taught to Madam Li by Second Old Madam Li, and Madam Li taught it to Du Jiayi.","It was every man for himself. It was normal to seek things for oneself. However, it was ’evil’ to do things according to one’s preferences without distinguishing right or wrong.","From the mother and daughter, Old Madam Qin could clearly see their malice toward Ye Jian.","They weren’t allowed to criticize Old Master Fu’s granddaughter!","Old Madam Qin slowly took a sip of the nourishing flower tea. She had been smiling kindly all this while. She sighed and said, \"Now that I’m old, I hate talking about things that require me to spend time guessing. You said that Xiu has a lady he likes. I have to thank you. If not, as his grandma, I wouldn’t have known that my grandson has a lady he likes.\"","A cold look flashed past Du Jiayi’s eyes. Of course, Qin Xiu wouldn’t say it because he didn’t dare to.","The old madam was from a famous family. How could she allow her granddaughter-in-law to be a wild woman from an unknown background? Not to mention that she was involved with several men.","Madam Li and Mrs. Qin looked at each other secretly. Mrs. Qin smiled back, but for some reason, Madam Li’s heart was in a mess.","Then, she looked at Old Madam Qin, who was smiling slightly. She couldn’t tell what she was thinking at all. Madam Li couldn’t help but tighten her grip. She felt a heavy weight on her heart that seemed to restrict her breathing.","\"Madam Li, I have to say a few words to you today. Please don’t mind me.\"","\"It’s my honor to be able to receive your guidance.\" The uneasiness in her heart spread like waves.","Old Madam Qin smiled faintly. \"No matter what, she’s still the apple of other people’s eyes. As outsiders, you can’t criticize her like that.","\"Your daughter is precious, and so is the daughter of another family. Her family background might not be better than the Du family’s, but other people don’t care about family background. They only want to live comfortably. Why do you have to step on the daughter of another family to highlight your daughter’s advantages? After all, you came from a good family. It’s really inferior of you to be behaving like this.\"","Madam Li jumped up in shock. Fortunately, she didn’t lose her composure on the spot. She could barely maintain her expression."]},{"number":5092,"title":"Chapter 5092: Another Slap In The Face","paragraphs":["However, Du Jiayi, who was sitting at the side, could not keep it together. Her expression was sour, and her face paled.","Old Madam Qin... Old Madam Qin was basically saying that her family was uneducated and randomly criticized others!","It was clearly the truth.","Du Jiayi, who was shocked and flustered, stabilized herself and did not explain immediately. If she rashly interrupted Old Madam Qin again, she would really be impolite.","\"Yu, as the daughter-in-law of the Qin family, please pay more attention when you’re outside. As your mother-in-law, I have to say something in front of you today. No matter how true the words of others sound, they might not be true. You have to think about them.","\"If you don’t even have the ability to distinguish right from wrong, you should rest at home quietly in the future and let your husband and son take care of you.\"","Ever since Mrs. Qin married into the Qin family, she had always had a say in front of Old Madam Qin. Sometimes, when Old Madam Qin had any problems, she would ask Mrs. Qin if she had any good ideas to solve them. Compared to the two sisters-in-law who had always been in other provinces, Old Madam Qin liked her more.","Even if Mrs. Qin made mistakes sometimes, Old Madam Qin would never say anything harsh. She would only tell Mrs. Qin what she did wrong and how to change it.","Today, Old Madam Qin asked Mrs. Qin to rest at home and not go out much in front of outsiders. Mrs. Qin, who had never been reprimanded by her mother-in-law, instantly felt her blood turn cold and her limbs stiffen.","\"Mom, I...\" Mrs. Qin wanted to explain, but even her tongue felt stiff.","Old Madam Qin didn’t need her daughter-in-law’s explanation. She waved her hand tiredly. \"Alright, I know what you’re thinking. There are guests here. Treat them well. Stay for some food. I’ll go out for a walk.\"","After saying that, Old Madam Qin slowly stood up.","When Madam Li saw this, her heart dropped. Everything was going wrong today!","It wasn’t because Old Madam Qin didn’t care about Qin Xiu, nor that she didn’t care about the girl’s family background. Old Madam Qin had already been feeling dissatisfied with Madam Qin!","Mrs. Qin invited them to see Old Madam Qin, but she had other plans.","She wanted to use the mother and daughter to let Old Madam Qin know what kind of person Ye Jian was. Then, Old Madam Qin would appear and put an end to Qin Xiu’s feelings for Ye Jian!","Madam Li was also embarrassed and angry. She had always been the one using people. She didn’t expect her to become Mrs. Qin’s tool today.","She could only blame herself for being too anxious. She had never interacted with Old Madam Qin before, which led to today’s matter.","In the past, Old Madam Qin, the ’Iron Lady’, was indeed impressive. Just the two of them talking bad about Ye Jian gave Old Madam Qin a chance to teach Mrs. Qin a lesson. It also brought shame to Madam Li and Du Jiayi.","Madam Li would no longer have a chance to appease Old Madam Qin!","At this moment, Madam Li knew that her daughter had made a mistake in wanting to marry into the Qin family. She even made Old Madam Qin think that they were uneducated and only knew how to talk bad about others.","Since Madam Li could think of this, Du Jiayi, who was always smart and scheming, knew it too. Her expression was still sour, but she was even calmer now.","Seeing that Old Madam Qin was slowly walking out with the help of the servants, Du Jiayi gritted her teeth and suddenly stood up to walk toward Old Madam Qin. \"Grandma Qin, please wait.\"","She quickly ran to Old Madam Qin. Under Old Madam Qin’s indifferent gaze, Du Jiayi bowed deeply.","Seeing this, Madam Li heaved a sigh of relief."]},{"number":5093,"title":"Chapter 5093: Never Entangle","paragraphs":["Mrs. Qin wanted to make use of Madam Li and Du Jiayi to achieve her goal of asking Old Madam Qin to step in. Madam Li’s heart ached for her daughter, who would not marry anyone but Qin Xiu. She lost her judgment and fell into Mrs. Qin’s trap.","This was her fault. She couldn’t blame anyone. Mrs. Qin’s ultimate goal was to let Old Madam Qin know how bad Qin Xiu’s taste was. With Jiayi as a comparison, Old Madam Qin would definitely accept Jiayi and persuade Qin Xiu to accept Jiayi.","Hence, she had no right to blame Mrs. Qin. She could only accept it.","In order to let her daughter get what she wanted, she accepted it.","She admitted that Mrs. Qin had set her up, but she couldn’t accept that Old Madam Qin felt that her daughter was bad.","Jiayi had been smart since she was young and was liked by her elders. She was talented and had good wits. If she married into the family, she would definitely be a good wife. She wouldn’t drag Qin Xiu down.","Hence, Madam Li couldn’t let Old Madam Qin think that her daughter was bad.","Madam Li was still thinking about how to make up for it when her daughter suddenly stood up. She knew that her daughter had a solution.","Madam Li had always been confident in Du Jiayi.","A few years ago, she was still a little indecisive. Over the years, she had restrained herself a lot, especially after entering the Ministry of Foreign Affairs. She had become more mature. Even if something big happened, she wouldn’t show it on her face immediately.","Since her daughter dared to stop Old Madam Qin, she naturally had a good plan.","Du Jiayi, who had blocked Old Madam Qin’s path, did not panic at all. She stood there like a blooming flower, beautiful and generous.","She bent down deeply and slowly got up. She thanked Old Madam Qin sincerely, \"Grandma Qin, I understand what I did wrong. Thank you for your guidance. I won’t make similar mistakes in the future.","\"Although I’m in the wrong, everything I said was true. Please investigate it clearly, Old Madam.\"","This was a life and death situation.","For a lady to admit her mistake on their first meeting, Old Madam Qin couldn’t help but think highly of Du Jiayi.","However, she only admitted that she had made a mistake. She didn’t know what her real mistake was.","Old Madam Qin had never thought of pointing it out bit by bit. It was another family’s matter and another family’s child. How could an outsider like her point it out?","\"You...\" Old Madam Qin smiled and sighed. \"I know that you’re a good person. Hurry up and go back to accompany your mother. As for you and Xiu, marriage depends on fate. You’ve already done enough for XIu. I know that, but you’re just not fated.","\"Good child. Ziu, is not worth your effort or waiting for. You can find a boyfriend who’s a hundred times better than Xiu. Live your life well in the future. Don’t continue waiting for someone who’s not worth waiting for. You’re still young.\"","With that, Old Madam Qin smiled and slowly walked past Du Jiayi.","Since she had already said so much, she wouldn’t say any more.","\"Thank you for your reminder, Grandma Qin. I understand.\" Du Jiayi took a deep breath and turned her body to the side. She lowered her head slightly as she watched Old Madam Qin leave respectfully.","As she passed by, Old Madam Qin said, \"What a good child.\" Then, she was helped by the servants and slowly walked toward the door. However, as she passed by, she glanced at Du Jiayi’s naturally lowered hands. She saw Du Jiayi secretly clenching her fists and heard her taking deep breaths. Old Madam Qin shook her head and sighed in her heart.","She was a good child. She was beautiful and smart, but she had evil intentions, which ruined her foundation. It was really a pity."]},{"number":5094,"title":"Chapter 5094: Crazy Obsession","paragraphs":["After Old Madam Qin left, the living room instantly became exceptionally cold. Du Jiayi sat back on the couch and said softly, \"Aunt, my mother and I will come and visit Grandpa and Grandma Qin next time. I’m sure you’ll have to stay and accompany the two elders later. I won’t be accompanying you shopping in the afternoon.\"","The original plan was to have lunch at the Qin family’s residence and go out for a walk in the afternoon.","At this point, she wasn’t in the mood to go out and shop in the afternoon.","Madam Li’s heart ached. No matter how angry she was, she could only suppress it. Hearing that, she calmed herself down and said, \"Yu, accompany the old madam well. The old madam is getting old and doesn’t care much anymore. Naturally, she thinks that everything is good.","\"Today, I was the bad guy again. For Jiayi and Xiu’s sake, I threw away my dignity. I only hate myself for not being able to speak and not persuading the old madam.","\"I think the old madam is a little angry that I was talking so much. You’re the old madam’s daughter-in-law. Help me apologize to the old madam and chat with her for a while.","\"I believe the old madam understands. It’s just that she won’t be able to understand it in a short period of time. She has to slowly accept it.\"","Her daughter even went to apologize to the old madam and said that she would visit the two elders next time. It could be seen that even at this point, her daughter still hadn’t given up on Qin Xiu.","Hence, Madam Li didn’t want to give up on Qin Xiu, her future son-in-law, either!","The mother and daughter took turns persuading Mrs. Qin and comforting her. Finally, Mrs. Qin’s expression improved a little. She held Madam Li’s hand and said sincerely, \"You know how much I like Jiayi. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have brought Jiayi to visit the two elders. It’s my fault today. I thought that the two children were not young anymore and should hurry to get together. Who knew that the old madam... Alas!\"","That was right. If not for her goal, Madam Li wouldn’t have let today’s matter slide.","\"It’s all for the sake of our children. I understand. Go accompany the old madam. Jiayi and I will go back first.\" Madam Li held Mrs. Qin’s hand too. For her daughter’s sake, she had to bear with it.","Mrs. Qin was too embarrassed to stay. Her expression was still bad, but could she leave? Of course not! She had to stay and accompany the old madam.","After sending the mother and daughter off, Mrs. Qin adjusted her emotions and went out to look for Old Madam Qin.","After leaving Dan Gui Garden and getting into the car, Madam Li’s expression turned completely cold. \"Jiayi, did you hear what Old Madam Qin said? Old Madam Qin asked you to give up. What do you think? Do you want to continue or give up?\"","Du Jiayi’s eyes turned red. Her voice trembled until she lost control. \"Mom, how can I give up? Do you think I can give up? I fell in love with Qin Xiu at 21 years old. I’m 28 years old this year!","\"I’ve liked him for seven years. Do you think I can give up? I can’t accept it! I can’t accept it! How much have I sacrificed for him? I retired from the army and tried my best to enter the Ministry of Foreign Affairs. I tried my best to get close to him and follow him everywhere. But he doesn’t care about me at all! He doesn’t care about me at all!","\"I want to give up. I really want to give up. But every time I think about the hard work I’ve put in in the past seven years, I can’t accept it. I’m unwilling!","\"Ye Jian didn’t do anything. Why does Qin Xiu like her? Why does everyone like her? What’s so good about her? What’s so good about her? How does she get everyone to like her?\"","Her sobbing questions made Madam Li’s heart ache. She reached out her hands and hugged her daughter, who was crying loudly. Her heart ached as she coaxed her, \"Don’t cry, don’t cry. It’s not your fault. Qin Xiu just failed to see how good you are. Jiayi, you’ve done well enough. You’ve really done well enough!\"","It wasn’t that her daughter was bad, but someone was hindering her daughter’s happiness. Madam Li’s eyes gradually darkened."]},{"number":5095,"title":"Chapter 5095: Not Acknowledging","paragraphs":["One of the most painful things in the world was obsession. If you were too persistent, you would suffer the most. However, if you pushed all the problems to other people and thought that everything was because of other people, you wouldn’t be able to get what you wanted. This obsession wasn’t called obsession. It was destruction.","Du Jiayi was still persevering in the face of her goal. Madam Li played a huge role in attaining this goal for her.","Du Jiayi was used to getting what she wanted. She was even more used to using all means to get what she wanted. When she hit a dead end one day and realized that things were out of her control, the first thing Du Jiayi would do was not reflect on herself but take revenge crazily.","Facing Madam Li’s comfort, Du Jiayi raised her hand to wipe the tears off her face. She restrained her expression and pretended that her shouting just now had never happened. \"Mom, have I really done well enough? But why does Qin Xiu still like Ye Jian? Do you think... Do you think everything will be better without her? Will it? Will it?","There was a twisted persistence in her voice.","Madam Li’s heart ached as she hugged Du Jiayi tightly. She said slowly, word by word, \"Don’t think too much. I said that you’ve done very well. It’s just that Qin Xiu didn’t see that. Jiayi, I know Qin Xiu is very good, but I want to see you be well even more.","\"You’ve worked hard and made many sacrifices. I know that, and your Aunt Qin knows it too. However, Old Madam Qin is right. You and Qin Xiu aren’t fated.\"","It was not just Du Jiayi who liked Qin Xiu. He was also the best son-in-law candidate that Madam Li liked. His character and family background were top-notch. In addition, Qin Xiu was extremely outstanding. As long as there was a daughter who was suitable to marry into the Qin family and knew the Qin family, everyone wanted to do so.","In addition, Madam Qin was more active and would attend some gatherings in the upper class from time to time. It could be said that Qin Xiu was much more popular than Xia Jinyuan.","Despite Qin Xiu being such a good candidate, Madam Li asked her daughter, Du Jiayi, to give up. She couldn’t bear to see her daughter continue to waste time and suffer.","Also, Old Madam Qin’s attitude made Madam Li know how difficult it was for her daughter to marry into the Qin family. Even if Mrs. Qin agreed, as long as Qin Xiu didn’t agree, Old Madam Qin would definitely stand on Qin Xiu’s side and not force him to lower his head.","Realizing that Mrs.. Qin didn’t have full control in Qin Xiu’s marriage, Madam Li knew that it would be difficult for her to continue. Now that she saw that Old Madam Qin was clearly on Qin Xiu’s side and wouldn’t help them, Madam Li knew that it would be useless even if she insisted.","Since things had come to this, she didn’t want her daughter to continue suffering. It had been seven years. It had been long enough. Since they weren’t fated, she should let go.","It was easy to say, but it was too difficult to do.","Especially someone like Du Jiayi, who had become morbidly persistent as she couldn’t get what she wanted. If she gave up now, it would undoubtedly be worse than killing her.","\"Mom, do you mean that I should give Qin Xiu to Ye Jian?\" Du Jiayi smiled. Her smile was so cold that it was sinister. \"I can admit my loss if I were facing someone just as good as me. But I won’t admit that I lost to Ye Jian. I won’t admit it.\"","Not to mention Du Jiayi, even Madam Li didn’t want to admit that.","Her daughter was outstanding in every aspect. She had talent, looks, and a good family background. Madam Li couldn’t accept that she was inferior to a girl from the mountains who only wanted to climb up the social ladder.","How could her daughter, whom she had painstakingly groomed, be inferior to a wild girl?!"]},{"number":5096,"title":"Chapter 5096: Scheme","paragraphs":["Madam Li would not admit that her daughter had lost, just like Du Jiayi.","Their pride would never allow them to lower their heads and admit defeat.","Madam Li didn’t think that Ye Jian would win just because her daughter lost.","Madam Li let go of her arm and held Du Jiayi’s hand with one hand. Seeing that her daughter’s eyes were red from crying, Madam Li, whose heart ached for her daughter, perked up and persuaded her in a low voice, \"Ye Jian and Qin Xiu are not together. Jiayi, you didn’t lose. I didn’t ask you to give Qin Xiu to Ye Jian. Mrs. Qin has a lot of opinions about Ye Jian. She will never agree to Ye Jian marrying into the Qin family and becoming her daughter-in-law.","\"Although Old Madam Qin supports Qin Xiu, with what we said today, it’s impossible for her not to take it to heart. She’ll definitely investigate secretly.","\"As long as the old madam investigates and knows what kind of person Ye Jian is, no matter how much Qin Xiu likes her, the old madam won’t agree.","\"That’s why you didn’t lose to Ye Jian. Ye Jian will never be able to beat you. I won’t give her a chance to beat you.\"","Wouldn’t give Ye Jian a chance to beat her?","Du Jiayi stared at Madam Li, who had always been her backer. Then, she looked down at her hands. It was the same as when she was wronged when she was young. It was these hands that persevered and never changed.","\"Mom, as long as Qin Xiu likes Ye Jian, Ye Jian will beat me. As long as she’s still fine, she will beat me.\" Du Jiayi slowly raised her gaze and looked at Madam Li. \"Mom, where did she come from? Can we send her back?\"","She couldn’t get Qin Xiu because Qin Xiu liked Ye Jian. He liked her so much that he didn’t give her a single chance.","Although she had never heard Qin Xiu admit that he liked Ye Jian and had never seen the two of them really together, her heart was pricked. It was now dripping with blood. Every time she thought about how the man she liked for seven years liked a woman she looked down on and who was not worthy of Qin Xiu’s love, her heart would always hurt...","Now, they were telling her that she and Qin Xiu were not fated and could not get together. Fine, she would accept it! But before she accepted it, she had to pull out the thorn in her heart. Only by pulling it out could she live a good life and find a boyfriend who was a hundred times better than Qin Xiu.","Madam Li took a long time to answer her daughter’s calm request, \"Okay!\"","Ye Jian had already graduated. Ever since Madam Li knew that there was such a girl in Ye Zhifan’s family, she didn’t expect her to become an obstacle to her daughter’s happiness!","If she had known that Ye Jian would be a hidden danger, she would have settled it with Ye Zhifan and his family back then.","Although it was a little difficult to send her back to where she came from... as long as she thought of a way, it was not impossible to plan properly.","The car drove steadily. Madam Li, who was sitting quietly, had already started to plan in her heart.","Seeing this, Du Jiayi tilted her head and looked at the scenery outside the car. A cold smile appeared on her face. ’Ye Jian, you want to compete with me? Are you qualified?","’Don’t think that you can’t do anything to me just because you have Qin Xiu, Xia Jinyuan, and Li Jinnian protecting you. An orphan wants to reach the top in one step?","’Heh, dream on!’","At the Fu family’s residence in Dan Gui Garden, Old Madam Qin heard her husband’s laughter the moment she entered. \"One of you is from the navy while the other is from the army. You’re just short of someone in the air force. Why don’t you let Jian go to the air force? Then, you’ll have all three.\""]},{"number":5097,"title":"Chapter 5097: Fleeing","paragraphs":["At first, Old Madam Qin wanted to pull Old Master Qin back and nag at him. Unexpectedly, when she came in, she saw Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian. Old Madam Qin, who had something on her mind, sat down and chatted with them with a smile.","Li Jinnian had a dull personality and only knew how to tell the truth. However, every time he talked about serious matters, he would hit the nail on the head. He was very insightful. Even if his personality was dull, he wouldn’t make people feel bored. Instead, they got a sense of security from him.","Xia Jinyuan was different. He had been a demon incarnate since he was young. He could speak well and had outstanding insights. Every time he spoke, the three elders would listen quietly and nod in agreement from time to time.","In the end, Old Madam Qin smiled at Old Master Fu and said, \"You’re really living a good life. Your grandson and granddaughter are promising, and your future grandson-in-law is also a top talent. Are you laughing in your dreams?\"","Old Master Fu had gone through so many hardships before getting to where he was today.","He came from a wealthy family. When he was young, he had many servants serving him. When he was middle-aged, he lost his son and wife consecutively. In his later years, he only felt better when Ye Jian came back.","Old Master Fu was smiling. His voice was old but powerful. One could tell that he was a strong old man. \"It’s all thanks to them. If not, I wouldn’t be sitting here chatting. I would’ve already been lying in my grave.\"","At the mention of this, Li Jinnian and Xia Jinyuan panicked. Li Jinnian said in a low voice, \"Your better days lie ahead.\"","\"Of course. I still want to hug my great-grandchildren.\" When the old man mentioned his great-grandchildren, the three elderly started chatting about their great-grandchildren.","Old Madam Qin and Old Master Qin already had grandchildren. However, they didn’t have great-grandchildren. The grandson they doted on the most, Qin Xiu, didn’t even have a girlfriend. When were they going to get to hug their great-grandchild?","Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian couldn’t interrupt this topic. Li Jinnian used the excuse that he needed to go back to the Li family’s residence to take a look and left. He left the matter of getting married and having children to Xia Jinyuan alone.","As someone who was anxious to marry Ye Jian, he should like this topic.","Li Jinnian was in a hurry to leave, so Xia Jinyuan stood up naturally. He said that he would send him off.","Yes, it was very important to send Li Jinnian out!","Giving Old Master Fu a great-grandchild... Alas, how could he give birth to a child when he was still a virgin?","The three elders couldn’t help but shake their heads when they saw that the two young people were about to escape. Just as the two young people were about to leave, Old Madam Qin suddenly exclaimed and stood up with her hands on her legs. \"I have something to tell Jinnian. I almost forgot.\"","Old Master Fu immediately raised her voice and shouted at the two people who ran away to come back. His two grandsons came back obediently. Xia Jinyuan even whispered, \"From the sound of it, it won’t be a problem for the old man to live another 100 years.\"","\"Do you want that to happen?\" Li Jinnian asked coldly. Xia Jinyuan choked. He really didn’t want to!","\"Then living for another 20 years won’t be a problem!\" He had to turn the tables for himself.","Li Jinnian didn’t argue back. He hoped so too.","They supported Old Madam Qin until they left the courtyard. The old madam smiled at Xia Jinyuan. \"Have you and Jian been doing well recently? Although you’re both in the military unit, it must be rare to see each other.\"","When Ye Jian was suddenly mentioned, the two of them immediately remembered Mrs. Qin’s complaints in front of the old man yesterday. Their expressions turned cold. They vaguely felt that the old madam wanted to talk to them about Ye Jian."]},{"number":5098,"title":"Chapter 5098: Dislike","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan smiled politely and replied, \"Thank you for your concern, Grandma Qin. Jian and I are doing very well. I just called her a while ago.\"","\"That’s good. That’s good. Jian has suffered a lot. You have to treat her well. Although I’m not Jian’s biological grandma, I have a good relationship with your grandma. If you bully Jian, I won’t let you off easily.\"","Alas, it was not fated. Xiu liked Jian, but Jian and the Xia family’s boy were together. No matter how much Xiu liked her, it was too late.","Xia Jinyuan repeatedly said, \"I wouldn’t dare.\" Then, he talked about how Ye Jian graduated from the military school last year and went to work in the military unit. Old Madam Qin nodded when she heard that. \"That’s good, that’s good. Jian is not bad. She can establish herself wherever she goes. She’s not like what some people say. Those words are just infuriating.\"","It was here! Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian looked at Old Madam Qin, who was in the middle. Their handsome faces were a little serious as they prepared to listen to what Old Madam Qin would say next.","\"Today, Staff Officer Du’s wife and daughter came to visit me. They were brought over by my daughter-in-law. They mentioned Jian. The mother and daughter don’t know about Jian’s relationship with you and said many unpleasant things about Jian.\"","Old Madam Qin was not familiar with the Du family and the Li family. She was a little familiar with the Li family, but she had never interacted with the Du family before. This time, Madam Li brought her daughter, Du Jiayi, to the Qin family’s residence to talk bad about Ye Jian. How could Old Madam Qin hide it?","Coupled with Second Old Madam Li’s actions and the things she did when she was young, Old Madam Qin did not have a good impression of the children she gave birth to.","Madam Li thought that she really came from a wealthy family. But in the eyes of the older generation, she would always be an illegitimate daughter.","Now, she even ran over to speak to Old Madm Qin. She was courting death.","\"I don’t think this mother and daughter are easy to deal with. The daughter looks dignified and rich, but her thoughts are too complicated, and she has lost her purity. She’s just like her grandmother.\"","When she was young, Second Old Madam Li successfully entered the Li family with her pretty and energetic appearance. She climbed into Old Master Li’s bed and angered the first madam until she passed away.","Du Jiayi’s sudden appearance reminded Old Madam Qin of the past. She became vigilant against Du Jiayi, who was flexible.","The mother and daughter who left Dan Gui Garden never thought that the biggest obstacle that made it impossible for Du Jiayi to marry into the Qin family was not Ye Jian but Old Madam Qin.","\"The mother and daughter think that Qin Xiu likes Jian, so they personally came to me and said a lot. The two of them hate Jian, and Staff Officer Du wields real power. I’m afraid that they’ll follow in Second Old Madam Li’s steps and play dirty. Remind Jian and tell her to be careful. She shouldn’t let anyone take advantage of her.\"","How could Old Madam Qin be fooled by Du Jiayi’s little tricks? The more Du Jiayi acted like that, the more Old Madam Qin felt that the mother and daughter were scheming. She had to be wary.","Otherwise, with her status, she wouldn’t have said such things.","The two of them remembered Old Madam Qin’s words. Before Li Jinnian ended his vacation, Xia Jinyuan called him and told him that someone was investigating Ye Jian.","Li Jinnian, who had returned to the Li family’s residence four days ago, stood by the window with a cold gaze. When he came back, Old Master Li immediately sat in the wheelchair and looked after the plants. He even taught his second wife how to trim the plants.","They had been putting on a good show. The handsome Li Jinnian asked calmly, \"Are you using the Du family’s connections or the Li family’s connections?\""]},{"number":5099,"title":"Chapter 5099: Generation After Generation","paragraphs":["There was a huge difference between using the Li family’s connections and the Du family’s.","If they used the Du family’s connections, it meant that Staff Officer Du was involved and was supporting his wife and daughter. If they used the Li family’s connections, it was very likely that Staff Officer Du didn’t know what Madam Li had done.","Xia Jinyuan, who had already returned to the military unit, smiled slightly. \"It’s the Li family’s connections. Staff Officer Du has been very strict with his wife ever since Li Chuhai’s accident. He even reminded his subordinates not to carry out Madam Li’s orders. Madam Li is quite familiar with the Li family’s connections. How could your Old Master Li agree to it?\"","Li Jinnian retracted his gaze from the window and pulled the curtain closed. He sat back under the window. He was sitting on the casual single couch that was usually used for reading. His straight and slender legs were crossed casually. There was a hint of laziness in his cold aura. \"Someone has to come forward to continue investigating Li Chuhai’s death. How can someone pretending to be paralyzed at home come forward?\"","\"That’s true. They need to push out someone reliable and reassuring. Madam Li is indeed the best candidate.\" Xia Jinyuan smiled coldly. The Li family was starting to move again. The more moves they made, the faster they would lose. \"What about your second uncle? Is there a problem?\"","At the mention of Li Ronghuan, Li Jinnian’s cold face turned murderous. \"Li Ronghuan needs to be investigated. There’s something wrong with him.\"","Xia Jinyuan sighed. \"Are all the people in your Li family freaks? Why do they have to test the law instead of being good people?\" It seemed like he was being too vague. He quickly added, \"You’re the only one who hasn’t gone astray. Old Master Fu taught you well!\"","Li Jinnian’s eyes were cold as he snorted. Xia Jinyuan pretended not to hear him and said, \"You say there’s something wrong with Li Ronghuan too? How do you know when you’ve only been home for a few days? He’s overseas all year round and doesn’t live in the country much. It’s difficult to investigate him. Also, you can’t investigate him just because you think that there’s something wrong with him. You need a reason.\"","Xia Jinyuan cursed in his heart for a while. The Li family used to be warlords, so they were ruthless.","It was still the same now. Could it be that their way of doing things was inherited?","Would it be like this generation after generation?","Fortunately, Li Jinnian stayed in school when he was in junior high. Later, Old Master Fu raised him personally, so he became the white sheep of the Li family.","Li Jinnian said calmly, \"His three students in the country are unknown, but the highest price for a painting can go up to eight figures. Start with the price.\"","After Li Jinnian finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan frowned. \"Do you suspect that he has been laundering money?\" He didn’t expect Li Ronghuan, who was always thought to be the least like the Li family, to be so ruthless!","A painter! Who would suspect that there was something wrong with a famous painter?","After being away for so many years, how much money had he laundered? How much money had he laundered in the country?","A cold look flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s dark eyes. \"Do you have any clues to file a case?\"","There was no way to deal with money-laundering overseas, but it was possible if the money was laundered in the country!","\"How do you plan to investigate Li Ronghuan?\" Xia Jinyuan asked again.","He had to ask clearly. The person the Li family wanted to deal with was Ye Jian, even though the Li family had yet to find out who killed Li Chuhai.","Li Jinnian’s expression turned colder. \"I don’t have a plan.\""]},{"number":5100,"title":"Chapter 5100: Ruthless Person","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan took a deep breath and replied firmly.","However, he also had clues on his side. If he strung them together, there might be a new breakthrough.","\"The company that Li Chuhai returned to the country to accept is currently in the liquidation period. They’re applying for bankruptcy. The person who handled it was Li Yuan. If they apply for bankruptcy and liquidate all the information, they can also launder money secretly.\"","Old Master Li wanted to find out who killed Li Chuhai. He had already started investigating what happened more than 20 years ago. Even Ye Jian’s mother, Sun Xueqing, was included in his investigation.","Fortunately, Commander Xia was a step faster and erased all traces in advance. In addition, Li Chuhai had also purposely erased Sun Xueqing’s traces back then. As a result, although Old Master Li already had his suspicions, he still couldn’t find any clues. He didn’t know who the soldier was that year.","In addition, Old Master Li had a stroke, and Staff Officer Du was implicated because of Madam Li. The two families were dealt with a blow, so they had no choice but to behave.","They had been obedient for less than three years. Now with Li Ronghuan returning to the country frequently, they started acting again.","This time, their actions were much bigger than before!","The two of them exchanged information. Outside, Old Master Li, who was pretending to guide his wife to trim the flowers, said with a dark expression, \"Why hasn’t he left? Ronghuan will be back in the afternoon. Think of a way to get him out as soon as possible!\"","Ronghuan, the son of Old Master Li’s original wife, had become Old Master Li’s most trusted son.","As for his eldest son’s family, if it wasn’t for the fact that his second wife was introduced by his stepmother, Old Master Li wouldn’t even want to acknowledge him.","Old Master Li didn’t want his eldest son, who didn’t take his younger brother seriously and didn’t help him at all, to enter the house!","Second Old Madam Li, who was holding a pair of scissors in her hand, cut off a leaf with a click. She looked at the second floor with deep disgust in her eyes.","She had always known how to pretend. She had been pretending for her entire life. She clearly hated it, but in the blink of an eye, she could pretend to be kind and magnanimous. \"If Jinnian wants to come back to stay, as his grandmother, how can I stop him?","\"Old Master, the most important thing for you now is to relax and recuperate. Although Ronghuan is back, he’s not my biological son. Also, Old Master, you might not like to hear this, but Ronghuan is too gloomy. I don’t dare to talk to him. I feel that Ronghuan is still blaming me for past incidents.","\"Old Master, you got Ronghuan to investigate Chuhai’s matter, but... why do I feel so uneasy?\" How could Second Old Madam Li feel at ease letting the first wife’s son, whom she had tormented before, investigate her son’s murder?","However, Old Master Li didn’t think much of it and replied firmly, \"Don’t worry, it’s most suitable to leave it to Ronghuan. Alright, don’t worry about it. You should think of a way...\"","Before he could finish speaking, the servants at home ran over. Li Jinnian, who had ended his call, stood up and saw Old Master Li, who was pretending to trim flowers and plants, being pushed back into the house by the servants.","Li Jinnian looked at his luggage that was already packed and placed at the end of the bed. It was just a small navy blue luggage. He picked it up and left.","Before he went downstairs, he heard an unfamiliar voice. \"Why is he sitting in a wheelchair at home? Madam, don’t you know how to take care of him? Do you want me to hire a few good nurses to take care of him instead?\"","This voice was a little casual and rude. It was also a little arrogant.","Li Jinnian stopped in his tracks."]}]);
